<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Kessa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kessa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kessa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kessa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kessa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Kessa maxaafay yootizayssi Isra7eele asay aylleteththan de7ida Gibxe biittafe kezida hanotaa gishshassa. Hayssa maxaafaas heedzdzu waanna waanna qofati deettes.</para>
  <para style="ili">1. Ibraaweti aylleteththafe kezidayssanne Siina Zuma istti bida buussaa gishshas yootees. (1-13)</para>
  <para style="ili">2. Xoossi ba asaara caaqo caaqettidayssa, iitanne lo7o shaakkidi erisiza wogata, asay aqiza wogatanne ammano wogata izi isttas immidayssa yootees. (14-18)</para>
  <para style="ili">3. Isra7eele asaas, qeeseta oososinne Xoossas goynniza goynos imettida wogata gishshas yootees. (19-40)</para>
  <para style="ip">Ubbaafe aaththidi hayssi maxaafay Xoossi aylleteththan diza ba asaa kessi simmidi, istti sinththafe yaana yeletaas hidotay diza asa gidana mala izi istta wostti ooththidaakko yootees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha maxaafaan dariza bagga taarikeza godaa gididi shiiqida asi ba asaa Gibxeppe kessana mala, Xoossi doorida Muse Maxaafa giddon daroppe erettida shemppoy tammu azazoti xaafettida nam7u tammanththo shemppoza.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Isra7eele asay Gibxe aylleteththafe la7a kes <char style="ior"><ref loc="EXO 1:1-15:21">1:1—15:21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Gibxen aylleteth <char style="ior"><ref loc="EXO 1:1-22">1:1-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Muse yeleteththinne iza dich <char style="ior"><ref loc="EXO 2:1-4:31">2:1—4:31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Museynne Aarooney Paaroone sinththan <char style="ior"><ref loc="EXO 5:1-11:10">5:1—11:10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Paaziganne Gibxeppe kes <char style="ior"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-15:21">12:1—15:21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Zo7o abbafe biidi Siina zuma gakkanaas diza hanota <char style="ior"><ref loc="EXO 15:22-18:27">15:22—18:27</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Woganne caaqo qaala <char style="ior"><ref loc="EXO 19:1-24:18">19:1—24:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dummatida gaytoteththa dunkaanenne goyno wogata <char style="ior"><ref loc="EXO 25:1-40:38">25:1—40:38</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EXO 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Gibxe Biittan Isra7eele Nayta Bolla Gakkida Naaqonne Qoho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 1:1"/>Baso asa ubbaa ekki Yaaqoobera Gibxe bida Yaaqoobe nayta sunththi hayssafe kaalli xaafettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:8-27">Medhe 46:8-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 1:2"/>Isttika Oroobeele, Simoona, Lewe, Yuhuda, <verse eid="EXO 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 1:3"/>Yisakoore, Zaabiloone, Biniyaame, <verse eid="EXO 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 1:4"/>Daane, Niftaaleme, Gaadenne Aaseere. <verse eid="EXO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 1:5"/>Yaaqoobe zereththati mulera laappun tamma; Yooseefey kasetidi Gibxe biidi heen dees.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Laappun tamma (Medhe 46:26-27) gizayssa hayqo abban beettida maxaafaninne laappun tammu eranchchata birsheththan, «Laappun tammanne ichchasha» gees. (Hawa 7:14 be7a)</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 1:6"/>Yooseefey, iza ishatinne he yeletay wurikka hayqqides; <verse eid="EXO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 1:7"/>gido attiin Isra7eele zereththati yelettidi keehi darida; he biittaa kumana gakkanaas istti keehi corattida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:17">Hawa 7:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 1:8"/>Hessafe guye Yooseefe erontta ooraththa kawoy Gibxe biittan dendides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:18">Hawa 7:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 1:9"/>Izi ba asaa, «Be7ite; hayti Isra7eele asay nuuppe keehi daridanne wolqqamida. <verse eid="EXO 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 1:10"/>Haa yiite, ane nuni istta hiillan oykkoos; histtontta aggiko istti kaseppe gede dari dari baana. Geelli gida olay dendiko istti nu morkketara gaaggidi nuna olananne biittaa yeggidi baana» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:19">Hawa 7:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 1:11"/>Hessa gishshas deexo ooson istta tuggasana mala istta bolla halaqata doorida. Isttika kawos Piitoomenne Eraamise geetettiza dumma dumma minjja miishshata woththiza katamata keexxida. <verse eid="EXO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 1:12"/>Gido attiin Gibxe asay istta keehi waayisida wode istti gujetti gujetti yelettidanne biitta gakkida. Hessa gishshas Gibxe asay Isra7eele nayta ixxides. <verse eid="EXO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 1:13"/>Hessa gishshas istta daro daabursiza ooson waayisida. <verse eid="EXO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 1:14"/>Wolqqama ooson, simintoninne xuube medhon, qasse goshshe goyson, istta duussan un7eththida; daabursiza ooso ubbaa qadhetay baynda istta oosisida.<verse eid="EXO 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 1:15"/>Gibxe kawoy Ibraawe maccassata yelissiza Sipooronne Puuho geetettiza nam7u maccassatas, <verse eid="EXO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 1:16"/>«Ibraawe maccassati yeliza wode intte yelissishin yelettidayssi attuma naa gidikko wodhite; gido attiin macca naa gidikko wodhopite» <verse eid="EXO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 1:17"/>Gido attiin Yelissizayti Xoossas babbidi Gibxe kawoy istta azazida mala ooththibeettenna; wodhontta attuma nayta paxa aggida. <verse eid="EXO 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 1:18"/>Hessafe guye Gibxe kawoy he yelissizayta xeygidi, «Intte ays hayssaththo ooththidetii? Attuma nayta ays paxa aggidetii?» gi oychchides. <verse eid="EXO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 1:19"/>Yelissizayti zaaridi, «Ibraawe maccassati Gibxe maccassata mala gidettenna; istti mino gidida gishshas yelissizayti gakkanaappe sinththatidi yelichcheettes» gida. <verse eid="EXO 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 1:20"/>Hessa gishshas Xoossi yelissizaytas kiyides. Asaa qoodaykka gujetti gujetti biidi kaseyssafe gede daridesinne minnides. <verse eid="EXO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 1:21"/>Qasse yelissizayti Xoossas babbida gishshas Xoossi isttas yelo immi anjjides. <verse eid="EXO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 1:22"/>Hessafe guye kawoy ba asaa ubbaa, «Ibraawetappe yelettiza adde naa ubbaa Nayle geetettiza Shaafa haaththan olite; gido attiin macca nay yelettiko paxa aggite» giidi azazides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:19">Hawa 7:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EXO 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Muse Yeleteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 2:1"/>He wode issi Lewe qommo gidida addey Lewe macca nayo machcho ekkides; <verse eid="EXO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 2:2"/>iza qanththatada adde naa yeladus. Naazikka mala lo7o naa gididayssa beyada heedzdzu agina qottadus.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:20">Hawa 7:20</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:23">Ib 11:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 2:3"/>Gido attiin iza hessafe daro qottanaas dandayonttayssa erada, shaccafe keeshe izas daddada shidan meeshada, naaza iza giddon woththada Nayle shaafa doonan duureessa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Duureessa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Duureessa geetettizayssi issi issi bagga gamoththo qaalan halkasha geetettees.</char></note> geetettiza maata giddon woththadus. <verse eid="EXO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 2:4"/>Iza michcheya iza bolla aazi hananaakko beyanaas haahon eqqada xeellawus.<verse eid="EXO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 2:5"/>Gibxe kawo naya bolla meecettanaas Nayle shaafa wodhdhadus; izi macca aylletikka haaththa doonan yaanne haa hemetteettes; iza keesheza duureessa geetettiza maata giddon beyada, baada ekkada yaana mala ba aylleyo kiittadus; <verse eid="EXO 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 2:6"/>keesheza doyada he guuththa naaza beyadus. Izi yeekkiza gishshas izas qadhettada, «Hayssi Ibraaweta guuththa naytappe issaa gidontta aggenna» gadus.<verse eid="EXO 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 2:7"/>He wode iza michcheya kawaa nayo, «Nees ha naaza dhanththanaas Ibraawetappe issi maccas ehanaas boo?» gaada oychchadus. <verse eid="EXO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 2:8"/>Histtiin iza, «Ee, ba» gadus. Naya baada he naaza aayo ehadus. <verse eid="EXO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 2:9"/>Kawoza naya he maccassayo, «Hayssa naaza efada taas dhanththaashsha; tani nees damoza qanxxana» gadus. Maccassaya naaza efada dhanththa dichchadus. <verse eid="EXO 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 2:10"/>Naazi dicciin kawo naykko iza ehiin izi izis naa gidides; «Tani iza haaththafe kessadis» gaada iza Muse ga sunththadus.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muse guussi Ibraaweta qaalara, «Keso» guussa.</char></note><verse eid="EXO 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musey Midiyaame Biitta Bete Buus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 7:21">Hawa 7:21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 2:11"/>Musey diccidi gita gididi issi gallas ba asay dizaso biidi istti deexo ooso ooththishin be7ides. Issi Gibxe biitta asi iza asata Ibraawetappe issaa wadhdhishin be7ides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:24">Ib 11:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 2:12"/>Izi yaanne haa xeelliin oonikka bayndayssa be7idi he Gibxe addeza wodhidi ace giddon kaashi qottides. <verse eid="EXO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 2:13"/>Wonteththa gallas kezidi nam7u Ibraaweti ba garsan wadhettizayta be7ides. Qohizayssa izi, «Neni ne as gidida Ibraaweza ays wadhdhay?» gi oychchides. <verse eid="EXO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 2:14"/>He addezikka, «Nena nu bolla godaanne daanna histtiday oonee? Neni Gibxe addeza wodhidayssa mala tanakka wodhana qoppay?» giin Musey, «Tani ooththidayssi erettichchides» gi babbides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11-14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:23-28">Hawa 7:23-28</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 2:15"/>Kawozi hessa siyidi Muse wodhanaas koyides; gido attiin Musey kawaappe betidi Midiyaame biittan daanaas biidi issi haaththa olla doonan uttides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:29">Hawa 7:29</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:27">Ib 11:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 2:16"/>He wode issi Midiyaame qeeses laappun macca nayti deettes; istti he haaththa ollaako ba aawaa dorsata haath ushshanaas yiidi gonggen haath duuqqi kunththida. <verse eid="EXO 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 2:17"/>Heemmizayti yiidi macca nayta gooddida; gido attiin Musey dendi eqqidi istta ashshidessinne istta dorsata haath ushshides. <verse eid="EXO 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 2:18"/>Istti ba aawa Yootorekko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eragu7eeley Muse bollo gidishin izas hara sunththay Yootore geetettees.</char></note> biin izi, «Hach waani eeson yidetii?» gi oychchides. <verse eid="EXO 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 2:19"/>Istti zaaridi, «Issi Gibxe biitta adde dayssi nuna mehe heemmizaytappe ashshides; qasseka nuus haaththeka duuqqidi nu dorsatakka ushshides» gida. <verse eid="EXO 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 2:20"/>Histtiin izi ba macca nayta, «Ha7i izi awan dizee? Intte he addeza ays heen aggidetii? Ane iza xeygite; yiidi kath mo» gides. <verse eid="EXO 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 2:21"/>Museykka he addezara heen daanaas dosides; addezikka ba nayo Xipooro Muses machcho histti immides. <verse eid="EXO 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 2:22"/>Xipoora adde naa yeliin Musey naaza, «Tani asa biittan bete asa» gishe Gershoome gi sunththides.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gershoome guussi Ibraaweta qaalara, «Bete as» guussa.</char></note><verse eid="EXO 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 2:23"/>Musey Midiyaame biittan diza daro layththata garsan Gibxe kawoy hayqqides. Isra7eele asay ba aylleteththafe dendidayssan oolidanne waassida; aylleteththa waayey dariin istti waassida waasoy pude Xoossako gakkides. <verse eid="EXO 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 2:24"/>Xoossi istta oolezanne istta waasoza siyidi izi Abrahaamera, Yisaaqaranne Yaaqoobera caaqqida caaqo qaalaa yuushshi qoppides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13-14">Medhe 15:13-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 2:25"/>Hessa gishshas Xoossi Isra7eele nayta xeellidi istta hanoteth qoppides.<verse eid="EXO 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EXO 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Muse Xeygeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 3:1"/>Musey Midiyaame biitta qeese, ba bollo Yootore dorsata heemmees; izi dorsata laaggi ekki biidi bazzo biitta gaxa gakkanaas efidi Siina geetettiza Xoossa zumaakko gakkides.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siina geetettizayssi harasohon Korebe geetetti xeygettees.</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 3:2"/>Heen Xoossa kiitanchchay qeeri wora giddon eexxiza tama laco giddon izas beettides; wora giddon tama lacoy diikkoka tamay woraa monttayssa Musey be7ides. <verse eid="EXO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 3:3"/>Hessa gishshas Musey, «Tani gede baada ays woray taman meetettonttaako hayssa ooraththa miish ane beyays» gi qoppides.<verse eid="EXO 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 3:4"/>Izi beyanaas gede bishin Xoossi be7idi woraa giddon dishe iza, «Musee! Musee!» gi xeygides. Museykka, «Yee!» gi koyides. <verse eid="EXO 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 3:5"/>Xoossi iza, «Haa shiiqoppa; neni eqqidasoy geesh gidida gishshas ne tohon diza caammaa kessa» gides. <verse eid="EXO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 3:6"/>Qasseka Xoossay iza, «Tani ne aawata Abrahaame, Yisaaqanne Yaaqoobe Xoossa» gides. Histtiin Musey Xoossaa xeellanaas babbida gishshas ba ayfeso kammides.<verse eid="EXO 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 3:7"/>Qasseka GODAY, «Tani Gibxe biittan ta asay waayiza waaye lo7eththa beyada, istti ba godatappe dendidayssan waassiza waaso siyadissinne istta waaye eradis. <verse eid="EXO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 3:8"/>Hessa gishshas tani istta Gibxe biitta asata kusheppe ashshanaasinne he biittafe istta kessada, aahonne lo7o biitta efanaas haa duge wodhdhadis. He biittay maaththinne eessi goggiza biitta; ha7i he biittan Kanaaneti, Hiiteti, Amooreti, Paarizeti, Hiiwetinne Yaabuseta geetettiza asati deettes. <verse eid="EXO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 3:9"/>Ha7i Isra7eele nayta waasoy taakko gakkides; Gibxe biitta asati istta qohiza qohokka ta beyadis; <verse eid="EXO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 3:10"/>hessa gishshas ha7i ba; ta asata, Isra7eele nayta Gibxeppe kessana mala, Gibxe kawozaakko tani nena kiittays» gides.<verse eid="EXO 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 3:11"/>Gido attiin Musey Xoossaas, «Kawozaakko baanaassinne Isra7eele nayta Gibxeppe kessanaas tani oonee?» gides.<verse eid="EXO 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 3:12"/>Xoossika iza, «Tani nenara gidana; qasse tani nena kiittidayssas malatay hayssa; neni he asaa Gibxeppe kessida wode hayssa zuma bollan intte taas Xoossas goynnana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 3:13"/>Musey Xoossaas, «Gido attiin tani Isra7eele naytakko baada isttas, ‹Intte aawata Xoossi tana intteko kiittides› giikko, istti tana, ‹Iza sunththi oonee?› gi oychchiko he wode tani isttas ay ga yootanee?» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:2-3">Kessa 6:2-3</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 3:14"/>Xoossika Muses, « ‹Tani tanakko; hessa gishshas kasekka ha7ikka diza Xoossi tana intteko kiittides› gaada yoota» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:58">Yoha 8:58</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:8">Ib 13:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:4">Ajju 1:4</ref>,<ref loc="REV 1:8">8</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 3:15"/>Qasse Xoossi Muses, «Neni Isra7eele naytas, ‹GODAY intte aawata Abrahaame, Yisaaqanne, Yaaqoobe Xoossi izi tana intteko kiittides› ga yoota; hayssi yeletappe yeleta gakkanaas tani erettiza ta sunththa.<verse eid="EXO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 3:16"/>«Hee baada Isra7eele cimata shiishshada GODAA intte aawata Abrahaame, Yisaaqanne Yaaqoobe Xoossi taas qonccidi, ‹Tani intteko yadis; Gibxen intte bolla aazi oosettidaakko tani beyadis. <verse eid="EXO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 3:17"/>Tani inttena Gibxe biittaa waayeppe kessada pude maaththinne eessi goggiza Kanaaneta, Hiiteta, Amooreta, Paarizeta, Hiiwetanne Yaabuseta biitta efana gadis› gides» gaada yoota.<verse eid="EXO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 3:18"/>«Isra7eele cimati ne qaala siyana; hessafe guye neninne he cimati Gibxe kawozaakko biidi izas, ‹GODAA Ibraaweta Xoossay nuus qonccides. Ha7i nuni heedzdzu gallassa oge bazzo biidi GODAAS nu Xoossaas yarsho yarshana mala nuna yedda› giite. <verse eid="EXO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 3:19"/>Gido attiin ta wolqqara yedisontta dishin Gibxe kawoy inttena yeddonttayssa tani erays. <verse eid="EXO 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 3:20"/>Hessa gishshas tani ta kushe yeddada istta giddon tani ooththiza ta malaatata ubbaan Gibxe asaa shocana. Hessafe guye izi inttena yeddana.<verse eid="EXO 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 3:21"/>«Intte ke7iza wode Gibxe asay inttes kiyana mala ta ooththana gishshas ke7ishe mela kushe ke7ekketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21-22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:35-36">Kessa 12:35-36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 3:22"/>Ibraawe maccassati wuri ba guta Gibxe maccassatanne ba soon diza Gibxe maccassata oonakkoka gidiin biidi bira, worqqanne adde naytinne macca nayti may7ana may7ota, ‹Immite› gi oychchana. Hessaththo ooththidi intte Gibxe asaa aqo ubbaa buuri ekkidi kezana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EXO 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossi Muses Immida Gita Wolqqa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 4:1"/>Museykka GODAAS, «Istti tana ammanontta ixxiko woykko tani yootizayssa siyontta ixxidi, ‹GODAY nees qonccibeenna› giikko ta waanoo?» gides.<verse eid="EXO 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 4:2"/>GODAY iza, «Hessi ne kushen dizay aazee?» gi oychchides.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:2">Izikka, «Guufekko» gides.<verse eid="EXO 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 4:3"/>GODAYKKA iza, «Ane iza gaden yegga» gides. Musey he guufeza gaden yeggiin shoosh gidides; histtiin Musey izappe woxxi kichchides. <verse eid="EXO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 4:4"/>Hessafe guye GODAY iza, «Ne kushe yeddada shooshshaa goyna oykka» gides. Musey yeddidi shooshshaa goyna oykkiin shooshshazi iza kushen simmidi guufe gidides. <verse eid="EXO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 4:5"/>GODAY, «Hayssi hanidayssi ne aawata Abrahaame, Yisaaqanne Yaaqoobe Xoossi nees qonccidayssa istti ammanana malassa» gides.<verse eid="EXO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 4:6"/>Qasseka GODAY iza, «Ne kushe ne shophpha giddo gelththa» giin Musey ba kushe ba shophpha giddo gelththides; izi ba kusheza shophphaafe kessiza wode kushezi qaaratidi shachcha mala booxxides. <verse eid="EXO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 4:7"/>GODAY iza, «Ne kushe ne shophpha giddo zaara gelththa» gides. Histtiin Musey ba kushe ba shophpha giddo zaari gelththi kessiza wode iza kushey simmidi hankko bollaa mala gidides.<verse eid="EXO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 4:8"/>Qasseka GODAY izas, «Istti nena ammanontta aggiko koyro malaataa ammanontta ixxiko, nam7anththoza ammanana. <verse eid="EXO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 4:9"/>Gido attiin istti Xoossi ooththiza ha nam7u malaatata ammanontta aggiko woykko neni yootizayssa siyontta ixxiko, Nayle shaafappe haath duuqqa ekkada biitta bolla gussa; neni shaafaappe ekkida haaththi biitta bolla suuth gidana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 4:10"/>Gido attiin Musey GODAAS, «Abeet Godoo! Tani hayssafe kasekka, woykko neni ne ayllezas taas yootoosoppe haa simmiinkka tani lo7eththa haasayanaas dandayontta as gidikkinaa?» gides. <verse eid="EXO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 4:11"/>GODAY izas, «Asas doona medhdhiday oonee? As duude, woykko tulle ooththizay oonee? Xeelanne qooqe ooththizay oonee? Tana GODAA gidikkinaa? <verse eid="EXO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 4:12"/>Neni ha7i ba; ne haasayana mala ta nenara gidananne nena maaddana; neni yootanayssaka ta nena tamaarsana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 4:13"/>Gido attiin Musey GODAA, «Abeet Godoo! Hayssa ooththanaas hara as kiittarkkii!» gides. <verse eid="EXO 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 4:14"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muse bolla keehi hanqettidi iza, «Lewe baggafe gidida ne isha Aarooney dees gidennee? Izi lo7o haasayana dandayzayssa tani erays; ha7i izi nenara gaagganaas yishe oge bollan dees; izi nena be7idi ufayettana. <verse eid="EXO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 4:15"/>Neni izas yoota; izi yootana qaalaakka ne iza erisa; tani inttena nam7atakka haasayan maaddananne intte ooththanayssa tamaarsana. <verse eid="EXO 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 4:16"/>Izi asaas ne gishshas yootana; hessika izi nees ne doona mala gidiin ne izas haasayza Xoossa mala gidana guussa. <verse eid="EXO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 4:17"/>Malaatata izan ooththanaas neni hayssa guufeza ekka» gides.<verse eid="EXO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gibxe Muse Simo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 4:18"/>Hessafe guye Musey ba bollo, Yootorekko simmi biidi, «Hanno gakkanaas asay paxa dizaakko beyanaas tani guye ta asaakko Gibxe boo?» gides. Yootoreykka Muse, «Ee ba; saron gakka» gides.<verse eid="EXO 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 4:19"/>Musey Midiyaame biittan dishin GODAY iza, «Nena wodhanaas koyida asati wuri hayqqida gishshas guye Gibxe biitta simma ba» gides. <verse eid="EXO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 4:20"/>Musey ba machchiyonne ba attuma nayta hare togisi ekkidi guye Gibxe simmishe Xoossa guufe oykki bides.<verse eid="EXO 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 4:21"/>GODAY Muse, «Neni Gibxe simmada biza wode tani nees immida wolqqan neni ooththana malaatata ubbaa Gibxe kawo Paaroone sinththan neni ooththanayssa baloppa. Histtiinkka izi asaa yeddontta mala tani iza wozina muumisana. <verse eid="EXO 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 4:22"/>He wode tani GODAY gizayssa kawaas: Isra7eeley taas bayra naa; <verse eid="EXO 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 4:23"/>Ta naazi taas goynnanaas ne yeddana mala tani nees yootadis shin neni iza yeddontta ixxadasa; hessa gishshas, ‹Tani nees bayra naaza wodhana› gides gaada yoota» gides.<verse eid="EXO 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 4:24"/>Oge bolla imaththi shempizason GODAY Musera gaaggidi iza wodhanaas koyides. <verse eid="EXO 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 4:25"/>Iza machchiya Xipooray qara shuch ekkada ba naaza qaxxaradus. Qaxxarada he shurteza Muse toho bochchada Muse, «Neni taas tumu suuththa mishira» gadus.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Suuththa mishira gizayssi Muse machcha Musey hayqqontta mala naaza qaxxarida suuththaan Muse bochchiin Musey hayqoppe attidayssa bessees.</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 4:26"/>Hessa gishshas GODAY iza wodhontta aggides. He wode qaxxaraa gaason izas, «Neni taas suuththa mishira» gadus.<verse eid="EXO 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 4:27"/>GODAY Aaroone, «Neni Musera gaagganaas bazzo ba» giin izi biidi Musera Xoossa zumaa bolla gaaggidi iza yeerides. <verse eid="EXO 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 4:28"/>Hessafe guye Musey GODAY ba bolla kiittida qaala ubbaa qasseka ooththana mala bana azazida malaatata ubbaa Aaroones yootides. <verse eid="EXO 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 4:29"/>Museynne Aarooney biidi Isra7eele cimata ubbaa issi bolla shiishshida. <verse eid="EXO 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 4:30"/>Aarooney GODAY Muses yootida qaala ubbaa isttas yootidessinne malaatata he asaa sinththan ooththides. <verse eid="EXO 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 4:31"/>Isttika ammanida. GODAY isttako yidayssanne istta waaye be7idayssa siyida mala biitta bolla gufanni goynnida.<verse eid="EXO 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EXO 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Gibxe Kawo Sinth Musenne Aaroone Shiiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 5:1"/>Hessafe guye Museynne Aarooney Gibxe kawozaakko biidi izas, «GODAY, Isra7eele Xoossi, ‹Ta asay taas bazzon ba7aale bonchchana mala yedda› gides» gida.<verse eid="EXO 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 5:2"/>Histtiin kawozi, «Tani izas azazettada Isra7eele yeddanaas he GODAY izi oonee? Tani Godaa erikke; Isra7eelekka yeddike» gides.<verse eid="EXO 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 5:3"/>Hessafe guye Museynne Aarooney, «Ibraaweta Xoossi nunara gaaggides. Ha7i nuni GODAAS, nu Xoossaas yarsho yarshanaas heedzdzu gallassa oge bazzo giddo baanaas nuna yeddarkkii! Histtontta aggiko izi nuna iita hargen woykko olan wodhana» gida. <verse eid="EXO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 5:4"/>Gido attiin Gibxe kawoy, «Inttenoo! Muse! Aaroonee! Asaa ays ooso diggeetii? Simmidi intte oosos biite» gides. <verse eid="EXO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 5:5"/>Kawozikka, «Hekko be7ite, ha biittan asay corattides; qasse intte asaa ooso diggeeta» gides.<verse eid="EXO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 5:6"/>He gallas kawoy Isra7eele asaa garsafe asaa oosisizaytanne isttafe bollara diza Gibxe halaqata hizgi azazides. <verse eid="EXO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 5:7"/>«Hara wodeyssa mala xuube ooththiza uttula asaas ehi immofte; istti uttula baappe koyidi shiishshetto; <verse eid="EXO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 5:8"/>Gido attiin istti qoodan kaseyssa gina xuube medhdhidi sheedhdhana mala azazite; kase qoodaappe pacisopite; ays giikko istti azalla; isttas, ‹Nuni nu Xoossaas yarsho yarshana mala nuna yedda› giidi waassizay hessassa. <verse eid="EXO 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 5:9"/>Istti ooson sheekkana malanne wordo haasaya siyontta aggana mala isttas ooso deexeththite» gides.<verse eid="EXO 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 5:10"/>Hessafe guye Isra7eele asaa garsafe asaa oosisizaytinne isttafe bollara diza Gibxe halaqati kezidi asaas, «Kawozi, ‹Hayssafe guye ta inttes uttula mulekka immike. <verse eid="EXO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 5:11"/>Intte uttula demmana dandayzasoppe intte baggara koyi ehite shin intte kase sheedhdhiza xuube qooday mulekka paccofo› gides» gida. <verse eid="EXO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 5:12"/>Histtiin asay uttula shiishshanaas Gibxe biitta ubbaan laalettides. <verse eid="EXO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 5:13"/>Gibxe halaqati isttas, «Kase inttes uttula immiza wode intte hach hach ooththizayssa mala ooththite» giidi istta bolla godatida. <verse eid="EXO 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 5:14"/>Isra7eele nayta oosisizaytas waanna halaqati, «Intte kase ooththizayssa mala xuube qamma woykko hach ays ooththi wursibeekketii?» gi oychchidi wadhdhida <verse eid="EXO 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 5:15"/>Hessafe guye Isra7eele naytappe doorettidi asaa oosisizayti biidi kawozas waassida; istti izas, «Nuni ne aylleta gidishin nu bolla hayssaththo aazas ooththay? <verse eid="EXO 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 5:16"/>Ne aylletas nuus uttula imettenna; gido attiin, ‹Xuubeza medhdhite› giidi nuna ne aylleta wadhdheettes shin balay ne asaa bolla dees» gida.<verse eid="EXO 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 5:17"/>Gido attiin kawozi istta, «Ha azallati! Intte azallata! Hessa gishshassa intte zaari zaaridi, ‹Nuni GODAAS yarshanaas baana nuna yedda› geeta. <verse eid="EXO 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 5:18"/>Ha7i biidi ooththite; istti inttes aykko galabaka immettenna; gido attiin intte kaseyssafe pacisontta xuubeza medhdhite» gides.<verse eid="EXO 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 5:19"/>Isra7eele naytappe doorettidi asaa oosisizayti, «Intte hach hach medhdhiza xuube qooda kaseyssafe pacisopite» gida giin istti meton gelidayssa erida.<verse eid="EXO 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 5:20"/>Istti kawoza sinththafe kezidi Museynne Aarooney isttara gaagganaas naagizayta demmida. <verse eid="EXO 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 5:21"/>Istti, «Xoossi inttena xeello! Intte bolla izi pirdo! Intte nuna kawoninne iza oosanchchatan ixisideta; qasse istti nuna wodhana mala, mashsha isttas immideta» gida.<verse eid="EXO 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossas Muse Magana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 5:22"/>Musey GODAAKKO simmidi, «Godoo, neni ha asaa bolla meto ays ehadii? Neni tana kiittiday hayssassee? <verse eid="EXO 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 5:23"/>Tani ne sunththan kawaas haasayanaas bida wodeppe doommiin izi ha asaa bolla meto ehides. Qasse nenikka ne asaa mule ashshabeekka» gides.<verse eid="EXO 5:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EXO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 6:1"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muses, «Tani Gibxe kawo bolla ooththanayssa neni ha7i beyana; ta wolqqama qese gaason izi istta yeddana; ta wolqqama qeseppe dendidayssan izi istta ba biittafe kessi gooddana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muse Xeygeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 6:2"/>Xoossi qasseka Muses, «Tani GODAA; <verse eid="EXO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 6:3"/>tani Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossa gidada Abrahaames, Yisaaqassinne Yaaqoobes qonccadis shin tani, ‹GODAA› geetettiza ta sunththan tanateththaa istta erisabeekke.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:1">Medhe 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:3">28:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:11">35:11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:13-15">Kessa 3:13-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 6:4"/>Qasse tani isttas istti bete gididi de7ida Kanaane biittaa isttas immanaas ta isttara caaqettadis. <verse eid="EXO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 6:5"/>Qasseka Gibxe asay aylle histti waayisida Isra7eele nayta waaso siyada ta gelida caaqo qaala qoppadis.<verse eid="EXO 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 6:6"/>«Hessa gishshas neni Isra7eele naytas, ‹Tani GODAA; tani inttena Gibxe asaa qohoppe kessana; tani inttena istta aylleteththafekka goochcha kessana; qasse tani inttena ta gita wolqqaninne dumma dumma pirdan wozzana. <verse eid="EXO 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 6:7"/>Tani inttena ta dere histtana; tani intte Xoossaa gidana. He wode ta inttena Gibxe asaa aylleteththafe kessida intte GODAA Mernaa Xoossaa gididayssa intte erana. <verse eid="EXO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 6:8"/>Qasse tani inttena Abrahaames, Yisaaqassinne Yaaqoobes immana gaada ta kushe denththada caaqqida biitta ehana; he biittaa tani inttes intte gade histta immana; tani GODAA› ga» gides.<verse eid="EXO 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 6:9"/>Musey hessa Isra7eele naytas yootides shin istti ufays qanxxida gishshassinne iita aylleteththafe dendidayssan istta wozinay meqqida gishshas istti iza qaalaa siyibeettenna.<verse eid="EXO 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 6:10"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muse, <verse eid="EXO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 6:11"/>«Hee baada Gibxe kawaas, ‹Isra7eele nayta ne biittafe kessa yedda› gaada yoota» gides.<verse eid="EXO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 6:12"/>Gido attiin Musey GODAAS, «Isra7eele nayti tayssa siyontta ixxida shin tani doonay birshontta as gidishin kawoy ta gizayssa wostti siyanee?» gides.<verse eid="EXO 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 6:13"/>GODAY Musenne Aaroone, «Biidi intte Isra7eele asaa Gibxeppe kessana mala tani inttena yeddidayssa Isra7eele asaassinne Gibxe kawos yootite» gi azazides.<verse eid="EXO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musenne Aaroone Zereththata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 6:14"/>Hayssafe kaalli dizayti istta keeththa keeththa halaqata. Isra7eeles bayra naa Oroobeele attuma nayti, Heenooke, Paalu, Hexiroomenne Karme; haytanti Oroobeele qommota. Istta soo asata halaqati hayta.<verse eid="EXO 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 6:15"/>Qasse Simoona attuma nayti, Yimu7eele, Yaamine, Ohaade, Yaakine, Xoohaarenne Kanaane biitta maccassatappe yelettida Sa7oole; hayti Simoona qommota.<verse eid="EXO 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 6:16"/>Lewe baggati ba yeleta maaraa mala Gershoone, Qa7aatenne Meraare. Lewey 137 layth de7ides. <verse eid="EXO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 6:17"/>Gershoone attuma nayti ba qommon qommon Libinanne Shim7e geetetteetes.<verse eid="EXO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 6:18"/>Qaheete attuma nayti Amiraame, Yixihaare, Kebroonenne Uzi7eele. Qa7aatey 133 layth de7ides.<verse eid="EXO 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 6:19"/>Meraare attuma nayti Mahilenne Mushe geetettizayta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 6:19">Ba Yeleta maaran Lewe zareti haytantta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:17-20">Tay 3:17-20</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 26:57-58">26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 6:16-19">1Taari 6:16-19</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 6:20"/>Amiraamey ba aawaa michcheyo Yokaabedo machcho ekkides. Izakka izas Aaroonenne Muse yeladus. Amiraamey 137 layth de7ides.<verse eid="EXO 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 6:21"/>Yixihaare attuma nayti, Qoore, Nefegenne Zikire.<verse eid="EXO 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 6:22"/>Uzi7eele attuma nayti, Misha7eele, Elxafaanenne Siitire.<verse eid="EXO 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 6:23"/>Aarooney Aminadaabe nayo, Ne7asoone michcheyo Elisheebo machcho ekkides. Histtiin iza izas Nadaabe, Abihu, El7ezeerenne Itamaare yeladus.<verse eid="EXO 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 6:24"/>Qoore attuma nayti, Assire, Hilqaananne Abiyaasaafe; haytanti Qoore qommotas aawata.<verse eid="EXO 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 6:25"/>Aaroone naa El7ezeerey Puti7eele naytappe issiniyo machcho ekkides; izakka izas Finihaase yeladus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 6:25">Haytanti ba qommon qommon Lewe keeththa asaa halaqata.<verse eid="EXO 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 6:26"/>GODAY, «Gibxe biittafe Isra7eele nayta istta cugan cugan kessite» giidi azaziday hayta Musenne Aaroone. <verse eid="EXO 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 6:27"/>Isra7eele nayta Gibxe biittafe kessizayssa Gibxe kawaas yootidayti Musenne Aaroone.<verse eid="EXO 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 6:28"/>GODAY Gibxen Muses yootiza wode izas, <verse eid="EXO 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 6:29"/>«Tani GODAA; tani nees yootizayssa ubbaa neni Gibxe kawaas yoota» gides.<verse eid="EXO 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 6:30"/>Musey qasse GODAAS, «Tani doonay birshontta as gidida gishshas kawoy tani yootizayssa wostti siyanee?» gides.<verse eid="EXO 6:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EXO 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 7:1"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muses, «Beya; tani nena Gibxe kawaas Xoossa mala ooththadis; ne isha Aarooney ne doona gididi ne gishshas haasayana; <verse eid="EXO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 7:2"/>tani nena azazidayssa ubbaa ne isha Aaroones yootandassa; kawozi Isra7eele nayta ba biittafe kessi yeddana mala izi yootana. <verse eid="EXO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 7:3"/>Gido attiin tani kawoza wozina minththana; tani Gibxe biittan ta malaatanne maalalissiza miish darsa ooththikokka,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:36">Hawa 7:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 7:4"/>izi intte yootizayssa siyenna. He wode tani ta kushe Gibxe asaa bolla denththana; tani ta dereta Isra7eele nayta wolqqama pirdan Gibxeppe kessana. <verse eid="EXO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 7:5"/>Qasse Gibxeti tani ta qese Gibxe asaa bolla denththada Isra7eele nayta istta giddofe kessiza wode tani GODAA gididayssa istti erana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 7:6"/>Museynne Aarooney GODAY istta azazida mala ooththida. <verse eid="EXO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 7:7"/>Istti kawozas yootiza wode Muses layththay osppun tamma; Aarooney qasse 83 layththa asa.<verse eid="EXO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aaroone Guufey Shoosh Gideth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 7:8"/>GODAY Musenne Aaroone, <verse eid="EXO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 7:9"/>«Kawoy inttena, ‹Ane malaata tana bessite› giikko neni Aaroone, ‹Ne guufaa ekkada kawoza sinththan yegga› ga; histtiko izi shoosh gidana» gides. <verse eid="EXO 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 7:10"/>Histtiin Museynne Aarooney kawozaakko gelidi GODAY istta azazida mala ooththida; Aarooney ba guufe kawoza sinththaninne daannata sinththan yeggiin guufezi shoosh gidides. <verse eid="EXO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 7:11"/>Hessafe guye kawozi daro eranchchatanne bitizayta xeygisiin Gibxe dere marotikka ba deren hessaththo ooththida. <verse eid="EXO 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 7:12"/>Istti wurikka ba guufe guufe gaden yeggiin guufeti wurikka shoosh gidida shin Aaroone guufeya istta guufeta ubbaa mittadus. <verse eid="EXO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 7:13"/>Gidikkoka GODAY yootida mala kawoza wozinay minnida gishshas izi istta yo7o siyontta ixxides.<verse eid="EXO 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Haaththay Suuththan Laameteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 7:14"/>GODAY Muses, «Kawoza wozinay muumiin asaa izi yeddontta ixxida gishshas, <verse eid="EXO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 7:15"/>kawozi shaafa biza wode maaladora neni izakko baada izara gaaggana mala Abbaye shaafaa doonan eqqa; hee bashe shooshshan laamettida guufeza oykka ekkada ba. <verse eid="EXO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 7:16"/>Neni iza, ‹GODAA Ibraaweta Xoossay nena, «Bazzon taas goynnana mala ta asaa yedda» giidi tana neekko kiittides shin hanno gakkanaas neni ero gabeekka. <verse eid="EXO 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 7:17"/>GODAY, «Tani GODAA gididayssa neni hayssan erana» gides. Tani Abbaye shaafa haaththaa ta kushen diza guufezan shocikko haaththay suuththan laamettana. <verse eid="EXO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 7:18"/>Abbaye shaafaa moleykka hayqqana; shaafaykka xinqqana; Gibxeti he shaafa haaththaa uyanaas dandayettenna› gaada yoota» gides.<verse eid="EXO 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 7:19"/>GODAY Muses, «Neni Aaroones, ‹Ne guufe oykkada Gibxe haaththata bolla, shaafata bolla, zara haaththata bollanne eellida haaththi dizaso ubbaa bolla ne kushe piddisa› ga; izi ba kushe piddisikko haaththi wuri suuththan laamettana; Gibxe biitta ubbaan, haray attoshin, miththafenne shuchchafe wooci kessida haath tigiza miishshata ubbaan suuththi kumana» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 11:20">Luqa 11:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 7:20"/>Museynne Aarooney GODAY azazida mala ooththida. Kawoza sinththaninne daannata sinththan Aarooney ba guufeza denththidi shaafa haaththaa shociin haaththi wuri suuththan laamettides. <verse eid="EXO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 7:21"/>He shaafa haaththaa giddon diza moleti hayqqida; shaafa haaththi keehi xinqqida gishshas Gibxe asay uyanaas dandaybeenna. Gibxe biittay kumeth suuth xalla gidides. <verse eid="EXO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 7:22"/>Gido attiin Gibxe maroti ba biittan izaththoka ooththida; GODAY yootida malakka kawoza wozinay minnida gishshas Museynne Aarooney yootidayssa siyontta ixxides. <verse eid="EXO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 7:23"/>Hessafe guye kawozi hessas aykko babbontta dishe ba soo simmi bides. <verse eid="EXO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 7:24"/>Gibxe asay wuri Abbaye shaafa haaththaa uyanaas dandayontta gishshas, uyiza haath demmanaas Abbaye shaafaa achchan olla bookkida.<verse eid="EXO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 7:25"/>GODAY haaththaa suuththan laammiin laappun gallas gidides.<verse eid="EXO 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EXO 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Ooqarse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 8:1"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muse, «Gibxe kawaakko baada, ‹GODAY nena hizgees ga; taas goynnana mala ta asaa yedda; <verse eid="EXO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 8:2"/>neni istta yeddontta ixxiko tani ne biitta ubbaa mooriza ooqqars yeddana. <verse eid="EXO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 8:3"/>Abbaye shaafan ooqqarsi kumi aadhdhidi ne soo, ne aqiza soo, ne arsa bolla, daannata keeththa giddo gelana; ne asaa bolla kezana; ne coocen ne munuqa gonggetankka gelana. <verse eid="EXO 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 8:4"/>Ooqqarsati ne bolla, ne asaa bollanne daannata ubbaa bolla kezana› gaada yoota» gides.<verse eid="EXO 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 8:5"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muse, «Neni Aaroone, ‹Ne guufeza ekkada, shaafata bolla, zara haaththata bollanne eellida haaththata bolla ne kushe piddisada ooqqarsi Gibxe biitta bolla kezana mala ooththa› gaada yoota» gides.<verse eid="EXO 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 8:6"/>Histtiin Aarooney Gibxe haaththata bolla ba kushe piddisiin ooqqarsi kezidi Gibxe biitta may7ides. <verse eid="EXO 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 8:7"/>Gido attiin marotikka bantta biittan Gibxen ooqqarsi kezana mala izaththoka ooththida.<verse eid="EXO 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 8:8"/>Kawozi Musenne Aaroone xeygisidi, «Hayssa ooqqarsaa taappenne ta asaa bollafe diggana mala GODAA intte woossite; histtiko GODAAS yarshana mala tani asaa yeddana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 8:9"/>Histtiin Musey kawoza, «Kawoo nees too! Ooqqarsi neeppenne ne sooppe dhaydi Abbaye shaafan xalla attana mala tani nees, daannatassinne ne asaas woossana gallas ne yoota» gides.<verse eid="EXO 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 8:10"/>Histtiin kawozi, «Wonto gido» gides.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 8:10">Museykka, «GODAA nu Xoossa malay oonikka bayndayssa neni erana mala ne gida mala ooththana. <verse eid="EXO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 8:11"/>He ooqqarsay neeppe, ne keeththafe, daannatappenne ne asaappe dhayana; istti Abbaye shaafan xalla attana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 8:12"/>Museynne Aarooney kawaa achchafe kezidi kawoza bolla izi ehida ooqqarsata gishshas Musey GODAAKKO waassides. <verse eid="EXO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 8:13"/>GODAYKKA Musey oychchida mala ooththides; ooqqarsi soon, kareninne demban dizayssi wuri hayqqides. <verse eid="EXO 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 8:14"/>Gibxe asay ooqqarsaa shiishshi shiishshidi korides; biittayka xinqqon zeeqqides. <verse eid="EXO 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 8:15"/>Gido attiin kawozi guuththa peeqa demmida wode ba wozina minththides; GODAY yootida malakka izi Museynne Aarooney yootida yo7oza siyontta ixxides.<verse eid="EXO 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Cuuchche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 8:16"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muse, «Neni Aaroones, ‹Ne guufezara, biitta gudulla shoca› ga; izi shocikko Gibxe biitta ubbaan gudullay cuuch gidana» gides. <verse eid="EXO 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 8:17"/>Histtiin istti hessaththo ooththida; Aarooney ba guufe ekkidi guufezara biitta gudullaa shociin asanne mehe ubbaa bolla cuuchchi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cuuchche geetettizayssi hara hara birsheththatan saxxiza uu7e geetettides.</char></note> kezides. Gibxe biittan ha gaxappe heni gaxa gakkanaas gudullay wuri cuuch gidides. <verse eid="EXO 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 8:18"/>Marotikka ba bitan izaththo ooththanaas paacciin isttas dandayetibeenna. Cuuchchay asa bollanne mehe bolla kumides. <verse eid="EXO 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 8:19"/>Marotikka kawozas, «Hayssi Xoossa oosokko!» gida. Gido attiin kawoza wozinay minnides; GODAY gida malakka izi istti yootizayssa siyontta ixxides.<verse eid="EXO 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Boxe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 8:20"/>GODAY Muses, «Wontta maaladora dendada, kawozi shaafa bishin izara gaaggada neni iza, ‹GODAY taas goynnana mala ta asaa yedda; <verse eid="EXO 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 8:21"/>neni ta asaa yeddontta ixxiko, tani ne bolla, daannata bolla, ne asaa bollanne ne keeththata giddo wolqqama boxe yeddana; Gibxe asaa keeththaninne istti diza biitta ubbaan boxey kumana. <verse eid="EXO 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 8:22"/>Gido attiin tani GODAY ha biittan dizayssa neni erana mala he gallas ta asay diza Geeseme biittan boxey gakkontta mala tani teqqada istta biittaa naagana. <verse eid="EXO 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 8:23"/>Tani ne asaappe ta asaa dumma shaakkana; hayssan malaata wonto ooththana› gides gaada yoota» gides.<verse eid="EXO 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 8:24"/>Hessafe guye GODAY gida mala ooththides; kawoza sooninne iza daannata soon daro wolqqama boxey kumides; kumeththa Gibxe biitta ubbaa iissides.<verse eid="EXO 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 8:25"/>He wode kawozi Musenne Aaroone xeygisidi, «Biite; hayssa ha biittan intte Xoossaas yarshite» gides.<verse eid="EXO 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 8:26"/>Gido attiin Musey, «Hessi lo7o deenna; nuni GODAA nu Xoossaas shiishshiza yarshoti Gibxe asaas tuna miish gidana; nuni istta tunisiza yarshota istti xeellishin yarshiko, istti nuna shuchchan caddettennee? <verse eid="EXO 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 8:27"/>Nuni GODAA nu Xoossaas yarshota shiishshanaas izi nuna azazida mala heedzdzu gallassa oge bazzo baanaas koshshees» gides.<verse eid="EXO 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 8:28"/>Histtiin kawozi, «GODAA intte Xoossaas intte bazzo biidi yarshana mala tani inttena yeddana shin intte haakki boopite; ha7i taas woossite» gides.<verse eid="EXO 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 8:29"/>Musey, «Tani ne achchafe kezida mala GODAA woossana; ha wolqqama boxey wonto kawozappe, daannatappenne iza asaappe kichchana. Gido attiin GODAAS yarshanaas asaa yeddontta ixxanaas kawoy nuna zaari cimmontta mala qoppo» gides.<verse eid="EXO 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 8:30"/>Hessafe guye Musey kawoza achchafe kezidi GODAA woossides. <verse eid="EXO 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 8:31"/>Musey oychchida mala GODAY ooththides; boxey kawozappe, daannatappenne iza asaappe issinokka attontta kichchides. <verse eid="EXO 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 8:32"/>Gido attiin ha7ikka kawaa wozinay minnida gishshas izi asaa yeddontta ixxides.<verse eid="EXO 8:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EXO 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Mehe Bolla Gakkida Bosha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 9:1"/>GODAY Muse, «Gibxe kawozaakko baada GODAA Ibraaweta Xoossay nena, ‹Taas goynnana mala ta asaa yedda; <verse eid="EXO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 9:2"/>Neni yeddontta ixxizaa gidikko, <verse eid="EXO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 9:3"/>heemettizason diza ne meheta bolla, parata bolla, hareta bolla, gaamellata bolla, miizata bolla, dorsata bollanne deyshata bolla wolqqama harge yeddana. <verse eid="EXO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 9:4"/>Gido attiin tani GODAY Isra7eele meheta giddoninne Gibxe asaa meheta giddon shaakoteth medhdhana. Isra7eele asaa mehetappe issoyka hayqqenna› ga» gides.<verse eid="EXO 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 9:5"/>GODAY wode baridi, «Tani wonto hayssa ha biitta bolla ooththana» gides. <verse eid="EXO 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 9:6"/>Wonteththa gallas GODAY hessa ooththides. Gibxe asaa mehey wuri hayqqides shin Isra7eele asaa meheppe issinakka hayqqabeekku. <verse eid="EXO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 9:7"/>Kawozi ha yo7oza paaccanaas as kiittidi Isra7eele nayta meheppe, haray attoshin pexi issinakka hayqqonttayssa erides. Gidikkoka kawoza wozinay minnidasoppe simmontta ixxida gishshas asaa yeddontta ixxides.<verse eid="EXO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kixa Harge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 9:8"/>Hessafe guye GODAY, Musenne Aaroone, «Kushe kunththidi cooceppe bidinththa kuucci ekkidi Musey kawozi xeellishin hessa pude carko bolla laallo; <verse eid="EXO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 9:9"/>hayssi Gibxe biitta ubbaa bolla gudulla gidana; Gibxe biitta ubbaan asa bollanne mehe bolla kixay wodhdhana» gides. <verse eid="EXO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 9:10"/>Histtiin istti cooceppe bidinth ekkidi kawoza sinththan eqqida; Musey hessa pude carkon laalliin asaa bollanne mehe bolla giiyiza kixay kezides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:2">Ajju 16:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 9:11"/>Marotikka istta bollanne Gibxe asaa ubbaa bolla wodhdhida kixay eqo diggiin Muse sinththan eqqanaas dandaybeettenna. <verse eid="EXO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 9:12"/>Gido attiin GODAY Muses gida malakka kawoza wozina minththida gishshas Museynne Aarooney yootizayssa kawozi siyontta ixxides.<verse eid="EXO 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shachcha Ira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 9:13"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muses, «Wonto wontta maaladora denda baada kawozara gaaggada iza Ibraaweta GODAY nena, ‹Taas goynnana mala ta asaa yedda. <verse eid="EXO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 9:14"/>Ne yeddontta ixxiko ne bolla, daannata bollanne ne asaa bolla ta wolqqama hanqo ha7i yeddana; hessankka biitta bollan ta malay bayndayssa neni erana. <verse eid="EXO 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 9:15"/>Tani hanno gakkanaas ta kushe yeddada nenanne ne asaa iita hargen qohidaakko ha biittaa bollafe pitta dhayssanakkoshin. <verse eid="EXO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 9:16"/>Tani nena paxa woththiday nena ta wolqqa bessanaassinne ta sunththi biitta ubbaa bollan xeygettana malassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:17">Oro 9:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 9:17"/>Neni ha7ikka otorettada ta asaa yeddontta ixxadasa. <verse eid="EXO 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 9:18"/>Hessa gishshas tani wonto hanni wode Gibxey Gibxe gidoosoppe hach gakkanaas bukki erontta wolqqama shach bukisana. <verse eid="EXO 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 9:19"/>Ha7i neni ne mehenne gaden nees dizaaz ubbaa soo gelththana mala azaza; ays giikko soo gelontta buro gaden diza asa ubbaa bollanne mehe ubbaa bolla shachchi bukkidi wodhana› gides ga» gides. <verse eid="EXO 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 9:20"/>Kawozi sunththida daannatappe GODAA qaalaas babbidayti ba aylletanne ba mehe eesotidi soo gelththida. <verse eid="EXO 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 9:21"/>Gido attiin GODAA qaala kadhidayti ba aylletanne ba mehe karen aggaagida.<verse eid="EXO 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 9:22"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muses, «Gibxe biitta ubbaa bollan, asaa bolla, mehe bollanne biittafe mokkiza ubbaa bolla shachchi bukkana mala ne kushe salo denththa» gides. <verse eid="EXO 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 9:23"/>Musey ba guufe pude salo denththida mala, GODAY dadanne shach yeddides; wolqqanththika duge biitta bolla wolqqamides. GODAY Gibxe biittan shach bukisides. <verse eid="EXO 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 9:24"/>Shachchay bukkides; wolqqanththika wolqqamides; Gibxe derey dere gidoosoppe haa simmiin Gibxe biitta ubbaa bolla wodhdhida shachcha ubbaafe hayssi aadhdhiza iita shachcha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:7">Ajju 8:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:21">16:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 9:25"/>He shachchay Gibxe biitta ubbaan gaden diza ubbaa, asakka mehekka shocides; biittafe mokkidaaz ubbaa duge zaaridi shocides; miththika ubbaa menththereththides. <verse eid="EXO 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 9:26"/>Isra7eele nayti diza Geeseme biittay xalla shachchi bukkontta attides.<verse eid="EXO 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 9:27"/>Kawoykka Musenne Aaroone xeygisidi, «Ha7i hekko, tani nagara ooththadis; GODAY xillo; taninne ta asay wordo. <verse eid="EXO 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 9:28"/>Dadaynne shachchi nu bolla darida gishshas nuus GODAA woossite. Tani inttena yeddana; hekko hayssafe sinththan intte hayssan gam7eketa» gides.<verse eid="EXO 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 9:29"/>Museykka izas, «Tani ha katamaappe keza baada woossanaas ta kushe GODAAKKO miccana; histtiko daday aggana; qasse shachchayka bukkenna; hessankka biittay GODAAS gididayssa neni erana. <verse eid="EXO 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 9:30"/>Gido attiin neninne daannati GODAA Xoossaas ha7ikka babbonttayssa tani erays» gides.<verse eid="EXO 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31-32" style="v" sid="EXO 9:31-32"/>Ciiyida kaththaynne tiyattida kaththay wuri dhaydes; gido attiin ciiyonttanne tiyattontta buro gakkiza kaththaa shachchay qohibeenna.<verse eid="EXO 9:31-32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 9:33"/>Hessafe guye Musey kawoza achchafe dendidi katamappe gaxa kezidi ba kushe GODAAKKO miccides; histtiin dadaynne shachchay eqqides; iraykka biitta bolla bukkizayssa aggides. <verse eid="EXO 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 9:34"/>Gido attiin kawozi iray, shachchaynne daday aggidayssa be7ida wode qasseka nagara ooththides; izinne daannatikka bantta wozina minththida. <verse eid="EXO 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 9:35"/>GODAY Muse doonara haasayda malakka kawaa wozinay minniin Isra7eele nayta yeddontta ixxides.<verse eid="EXO 9:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EXO 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Boole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="EXO 10:1-2"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muses, «Gibxe kawaakko guye simma ba; ays giikko tani Gibxe asaa wostta qaxxaydaakkonne malaata istta giddon wostta ooththidaakko intte intte naytassinne intte nayta naytas yootana mala, qasse intteka tani GODAA gididayssa erana mala, ta malaata istta giddon ooththanaas iza wozinanne daannata wozina minththa woththadis» gides.<verse eid="EXO 10:1-2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 10:3"/>Histtiin Museynne Aarooney kawozaakko gelidi, «GODAA Ibraaweta Xoossi nena, ‹Ne nenateththaa ta sinththan kawushshontta ixxizay awude gakkanaassee? Ha7i taas goynnana mala ta asaa yedda. <verse eid="EXO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 10:4"/>Neni istta yeddontta ixxiko wonto ta ne biittaa bolla boole yeddana. <verse eid="EXO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 10:5"/>Boolezi oonikka be7ontta mala biittaa may7ana. Inttes shachchaafe attida guuththa miishshi, gaden dicciza miththika ubbaa maana. <verse eid="EXO 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 10:6"/>Ne keeththatan, daannata keeththaninne Gibxe asa ubbaa keeththan kumana; hayssi ne aawati, woykko ne mayzati ha biittaa bolla doosoppe hanno gakkanaas mulekka beyi erontta miishsha› gides» gida. Hessafe guye Musey kawoza sinththafe kezi bides.<verse eid="EXO 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 10:7"/>Kawozi sunththida daannatikka kawoza, «Hayssi addezi nuus ayde gakkanaas dhuphe gidanee? Istti GODAA ba Xoossaas goynnana mala neni asaa yedda; Gibxe derey dhaydayssa neni ha7ikka yuushsha qoppikii?» gida.<verse eid="EXO 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 10:8"/>Hessa gishshas kawozi Musenne Aaroone xeygisi guye zaaridi, «Biite; GODAA intte Xoossaas goynnite shin bizayti oonanttee?» gides.<verse eid="EXO 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 10:9"/>Histtiin Musey, «Nuni nu qeeri naytara cimatara, nu attuma naytara macca naytara, nu mehaaranne miiza wudetara issife baana; ays giikko nuni bizason GODAAS ba7aale bonchchanaas koshshees» gides.<verse eid="EXO 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 10:10"/>Kawozi, «Intte maccassataranne intte naytara baana mala ta inttena yeddana; GODAY inttenara gido; gido attiin intte intte wozinan gene qoppideta. <verse eid="EXO 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 10:11"/>Hessa gishshas hanenna; intte, ‹Nu biidi GODAAS goynnana mala nuna yedda› gishe gam7ida gishshas attumasay xalla biidi GODAAS goynnite» gides. Hessafe guye Musenne Aaroone kawoza sinththafe kessi gooddida.<verse eid="EXO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 10:12"/>GODAY Muses, «Booley Gibxe biitta bolla yaana mala shachchaafe attidi dicciza ubbaa lim7i histti wursana mala, ne kushe Gibxe biittaa bolla piddisa» gides.<verse eid="EXO 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 10:13"/>Musey ba oykkida guufaa Gibxe biitta bolla dhoqqu histti denththiin, he wode gallassinne qamma GODAY arshey mokkiza baggafe wolqqama carko biitta ubbaa bolla yeddides; gadey wontishin he carkoy boole ekki yides. <verse eid="EXO 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 10:14"/>Booley Gibxe biitta kumeththi may7ides. Hayssa lagge boole boshay he biittaan hayssafe kase hanibeenna; hayssafe sinththankka iza malay hanenna. <verse eid="EXO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 10:15"/>Biittay karexxana gakkanaas boolezi biitta ubbaa may7ides. Shachchafe attidi biitta bolla diccizaazanne miththa bollan diza ayfe ubbaa lim7i histti mides. Hessa gishshas miththa hayththi woykko gaden diza cilila miishshi wuri Gibxe biitta ubbason aykkoyka attibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:2-3">Ajju 9:2-3</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 10:16"/>Kawozikka Musenne Aaroone eeson xeygisidi, «GODAA intte Xoossanne inttena tani qohadis. <verse eid="EXO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 10:17"/>Hekko intte tana wurseththa maaro maarite. Ha iita boshaa taappe diggana mala GODAA intte Xoossaa woossite» gides.<verse eid="EXO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 10:18"/>Musey kawoza achchafe kezidi GODAA woossides. <verse eid="EXO 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 10:19"/>GODAYKKA arshey mokkiza baggara yida carkoza arshey wulliza baggara yida wolqqama carkon laammiin booleza tookki ekki efidi, Zo7o abbaan yeggides. Gibxe biitta kumeththaan issi booleykka attibeenna. <verse eid="EXO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 10:20"/>Gidikkoka GODAY kawoza wozina minththida gishshas Isra7eele nayta yeddontta ixxides.<verse eid="EXO 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Girdi Gida Dhuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 10:21"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muses, «Gibxe biittan girdi gida dhumay dhumana mala ne kushe pude salo denththa» gides. <verse eid="EXO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 10:22"/>Musey ba kushe pude salo denththiin Gibxe biitta ubbaan heedzdzu gallas kumeth girdi gida dhumay dhumides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:28">Maza 105:28</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:10">Ajju 16:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 10:23"/>He heedzdzu gallassatan asi oonikka issoy issaa be7ontta, woykko sooppe kare kezontta gam7ides. Gido attiin Isra7eele nayti dizaso ubbaan isttas poo7oy dees.<verse eid="EXO 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 10:24"/>Kawozi Muse xeygisidi, «Biite; biidi GODAAS goynnite; intte maccassayka intte naytikka inttenara baana dandayeettes. Intte meheta gidikko haan aggi biite» gides.<verse eid="EXO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 10:25"/>Gido attiin Musey izas, «Nuni xuuggidi yarshiza yarsho GODAA nu Xoossaas shiishshana mala mehe immada yeddanaas koshshees. <verse eid="EXO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 10:26"/>Issi xugunththika attontta dishin nu mehey wurikka nunara baanaas bessees. Nuni gede gakkontta dishe mehaappe awayssa awayssa yarshanaakko ha7i eranaas dandayokko. GODAA nu Xoossaas, yarshos he mehaappe dooridi ekkanaas koshshees» gides.<verse eid="EXO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 10:27"/>Gido attiin GODAY kawoza wozina minththida gishshas izi istta yeddanaas koyibeenna. <verse eid="EXO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 10:28"/>Hessafe guye kawozi Muse, «Ta achchafe kichcha! Nam7anththo ta sinththan beettashe nena era! Nam7anththo ta ayfeso ne be7ida gallas ne hayqqana» gides. <verse eid="EXO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 10:29"/>Histtiin Musey izas, «Tumukka; neni gida mala tani nena nam7anththo mulekka beykke» gides.<verse eid="EXO 10:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EXO 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Bayrata Bolla Yida Bosha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 11:1"/>GODAY Muses, «Tani Gibxe kawaa bollanne iza asaa bolla issi hara bosha yeddana; hessafe guye izi inttena ha biittaafe kessi yeddana; kessidi izi inttena issaade ashshontta ubbaa gooddi kessana. <verse eid="EXO 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 11:2"/>Isra7eele asay maccay addey ba shoorotappe birappenne worqqafe oosettida miishshata oychchi ekkana mala isttas yoota» gides. <verse eid="EXO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 11:3"/>GODAYKKA Gibxe asay Isra7eele asaas kiyateth ooththana mala ooththides. Qasse Musey ba baggara Gibxe biittan kawoy sunththida daannataninne asan keehi daro bonchchettida asa mala xeelettides.<verse eid="EXO 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 11:4"/>Musey kawozas, «GODAY, ‹Giddi giddoth tani Gibxe biittan hemettana; <verse eid="EXO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 11:5"/>Gibxe biittan diza attuma nay, kawoteththa algan uttida kawaas bayra naappe doommidi, woxan gaacciza aylley bayra naa gakkanaaska bayra yelettida meheykka attontta wuri hayqqana. <verse eid="EXO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 11:6"/>Gibxe biitta ubbaan hayssafe kase gidiin woykko sinththafekka hanontta yeehoy yeekettana. <verse eid="EXO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 11:7"/>Gido attiin Isra7eele nayta giddon asa bolla woykko mehe bolla asi attoshin kanaykka boccenna› gides. He wode GODAY Gibxessinne Isra7eele naytas giddon shaakoteth medhdhanayssa intte erana. <verse eid="EXO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 11:8"/>Ne sunththida daannati wuri taakko yiidi, ta sinththan gufanni ziggidi, ‹Kezada barkkii! Nena kaalliza asay wurikka bo!› gaana. Hessafe guye tani baana» gides. Musey daro hanqettidi iza sinththafe kezidi bides.<verse eid="EXO 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 11:9"/>GODAY Muses, «Ta malalisiza miish Gibxe biittan gujja gujja ooththana mala kawoy intte yootizayssa siyenna» gi kase yooti woththides. <verse eid="EXO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 11:10"/>Museynne Aarooney hayta malaatata ubbaa kawoza sinththan ooththikoka GODAY kawoza wozina minththida gishshas izi Isra7eele nayta ba dereppe yeddontta ixxides.<verse eid="EXO 11:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EXO 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Bosha Hayqoy Wodhontta Yeggi Aadheth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 12:1"/>Gibxe biittan GODAY Musenne Aaroone hizgides; <verse eid="EXO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 12:2"/>«Ha aginay inttes layththas koyro agina gido; <verse eid="EXO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 12:3"/>Isra7eele asaa ubbaas hayssa ha wogaza yootite; hayssi aginay gelida tammanththa gallas, issi issi asi ba soo asas issi laaqqa doori ekko. <verse eid="EXO 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 12:4"/>He keeththa asaa qooday laaqqaza ubbaa maanaas guuxxizaa gidikko izaadey baas matattiza guta ba soo asaa mala qoodidi issaadey issaadey mi wursanayssa shaakki eretto. <verse eid="EXO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 12:5"/>Intte doori ekkana laaqqay yelettiin issi layth gididi iza bolla aykko borey baynda adde laaqqa gido. Intte laaqqaza dorsafe woykko deyshafe ekkanaas dandayeeta. <verse eid="EXO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 12:6"/>Ha aginay tammanne oydanththo gallas gidana gakkanaas istta naagite; he gallas arshey wullishin Isra7eele maabara asay wuri istta shukkanaas koshshees. <verse eid="EXO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 12:7"/>Shukkidi suuththafe ekkidi istta ashoza miza keeththas qosilaththaanne qoreza bolla tiyetto.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Qore geetettizayssi issi issi bagga Gamoththo qaalan darmachcha, harason qasse margacha geetettees.</char></note> <figure style="fig" alt="Israelite putting blood on doorposts" file="CO00810b.TIF" size="span" ref="12:7">Isra7eeleti suuth qosilaththa bollanne qore bolla tiyishin</figure> <verse eid="EXO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 12:8"/>Ashoza he gallas qammaka taman xiixidi, cammiza bonccoranne irshoy baynda uukettida ukeththara metto. <verse eid="EXO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 12:9"/>Ashoza qaye woykko doyssidi moopite; hu7eza; gedata; qanththa ashozakka ubbaa xiixidi miite. <verse eid="EXO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 12:10"/>He ashozappe gadey wonttana gakkanaas aykkoka ashshofte. Wonttana gakkanaas attidaazi diikko taman xuuggana koshshees. <verse eid="EXO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 12:11"/>Miish, oges gidiza may7o may7idi, intte caamma tohon aaththidi intte guufe intte kushen oykkidi eeson miite; hayssi tana GODAA intte bonchchiza Paaziga yarsho.<verse eid="EXO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 12:12"/>«Tani he gallas qammara Gibxe biittara hemettashe bayra yelettida, asekka mehekka ubbaa wodhana. Gibxe eeqata ubbaa bollaka tani pirdana; tani GODAA gidikkinaa? <verse eid="EXO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 12:13"/>He suuththay intte diza keeththata erisiza malata gidana. Tani he suuththaa be7iza wode inttena agga aadhdhana; tani Gibxe biittaa boshan shociza wode intte bolla aykko boshaykka gakkenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:5">Lewe 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:3-8">Zaare 16:3-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 12:14"/>«He gallassay tani GODAY inttes ooththidayssa qoppi qoppi bonchchiza gallas gido; intte zereththi wuri GODAA ba7aale bonchcho; hayssa inttes woga histtidi mernaas bonchchite.<verse eid="EXO 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukeththa Ba7aale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 12:15"/>«Laappun gallas gakkanaas irshoy gelontta uketh miite; koyro gallas intte sooppe irsho diggite. He koyro gallassafe doommidi laappunththa gallas gakkanaas, irshora diza uketh miza asi oonikka Isra7eele asaa giddofe shaaketti dhayo. <verse eid="EXO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 12:16"/>Koyro gallas geeshsha duulata shiiqite; hara geeshsha duulata qasse laappunththa gallas shiiqite; asay wuri maanaas quma kaththofe attiin he gallassata ubbaan aykkoka ooththofte; intte ooththana miishshi hessa xalla.<verse eid="EXO 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 12:17"/>«Tani inttena Isra7eele nayta Gibxe biittafe kessiday he gallas gidida gishshas Ukeththa ba7aale bonchchite. He gallassa ba7aaleza naa naas attontta woga histti bonchchite. <verse eid="EXO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 12:18"/>Koyro aginan he aginaas tammanne oydanththa gallassa omarsafe doommidi nam7u tammanne issinththa gallassa omarsa gakkanaas irshoy gelontta uketh miite. <verse eid="EXO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 12:19"/>Laappun gallas gakkanaas irshoy intte soon beettofo; irshoy gelida kath miza asi bete asi gidiin woykko he dere as oonakka gidiin hessaadey Isra7eele maabara giddofe dhayo. <verse eid="EXO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 12:20"/>Irshoy gelidaaz aykkoka moopite; intte dizason awanka irshoy gelontta uketh maanaas bessees.»<verse eid="EXO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 12:21"/>Hessafe guye Musey Isra7eele cimata ubbaa xeygisidi, «Intte biidi intte soo asaas Paaziga yarshos laaqqa ekki shukkite. <verse eid="EXO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 12:22"/>Hisophphe geetettiza maata hayththafe danki ekkidi keren diza suuththaan gelththi kessidi, he suuththaa nam7u qosilaththataninne qoreta bolla tiyite; inttefe issi asikka gadey wonttana gakkanaas ba keeththafe kare kezoppo. <figure style="fig" alt="Hyssop" file="HK00114B.TIF" size="span" ref="12:22">Hisophphe</figure> <verse eid="EXO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 12:23"/>GODAY Gibxe bayra nayta wodhanaas he biittara hemettiza wode suuth keeththa qosilaththataninne qoreta bolla be7idi karera aadhdhi baana; wodhizayssi intte soo gelidi inttena wodhontta mala iza GODAY diggana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:28">Ib 11:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 12:24"/>«Intte hayssa azazoza inttessinne intte zereththas mernaas woga histtidi azazettite. <verse eid="EXO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 12:25"/>GODAY kase immana giidi caaqqida qaala mala izi immiza biittaa intte geliza wode ha wogaa naagite. <verse eid="EXO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 12:26"/>Intte nayti inttena, ‹Hayssa ha wogazas birsheththi aazee?› gi oychchiko, <verse eid="EXO 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 12:27"/>intte isttas, ‹Hayssi GODAA bonchchanaas yarshiza Paaziga yarsho; ays giikko GODAY Gibxe biittan Isra7eele asaa keeth aggi aadhdhidi Gibxe asaa wodhidi nuna ashshida gishshassa› giite» gides.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 12:27">Hessafe guye asay biitta bolla gufanni goynnides. <verse eid="EXO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 12:28"/>Isra7eele asay biidi GODAY Musenne Aaroone azazida mala ooththides.<verse eid="EXO 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gibxe Asaa Bayrati Hayqqi Wuro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 12:29"/>Giddi giddoththan GODAY Gibxen bayra yelettida ubbaa kawoteththa algan uttiza kawo bayra naappe doommidi, qasho keeththan diza di7ettida asaa bayra naa gakkanaas, qasse bayra yelettida mehe ubbaa dippi histtides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:22-31">Kessa 4:22-31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 12:30"/>Kawoy, izi sunththida daannatinne Gibxe biitta asay wuri qammara beeggides. Gibxe biittan asi hayqqontta keeththi mulekka baynda gishshas asay qaala dhoqqu histtidi daro waassi yeekkides. <verse eid="EXO 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 12:31"/>He gallassa omars kawozi Musenne Aaroone xeygisidi, «Dendite! Intteka intte asaykka ta asaa giddofe kezite! Biidi intte oychchida malakka GODAAS goynnite! <verse eid="EXO 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 12:32"/>Intte gida malakka intte mehe; intte deyshinne dors ubbaa ekkidi biite! Qasse tanakka anjjite» gides.<verse eid="EXO 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 12:33"/>Isra7eele asay ba biittafe eeson kezana mala Gibxe asay dirbasides. Ays giikko istti, «Kezontta ixxiko nuni wurikka wurana» gida. <verse eid="EXO 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 12:34"/>Hessa gishshas Isra7eele asay irshoy gelontta munuqa keren kunththi may7on xaaxidi hashen tookkides. <verse eid="EXO 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 12:35"/>Isra7eele asay Musey istta azazida mala, Gibxe asaa bira, worqqanne may7o, «Immite» gi oychchides. <verse eid="EXO 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 12:36"/>GODAY Gibxe asaa sinththan Isra7eele asay sabettana mala ooththida gishshas Gibxe asay istta oychchidayssa ubbaa immida. Hessaththo histtidi istta Gibxe asata aqo buuri ekki bida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:35-36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:21-22">Kessa 3:21-22</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gibxeppe Isra7eele Asaa Kes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 12:37"/>Isra7eele asay Eraamise geetettiza katamappe dendidi Sukoote geetettizaso gakkanaas bides. Asay naytanne maccassaa gujjontta qoodiin tohon hemettiza attuma asay 600,000 gidides. <verse eid="EXO 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 12:38"/>Qasse isttara daro hara dere asay, keehi daro mehe, dorsinne deysh ekki kezides. <verse eid="EXO 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 12:39"/>Gibxeppe istti ekki kezida irshoy gelontta munuqappe uketh uukkida; ays giikko istta Gibxeppe eeson kessida gishshas baas shinqe kaththanaassinne munuqay dendiin uukkana wode istta gaththibeenna.<verse eid="EXO 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 12:40"/>Isra7eele asay Gibxe biittan deyida layththay wuri oyddu xeetanne heedzdzu tamma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13">Medhe 15:13</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:17">Gala 3:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 12:41"/>He oyddu xeetanne heedzdzu tammu layththay wuriza he wurseththa gallassan GODAA asay wuri Gibxe biittafe kezides. <verse eid="EXO 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 12:42"/>Gibxe biittafe omarsa wode GODAY ba asaa kessishe naagida gishshas he qammay naa naa gakkanaas, Isra7eele asay wuri beeggi naagidi aqiza GODAAS dummatida qamma.<verse eid="EXO 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paaziga Bonchchiza Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 12:43"/>GODAY Musenne Aaroone, «Paaziga bonchchiza wogay hayssa; hara dere asi izappe oonikka mulera mooppo. <verse eid="EXO 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 12:44"/>Intte miishshan shammida aylley oonikka intte iza qaxxaridaappe guye izappe maanaas koshshees. <verse eid="EXO 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 12:45"/>Gido attiin guuththa wodes inttenara imaththateththan gam7izaynne une ooththiza hara dere asi izappe mooppo.<verse eid="EXO 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 12:46"/>«Ha Paaziga yarshoza intte issi keeththan miite; intte he ashozappe aykkoka kare kessofte. Meqeththatappe issinokka menththofte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:12">Tay 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:36">Yoha 19:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EXO 12:47"/>Isra7eele maabaray wuri Paaziga yarsho bonchchanaas koshshees.<verse eid="EXO 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EXO 12:48"/>«Bete yiidi intte giddon diza asi GODAA Paaziga yarsho bonchchanaas koykko ba soon adde gidida asa ubbaa qaxxaro. Hessafe guye izi he biittan yelettida asa mala shiiqidi Paaziga yarsho bonchchanaas bessees. Gido attiin qaxxarettontta asi mulekka izappe mooppo. <verse eid="EXO 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EXO 12:49"/>Intte biittan yelettidayssaska gidiin intte giddon bete gididi dizayssaska gidiin hayssi wogay ubbaas issino» gides.<verse eid="EXO 12:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="EXO 12:50"/>Histtiin Isra7eele asay wuri GODAY Musenne Aaroone azazida malakka ooththides. <verse eid="EXO 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EXO 12:51"/>He gallassankka GODAY Isra7eele nayta istta cugan cugan Gibxe biittafe kessides.<verse eid="EXO 12:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EXO 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Koyro Yelettida Addey Wuri Godaas Dummateth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 13:1"/>GODAY Muse hizgides, <verse eid="EXO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 13:2"/>«Adde gidi koyro yelettida ubbaa taas dummasa. Isra7eele asaa giddon koyro yelettida bayray wuri mehe gidiin as gidiin wurikka taassa.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:13">Tay 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:23">Luqa 2:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 13:3"/>Hessafe guye Musey asaa, «Gibxeppe, aylleteththa biittafe intte kezida gallassaya hanno gallassayo gididayssa yuushshi qoppite; ays giikko GODAY ba wolqqama qesen inttena kessides; hessa gishshas irshoy gelida kath aykkoka moopite. <verse eid="EXO 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 13:4"/>Intte ha gallassayn Abibe geetettiza aginan kezideta. <verse eid="EXO 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 13:5"/>GODAY Kanaaneta, Hiiteta, Amooreta, Hiiwetanne Yaabuseta geetettiza dereta biittaa inttena gaththiza wode intte ha bonchcho gallassaa ha aginan bonchcheeta. He biittay GODAY inttes immana mala kase intte aawatas caaqqi woththida biitta. He biittay maaththinne eessi goggiza biitta. <verse eid="EXO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 13:6"/>Intte laappun gallas irshoy gelontta uketh maana; laappunththa gallas GODAAS ba7aale histti bonchcheeta. <verse eid="EXO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 13:7"/>He laappun gallassatan irshoy gelontta uketh intte maana; intte giddon irshora dizay aykkoyka beettofo; ne biitta zawan awankka irshoy mulekka dooppo.<verse eid="EXO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 13:8"/>«He gallas neni ne naytas, ‹Tani hayssa ooththizay tani Gibxeppe keziza wode GODAY taas ooththidayssa zaari qoppanaassa› ga yoota. <verse eid="EXO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 13:9"/>GODAY inttena ba wolqqama kushen Gibxeppe kessida gishshas, GODAA wogay intte doonappe shaakettontta mala, hayssi ba7aalezi intte kushe bolla qashettidanne intte liiphen woththiin qofsiza miishsha mala gidana. <verse eid="EXO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 13:10"/>Hessa gishshas intte ha wogaa woththidi layththan layththan ha gallassan bonchchite.<verse eid="EXO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 13:11"/>«GODAY inttessinne kase intte aawatas immanaas caaqqida mala, izi inttena Kanaaneta biitta gelththidi, he biittaa inttes immiza wode, <verse eid="EXO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 13:12"/>attuma gidi yelettida bayra ubbaa GODAAS dummasite; ne mehe garsan adde gididi bayra yelettiday wuri GODAASSA.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:19-20">Kessa 34:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:23">Luqa 2:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 13:13"/>Bayra yelettiza hare mar ubbaa laaqqara laammada wozza; laammada wozzontta ixxiko iza morgen shoca wodha. Ne nayta giddon attuma gidi bayra yelettidayta ubbaa wozza. <verse eid="EXO 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 13:14"/>Wodeppe ne nay nena, ‹Hayssi aaza wogaa?› gi oychchiko, neni izas, ‹GODAY nuna ba wolqqama qesen aylleteththa biitta Gibxeppe kessides; <verse eid="EXO 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 13:15"/>Gibxe kawoy ba wozina minththidi nuna yeddontta ixxiin GODAY Gibxe biittan diza bayra ubbaa, asappe doommidi mehe bayra gakkanaas wodhides. Tani aayi uloppe koyro yelettida adde mehe ubbaa GODAAS yarshizayssinne bayra gidida attuma nayta ubbaa wozzizayssi hessassa› ga. <verse eid="EXO 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 13:16"/>GODAY nuna ba wolqqama qesen Gibxeppe kessidayssas, hayssi inttes kushen qachchida malatanne liiphe bolla woththida malata mala gidana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Goday Ba Asaa Kaaleththees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 13:17"/>Kawoy asaa yeddida wode Xoossi istta Filisxeeme biittara kanththisiza ogey mata shin he ogezara efibeenna; gaasoykka Xoossi, «Asay ola beykko ba qofaa laammidi guye Gibxe simmanaakko» giidi qoppides. <verse eid="EXO 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 13:18"/>Hessa gishshas Xoossi asaa bazzo ogera yuushshidi, Zo7o abbaako kaaleththides. Isra7eele asay Gibxe biittafe olas giigettida asa mala giigettidi Gibxeppe kezides.<verse eid="EXO 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 13:19"/>Yooseefey Isra7eele asaa, «Xoossi tumappe inttena maaddana yaana; he wode intte ta meqeththaa hayssafe inttenara ekki biite» giidi caaqeththi woththida gishshas Musey iza meqeththaa banara ekki bides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:25">Medhe 50:25</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Iya 24:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 13:20"/>Istti Sukooteppe dendidi bazzo doonan diza Etaame geetettizason uttida. <verse eid="EXO 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 13:21"/>Istti gallassika qammaka hemettana mala GODAY istta oge bessanaas tuussa mala eqqida shaaran gallas, tuussa mala eqqida taman omars istta kaaleththides. <verse eid="EXO 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 13:22"/>Gallas tuussa mala eqqida shaaray, omars tuussa mala eqqida tamay asaa sinththafe ubba wode shaakettibeenna.<verse eid="EXO 13:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EXO 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Asay Zo7o Abba Pineth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="EXO 14:1-2"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muses, «Istti guye simmidi Migidooleppenne abbaafe giddon, Pihaahiroote achchan uttana mala deraas yoota; istti abba achchan Ba7aali-Xafoone sinththan bazzaan uttetto. <verse eid="EXO 14:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 14:3"/>Gibxe Kawoy, ‹Bazzon ogey gordetti dhayiin Isra7eele asay bizaso dhaydi coo toylattees› giidi qoppana. <verse eid="EXO 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 14:4"/>Tani kawoza wozina minththana; izi istta gooddana; tani kawoza baggaranne iza olanchchata ubbaa baggara bonchchettana; Gibxe asaykka tani GODAA gididayssa erana» gides. Histtiin Isra7eele asay izi yootida mala ooththides.<verse eid="EXO 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 14:5"/>Asay kessi ekki bidayssa Gibxe kawos yootiin, izikka daannata Isra7eele nayta gishshas qoppida ba qofaa laammidi, «Nuni hayssaththo aazas ooththidonii? Nuni Isra7eele nayta yeddidi istti nuus ooththiza wolqqafe mela attidos» gida. <verse eid="EXO 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 14:6"/>Hessa gishshas kawozi ba para-gaareza kooridi olanchchata banara ekki bides.<figure style="fig" alt="Horses and chariots in battle" file="HK00191B.TIF" size="span" ref="14:6">Olason paranne para-gaareta</figure> <verse eid="EXO 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 14:7"/>Izi ubbaafe aadhdhiza 600 para-gaareta, qasse Gibxe biittan diza para-gaareta ubbaa bollaka ola halaqata woththi ekki bides. <verse eid="EXO 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 14:8"/>GODAY Gibxe biitta kawo wozina minththiin minoteththara buro buussa bolla diza Isra7eele asaa gooddides. <verse eid="EXO 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 14:9"/>Gibxe asay kawo para-gaareti wuri para asatinne olanchchati Isra7eele nayta kaalli gooddida. Abbaa doonan Ba7aali-Xafoone sinththan diza Pihaahiroote achchan istti utti dishin demmida.<verse eid="EXO 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 14:10"/>Kawozi matigdiin Isra7eele asay guye xeelliza wode, Gibxe asay istta guyera kaalli yizayssa be7idinne daroppe babbidi GODAAS waassida. <verse eid="EXO 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 14:11"/>Istti Muses, «Neni nuna Gibxe biittan nuus duufoy dhayiin bazzon hayqqana mala kessadii? Nuna Gibxeppe aazas ehadii? <verse eid="EXO 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 14:12"/>Nuni Gibxen dishe, ‹Nuna agga; nuni Gibxe asaas haarettana› giidi nees yootibeekkonii? Bazzon hayqqanaappe isttas haarettizayssi nuus lo7okkoshin» gida.<verse eid="EXO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 14:13"/>Musey asaa, «Babbofte; minni eqqite; GODAY hach inttena ashshanayssa intte beyana. Hach intte be7iza Gibxe asaa nam7anththo mulekka be7ekketa. <verse eid="EXO 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 14:14"/>Intte gishshas GODAY olettana; inttefe koyettizay co7u guus xalala» gides.<verse eid="EXO 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 14:15"/>GODAY Muse, «Neni taakko ays waassay? Isra7eele asay gede sinththe baana mala yoota. <verse eid="EXO 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 14:16"/>Isra7eele asay mela biitta bollara abbaa pinni baana mala ne guufe denththadanne ne kushe abbaa bolla piddisada haaththaa nam7u kessa shaakka. <verse eid="EXO 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 14:17"/>Tani Gibxe asa wozina minththiko istti intte guye kaallidi abban gelana. Tani kawozanne iza olanchchata ubbaa bolla, iza para-gaaretanne toga asata bolla taas bonchcho demmana. <verse eid="EXO 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 14:18"/>Tani kawoza baggara iza para-gaareta baggaranne iza toga asata baggara taas bonchcho demmida wode tani GODAA gididayssa Gibxe asay erana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 14:19"/>Hessafe guye kase Isra7eele asaa sinththara biza Xoossa kiitanchchay asaappe guye aadhdhi eqqides. Tuussa mala shaaraykka istta sinththafe guye bagga yuuyidi, <verse eid="EXO 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 14:20"/>Gibxe asaassinne Isra7eele naytas giddon aadhdhi eqqides. He shaaray omars issi baggara dhumisidi hankko baggara poo7isides; histtiin omars kumeth issoy issaakko shiiqana dandaybeettenna.<verse eid="EXO 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 14:21"/>Hessafe guye Musey abbaa bollan ba kushe piddisides; GODAY he gallassa omars kumeth arshey mokkiza baggafe wolqqama carko yeddidi, abbaa shaakki shaakkidi mela biitta kessides. Haaththayka nam7an shaakettides. <verse eid="EXO 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 14:22"/>Isra7eele asay abbaa giddon mela biittara hemettidi haaththi isttas ushachcharanne hadirsara goda mala eqqiin bida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:1-2">1Qoro 10:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:29">Ib 11:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 14:23"/>Gibxe asay kawo parati wuri, para-gaaretinne toga asay istta gooddi ekkidi abbaa giddo gelida. <verse eid="EXO 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 14:24"/>Buro bazzoy zo7anaappe kasetidi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bazzoy zo7anaappe kasetidi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bazzoy zo7anaappe kasetidi gizayssa issi issi bagga Gamoththo qaalara ziroy, sosey zo7anaappe kasetidi geetettees.</char></note> GODAY tamaninne tuussa mala shaaran gididi, Gibxe olanchchata xeellida wode istta wozinay dhaydes. <verse eid="EXO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 14:25"/>GODAY istta para-gaareta toho qachchi oykkida gishshas laagoy bana waayisiin Gibxe asay, «GODAY istta maaddidi Gibxe oliza gishshas ane nuni Isra7eele asaappe baqatoos» gida.<verse eid="EXO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 14:26"/>GODAY Muse, «Haaththay Gibxe asaa bolla, istta para-gaareta bollanne toga asata bolla guye goggana mala ne kushe abbaa bolla piddisa» gides. <verse eid="EXO 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 14:27"/>Musey ba kushe abbaa bolla piddisides; gadey wontishin abbay kase ba diza soho guye simmides; Gibxe asay gede iza giddo baqatishin GODAY Gibxe asaa heen abbaa giddon yeggides. <verse eid="EXO 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 14:28"/>Haaththay guye simmidi para-gaareta toga asatanne Isra7eele nayta kaallidi abban gelida kawo olanchchata mule mitti aggides; isttafe issaadeyka attibeenna. <verse eid="EXO 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 14:29"/>Gido attiin Isra7eele asay haaththi isttas ushachcharanne hadirsara goda mala eqqi dishin abbaa giddora mela biitta bollara hemetti bides. <verse eid="EXO 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 14:30"/>GODAY he gallas Isra7eele asaa Gibxe asaa kusheppe hayssaththo ashshides. Qasse Isra7eele asay Gibxe asaa aha abba doonan be7ides. <verse eid="EXO 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 14:31"/>GODAY Gibxe asa bolla bessida gita wolqqaa be7idi Isra7eele asay GODAAS babbidessinne izanne iza aylle Musekka ammanides.<verse eid="EXO 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EXO 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Muse Yeththa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 15:1"/>He wode Museynne Isra7eele asay hayssa mazamureza GODAAS yexxides;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:1">«Bonchchon izi keehi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:1">dhoqqu dhoqqu gida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:1">tani GODAAS mazamure</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:1">yexxana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:1">Paranne para toggida asaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:1">abba giddon yeggides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:3">Ajju 15:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 15:2"/>GODAY taas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">wolqqanne mazamure;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">izi tana ashshides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">Izi ta Xoossa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">tani iza sabbana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">Izi ta aawa Xoossa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">tani iza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">dhoqqu dhoqqu histtana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:14">Maza 118:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 12:2">Isa 12:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 15:3"/>GODAY olanchcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:3">iza sunththika GODAA.<verse eid="EXO 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 15:4"/>Gibxe kawo para-gaaretanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:4">iza olanchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:4">abban wursides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:4">ubbaafe aadhdhi doorettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:4">Gibxe kawo halaqati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:4">Zo7o abbaan mitettida.<verse eid="EXO 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 15:5"/>Ciimma haaththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:5">istta kammides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:5">istti shuchchaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:5">ciimman mitettida.<verse eid="EXO 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 15:6"/>«Abeet GODAWU!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:6">Ne ushachcha kushey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:6">wolqqan goobides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:6">GODAWU ne wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:6">ushachcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:6">kushey morkke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:6">menththereththides.<verse eid="EXO 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 15:7"/>Ne gita wolqqaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:7">nenara eqettidayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:7">kundisadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:7">Eexxiza ne hanqo ne yeddadasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:7">izikka istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:7">gafe mala mides.<verse eid="EXO 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 15:8"/>Ne peenoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:8">haaththaa pude essi doorides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:8">Goggiza haaththika goda mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:8">minni eqqides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:8">ciimma giddon diza haaththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:8">abbaa giddon irkkides.<verse eid="EXO 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 15:9"/>«Morkkey ceeqettishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">‹Tani istta yedeththa oykkana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">Tani istta haaro shaakkada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">ta koyidayssa ubbaa ekkana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">Tani ta giththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">mashsha shoddada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">istta dhayssana› gides.<verse eid="EXO 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 15:10"/>Gido attiin neni istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:10">ne peenon punniin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:10">abbay istta kammides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:10">Istti wolqqama haaththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:10">biratay mitettiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:10">mitettida.<verse eid="EXO 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 15:11"/>«Abeet GODAWU!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">Eeqa xoossata giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">ne malay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">Geeshshateththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">bonchchettizay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">bonchchon babisizaynne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">malalisiza miish ooththizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">ne malay oonee?<verse eid="EXO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 15:12"/>Neni ne ushachcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:12">kushe piddisadasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:12">biittayka istta mittides.<verse eid="EXO 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 15:13"/>«Ne wozzida ne asaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:13">wurontta ne siiqon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:13">kaaleththadasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:13">Neni ne wolqqan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:13">istta ne aqiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:13">geeshsha soo gelththadasa.<verse eid="EXO 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 15:14"/>Dere asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:14">hessa siyidi kokkorides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:14">Filisxeeme biitta asatakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:14">hirga miixay oykkides.<verse eid="EXO 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 15:15"/>He wode Eedoome biitta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:15">halaqati dagammida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:15">Mo7aabe biitta haarizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:15">hirgan kokkorida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:15">Kanaane dere asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:15">wuri seerides.<verse eid="EXO 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 15:16"/>Abeet GODAWU!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">Dagamaynne hirgay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">istta oykkana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">Istti ne wolqqa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">gitateth be7idi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">ne asay aadhdhana gakkanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">neni wozzida asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">aadhdhana gakkanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">shuchcha mala toletti eqqana.<verse eid="EXO 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 15:17"/>Neni istta ehada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">nees buzo biittan diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">zuma hu7en tokkana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">Abeet Mernaa Godoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">he sohoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">neni nees deyanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">ooththida sohokko.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">Abeet GODAWU! He geeshsha sohoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">neni ne kushen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">minththa essida sohokko.<verse eid="EXO 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 15:18"/>GODAY mernaappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:18">mernaa gakkanaas kawotana.»<verse eid="EXO 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 15:19"/>Gibxe kawo parati wuri, para-gaaretinne toga asati abbaan gelida wode GODAY istta bolla abba haaththaa guye zaari ehides; gido attiin Isra7eele asay abbaa giddora mela biitta bollara hemettidi pinnides.<verse eid="EXO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maarami Yeththa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 15:20"/>Aaroone michcheya, nabe Maarama karabe ekkadus; maccassay wuri karabe baqqidi yexxishenne guppishe izo kaallides.<verse eid="EXO 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 15:21"/>Maarama isttas mazamureza yexxashe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:21">«GODAY keehi dhoqqu dhoqqu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">gida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">izas yexxite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">Paranne para toggidayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">izi abban olides»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">ga yexxadus.<verse eid="EXO 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Camo Haath</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 15:22"/>Hessafe guye Musey Isra7eele asaa Zo7o abbaafe pinththiin istti Shuura geetettiza bazzo bida. He bazzon istti haath demmontta heedzdzu gallas hemettida. <verse eid="EXO 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 15:23"/>Istti Maara geetettizaso gakkida wode Maara haaththi camo gidida gishshas uyana dandaybeettenna; hessa gishshas he sohoy Maara geetettides. <verse eid="EXO 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 15:24"/>Asaykka, «Nuni ay uyanee?» giidi Muse bolla zuuzumides.<verse eid="EXO 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 15:25"/>Musey GODAAS waassiin GODAY iza issi mith bessides; Musey he miththaa haaththaan yeggiin haaththay mal7ides.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 15:25">Heen GODAY isttas woganne maara kessidessinne istta paaccides. <verse eid="EXO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 15:26"/>Izi isttas, «GODAA intte Xoossay yootizayssa intte lo7eththi siyikko, iza ayfe sinththan lo7o ooththiko, intte iza azazo wozinan woththi naagikko, iza wogaakka ubbaa naagikko, tani Gibxe asaa bolla ehida hargefe issaaka intte bolla ehikke; gaasoykka tani inttena paththiza GODAA» gides.<verse eid="EXO 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 15:27"/>Hessafe istti tammanne nam7u haaththa pulttotinne laappun tammu zamba miththati dizaso Eelaame yiidi heen haaththa doonan uttida.<verse eid="EXO 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EXO 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Mannanne Kurachota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 16:1"/>Gibxeppe kezida nam7anththo aginan, tammanne ichchashanththo gallassan Isra7eele asaa maabaray kumeth Elaameppe dendi biidi Eelaameppenne Siinappe giddon diza Siine geetettiza bazzo yida. <verse eid="EXO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 16:2"/>Isra7eele asaa maabaray wuri bazzon Muse bollanne Aaroone bolla zuuzumides; <verse eid="EXO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 16:3"/>«GODAY nuna Gibxe biittan ba kushen wodhidaakko lo7okkoshin! Heen nuni asho miza kereza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:3</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kereza: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kereza geetettizayssi issi issi bagga Gamoththo qaalara asho iza bolla woththi miza miish guussa.</char></note> yuuyi aadhdhi uttidi nuni koyida mala kath kalli midos; gido attiin intte nuna heeppe kessidi hayssa deraa ubbaa gafan wodhanaas haa bazzo ehideta» gida.<verse eid="EXO 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 16:4"/>Histtiin GODAY Muses, «Tani inttes saloppe miza kath bukisana; asay ubba gallassika kezidi hachchis hachchis gidanaaz xalala maxana koshshees. Asay ta azazo kaallizaakkonne kaallonttaako tani istta hessan paacca xeellana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:31">Yoha 6:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 16:5"/>Usuppunththo gallas istti hara wode maxizayssas nam7u kushe maxidi kaththetto» gides.<verse eid="EXO 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 16:6"/>Hessa gishshas Museynne Aarooney Isra7eele asa ubbaas, «Inttena Gibxe biittafe kessiday GODAA gididayssa hach omars intte erana. <verse eid="EXO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 16:7"/>Qasse iza bolla intte zuuzumidayssa izi siyida gishshas maalado intte GODAA bonchcho beyana. Intte nu bolla zuuzumanaas nuni oonee?» gida. <verse eid="EXO 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 16:8"/>Hessafe guye Musey, «Intte iza bolla zuuzumidayssa izi siyida gishshas izi inttes maanaas omars asho immiko intte koyida mala miza ukeththaaka ubbaa inttes maalado immana. Nu oonee? Intte GODAA bolla zuuzumideta attiin nu bolla zuuzumibeekketa» gida.<verse eid="EXO 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 16:9"/>Musey Aaroones, «Neni Isra7eele asaa maabara ubbaa, ‹GODAY intte zuuzunththaa siyida gishshas GODAA sinth shiiqite› ga yoota» gides. <verse eid="EXO 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 16:10"/>Aarooney Isra7eele asaa maabara ubbaas yootida mala asay bazzo simmi xeellishin heen GODAA bonchchoy shaarara qonccidayssa be7ida. <verse eid="EXO 16:10"/><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="EXO 16:11-12"/>GODAY Muses, «Tani Isra7eele nayta zuuzunththaa siyadis; neni isttas, ‹Intte omarsa wode asho maana; maalado uketh kallana; he wode tani GODAA intte Xoossaa gididayssa intte erana› gaada yoota» gides.<verse eid="EXO 16:11-12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 16:13"/>He gallassa omarsa wode kurachoti yiidi Isra7eele asay dizason kumida; qasse maalado istti dizaso yuushon xaazay may7i uttides. <verse eid="EXO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 16:14"/>Xaazay xoskishin biitta bollan booththa shach misatiza liiqo miishshi beettides. <verse eid="EXO 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 16:15"/>Isra7eele asay hessa be7idi ba garsan issoy issaa, «Hayssi aazee?» gida. Ays giikko istti izi aazakko eribeettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:3">1Qoro 10:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 16:15">Histtiin Musey isttas, «Inttes maanaas GODAY immida kaththi hayssako. <verse eid="EXO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 16:16"/>GODAY, ‹Asay issoy issoy baas maanaas koshshiza mala shiishsho; intte soo asaas hu7en hu7en issi issi kilonne bagga ekkite› gi azazides» gides.<verse eid="EXO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 16:17"/>Isra7eele asay Musey isttas yootida mala ooththides; baggay darssidi baggay qasse guuththidi shiishshida. <verse eid="EXO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 16:18"/>Shiishshidi istti makkiin darssidi shiishshidayssas palahibeenna; guuth shiishshidayssaska paccibeenna; wurikka issoy issoy baas gidiza mala shiishshides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:15">2Qoro 8:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 16:19"/>Hessafe guye Musey isttas, «Oonikka izappe wontos ashshofo» gides. <verse eid="EXO 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 16:20"/>Gidikkoka isttafe baggay Musey yootizayssa ekkontta aggidi attidayssa wonto maalado gakkanaas woththida; woththidayssika guxunidi xinqqides. Hessa gishshas Musey istta hanqettides. <verse eid="EXO 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 16:21"/>Maalado maalado asay wuri baas koshshizayssa lagge shiishshides; arshey michchiza wode biittan attidayssi maayides.<verse eid="EXO 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 16:22"/>Usuppunththa gallassan istti kaseyssas nam7u kushe issi issi asas heedzdzu kilo shiishshida. Histtiin maabara halaqati wuri yiidi hessa Muses yootida. <verse eid="EXO 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 16:23"/>Izi isttas, «GODAY azazidayssi hayssa; wontoy shemppo gallassa, GODAAS geeshsha sambata. Hessa gishshas intte uukkanayssa uukkite; intte doyssanayssaka doyssite; palahidayssa wontos ashshite» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8-11">Kessa 20:8-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 16:24"/>Hessa gishshas istti Musey azazida mala wontos woththiin xinqqibeenna woykko guxunibeenna. <verse eid="EXO 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 16:25"/>Wonteththa gallas Musey isttas, «Hayssa hach mi wursite; ays giikko hach GODAA Sambata; intte iza hach demban demmeketa. <verse eid="EXO 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 16:26"/>Intte usuppun gallassan iza shiishshite; gido attiin laappunththa gallassay sambata gidida gishshas aykkoyka deenna» gides.<verse eid="EXO 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 16:27"/>Gido attiin issi issi asati laappunththa gallassan shiishshanaas kezida shin aykkoka demmibeettenna. <verse eid="EXO 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 16:28"/>GODAY Muses, «Intte ta azazotanne ta wogata naagoza ayde gakkanaas ixxanee? <verse eid="EXO 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 16:29"/>Ta inttes Sambata immidayssa akeekite; usuppunththa gallassan ta inttes nam7u gallassas kath immizayssi hessa gishshassa. Laappunththa gallas wurikka ba dizason dizason taakko; oonikka awakka booppo» gides. <verse eid="EXO 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 16:30"/>Hessa gishshas asay laappunththa gallassan shempides.<verse eid="EXO 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 16:31"/>Isra7eele asay he kaththaza manna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:31 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Manna: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manna guussi Ibraaweta qaalara, «Hayssi aazee?» guussa.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:7-8">Tay 11:7-8</ref></char></note> gi sunththides. Izikka deebbo ayfe mala gididi booththa; eessara uukettida ukeththa mala mal7ees. <verse eid="EXO 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 16:32"/>Musey Isra7eele asaas, «GODAY azazidayssi hayssa, ‹Tani inttena Gibxe biittafe kessida wode, bazzon mizida kaththaa istti beyana mala, mannafe issi issi kilonne bagga intte sinththafe yaana yeletatas ashshi woththite› gi azazides» gides. <verse eid="EXO 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 16:33"/>Histtiin Musey Aaroone, «Issi xaaro ekkada issi kilonne bagga gidiza manna izan qola; histtada yaana yeletatas minjjana mala GODAA sinththan woththa» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:4">Ib 9:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 16:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 16:34"/>GODAY Muse azazida mala minjjanaas, Aarooney mannaa GODAA markka Taabotaa sinththan woththides. <verse eid="EXO 16:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 16:35"/>Isra7eele asay ba daana biitta bi gakkanaas oyddu tammu layth kumeth manna mida; Istti Kanaane biitta zawa gakkanaas manna mishe de7ida. <verse eid="EXO 16:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 16:36"/>Issi kiloynne baggay he wode makkiza gita maka miishshas tammaafe issi kushekko.<verse eid="EXO 16:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EXO 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Zaalla Shuchchafe Haaththa Kes</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 20:1-13">Zaare 20:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 17:1"/>Isra7eele maabaray wuri GODAY azazida mala Siina geetettiza bazzofe dendi biidi Erafidime geetettizason uttides; gido attiin asaas uyanaas haaththi heen beettibeenna. <verse eid="EXO 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 17:2"/>Hessa gishshas istti Musera ooyettidi iza, «Nuus uyana haath imma» gida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 17:2">Musey zaaridi, «Intte tanara ays ooyetteetii? GODAA intte ays paacceetii?» gides. <verse eid="EXO 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 17:3"/>Gido attiin asay heen saamettidi Muse bolla zuuzumides. Istti, «Neni nuna, nu naytanne nu mehe saamon wodhdhanaas Gibxeppe ays kessadii?» giidi Muse bolla gugumida. <verse eid="EXO 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 17:4"/>Histtiin Musey, «Tani ha asaa wosttoo? Istti tana shuchchan caddana geettes» giidi GODAAKKO waassides.<verse eid="EXO 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 17:5"/>GODAY Muse, «Isra7eele asaa cimatappe nenara ekkada, kase neni Abbaye Shaafa haaththaa izara shocida guufeza ne kushen oykkada asaappe sinth ba. <verse eid="EXO 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 17:6"/>Tani Siina zuman diza zaallaa bolla heen ne sinththan eqqada naagana; neni he zaallaa shoca; asay uyana mala haaththi izappe kezana» giin Musey Isra7eele cimata sinththan izi gida mala ooththides.<verse eid="EXO 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 17:7"/>Isra7eele asay, «GODAY nu giddon dizeyee? Deennee?» gi GODAA paaccidi ooyettida gishshas he sohoza Musey Maasanne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Maasa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maasa guussi Ibraaweta qaalara, «Paaceteth» guussa.</char></note> Mariiba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mariiba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mariiba guussi Ibraaweta qaalara, «Zuuzunth» woykko «Paaceteth» guussa.</char></note> gi sunththides.<verse eid="EXO 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amaaleeqeta Xooneteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 17:8"/>Amaaleeqe asay yiidi Erafidimen Isra7eele nayta olides. <verse eid="EXO 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 17:9"/>Musey Iyaaso, «Neni nuus asaa garsafe issi issi as doora ekkada wonto Amaaleeqetara olettana keza; tanikka Xoossa guufe oykkada dhoqqasohon eqqana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 17:10"/>Iyaasoy Musey gida mala, Amaaleeqetara olettides. Musey, Aarooneynne Huurey dhoqqaso kezida. <verse eid="EXO 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 17:11"/>Musey ba kushe pude denththishin Isra7eele asay xoonees shin izi ba kushe ziqqisishin Amaaleeqe asay xoonees. <verse eid="EXO 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 17:12"/>Muse kushey ixettishin Aarooneynne Huurey shuch ekki ehidi Muse iza bolla utisida. Istti issoy issi baggara ushachcha kushaa issoy issi baggara hadirsa kushaa dhoqqu histti oykkida. Histtiin arshey wullana gakkanaas iza kushey dhoqqu gi gam7ides. <verse eid="EXO 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 17:13"/>Hessa gishshas Iyaasoy Amaaleeqe olanchchatanne Amaaleeqe asaa giththa mashshan xoonides.<verse eid="EXO 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 17:14"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muses, «Tani Amaaleeqe asay qofettontta mala istta biitta bollafe kumeth dhayssana. Hayssi ubba wode qofettana mala maxaafan xaafada Iyaasos nababa sissontta aggofa» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:17-19">Zaare 25:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:2-9">1Same 15:2-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 17:15"/>Museykka yarsho yarshizaso ooththidi, «GODAY ta Bandira» gi sunththides. <verse eid="EXO 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 17:16"/>Qasseka, «Tumappe GODAY ba kushe denththidi yeletappe yeleta gakkanaas Amaaleeqetara olettanaas caaqqides» gides.<verse eid="EXO 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EXO 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Muse Be7ana Yootore Yeeth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 18:1"/>Midiyaame biitta qeese, Muse bollo Yootorey, Xoossay Musessinne iza asaa Isra7eele naytas ooththidayssa hessika GODAY istta Gibxe biittafe kessidayssa ubbaa siyides.<verse eid="EXO 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="EXO 18:2-3"/>He wode Muse bollo Yootorey, Musey guye zaari moyzida Muse machcheyo Xipooronne izi nam7u nayta banara ekki yides. Museykka, «Tani asa biittan bete as gidadis» gishe bayra naaza Gershoome gi sunththides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:21-22">Kessa 2:21-22</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:29">Hawa 7:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 18:2-3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 18:4"/>Qasseka, «Ta aawaa Xoossi tana maaddides; izi tana Gibxe kawo toorappe ashshides» gishe Nam7anththo naaza El7ezeere gi sunththides.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">El7ezeere guussi Ibraaweta qaalara, «Xoossay maaddides» guussa.</char></note><verse eid="EXO 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 18:5"/>Muse bollo Yootorey Muse attuma naytaranne Muse machcheyra gididi bazzon Xoossa zuma achchan diza Musekko yides. <verse eid="EXO 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 18:6"/>Izi, «Tani ne bollo Yootorey, ne machcheyranne izi nayta nam7atara neekko he boos» giidi kiita Musekko yeddides.<verse eid="EXO 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 18:7"/>Hessa gishshas Musey ba bollozara gaagganaas kezidi hokkidi iza yeerides. Istti issoy issaa saroththidaappe guye Muse dunkaane giddo gelida. <verse eid="EXO 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 18:8"/>GODAY Isra7eele asaa gishshas Gibxe kawo bollanne Gibxe asaa bolla ooththidayssa, oge bolla istta gakkida daaburanne GODAY istta ashshidayssa ubbaa Musey ba bollozas yootides.<verse eid="EXO 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 18:9"/>Isra7eele asaa, Gibxe asaa kusheppe ashshanaas GODAY ooththida lo7o ooso ubbaa siyidi Yootorey ufayettides. <verse eid="EXO 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 18:10"/>«Inttena Gibxe asaa kusheppenne kawo Paaroone kusheppe ashshida GODAY ba asaa Gibxe asaa kusheppe kessi ekkidayssi izi galatetto. <verse eid="EXO 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 18:11"/>Izi Isra7eele asaa bolla otorettidaytas hayssa ooththida gishshas GODAY hara eeqa xoossata ubbaafe gooba gididayssa tani ha7i eradis» gides. <verse eid="EXO 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 18:12"/>Hessafe guye Muse bollo Yootorey xuugettiza yarsho qasseka hara yarshota Xoossas shiishshides. Aarooneynne Isra7eele cimati wuri Xoossa sinththan Muse bollozara kath maanaas yida.<verse eid="EXO 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Deres Pirdiza Asati Doorettida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:9-18">Zaare 1:9-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 18:13"/>Wonteththa gallas Musey asaas pirdanaas uttiin asay iza sinththan yiidi yiidi eqqiza gishshas Musey maaladoppe omarsa wode gakkanaas uttides. <verse eid="EXO 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 18:14"/>Muse bolloy Musey asaas ooththizayssa ubbaa be7idi, «Neni ha asaas ooththizayssi hayssi aazee? Hayssi asay wuri maaladoppe doommidi omarsa wode gakkanaas ne sinththan yiidi yiidi eqqishin, maadoy baynda asa mala neni nerkka ays pirdas uttadii?» gides.<verse eid="EXO 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 18:15"/>Histtiin Musey ba bollozas, «Asay Xoossa shene oychchanaas taakko yiza gishshassa. <verse eid="EXO 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 18:16"/>Istta giddon yo7oy diikko taakko yeettes; tanikka istta giddon diza yo7o pirdays; Xoossa maaraanne wogaa istta erisays» gides.<verse eid="EXO 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 18:17"/>Yootoreykka, «Hayssi neni ooththizayssi lo7o deenna. <verse eid="EXO 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 18:18"/>Neninne nenara diza asay daabura xalala daabureeta; hayssi oosozi nees daro deexo; neni hayssa nerkka ooththanaas dandayakka. <verse eid="EXO 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 18:19"/>Ane ha7i ta nena zorays! Ta yootizayssa siya; Xoossi nenara gido. Neni ha asaa gishshas Xoossa sinththan eqqa; asaza yo7okka Xoossako shiishsha. <verse eid="EXO 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 18:20"/>Xoossa maaraanne wogaa istta neni tamaarsa; istti waani daanaakko istti ooththana ooso istta bessa. <verse eid="EXO 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 18:21"/>Qasse asa ubbaa giddofe era asata, Xoossas babbizayta, ammanettidaytanne matta7e ixxizayta doorada isttafe asaas shaalaqata, mato halaqata, hamsa halaqatanne asira halaqata histta sunththa. <verse eid="EXO 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 18:22"/>Istti ubba wode asaas pirdetto; gido attiin deexo yo7o ubbaa neekko ehetto; waayisontta yo7o ubbaa istti heen wursetto. Istti nenara gishettiza gishshas toohoy nees kawuyana. <verse eid="EXO 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 18:23"/>Neni hessaththo ooththiko hayssi Xoossa shene gidikko neni daro daaburakka. Qasse ha asay wurikka ba yo7oy polettiin ufayssan ba soo ba soo baana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 18:24"/>Musey ba bolloza qaala siyides; izi gidayssa ubbaaka ooththides. <verse eid="EXO 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 18:25"/>Musey Isra7eele ubbaa giddofe era asata dooridi asaa kaaleththiza shaalaqata, mato halaqata, hamsa halaqatanne asira halaqata histti sunththides. <verse eid="EXO 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 18:26"/>Isttika asaas ubba wode pirdida; bana deexxida yo7oza Musekko ehida shin deexxontta yo7oza ubbaa barkka wursida.<verse eid="EXO 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 18:27"/>Hessafe guye Musey ba bollo Yootore moyziin Yootorey guye ba dere simmides.<verse eid="EXO 18:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EXO 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Goday Siina Zuma Bolla Isra7eele Asaas Qoncceth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 19:1"/>Isra7eele asay Gibxeppe kezida heedzdzanththo aginan koyro gallas Siina bazzo gakkides. <verse eid="EXO 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 19:2"/>Istti Erafidimeppe dendidi Siina bazzo biidi bazzon diza zumaa sinththan uttida. <verse eid="EXO 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 19:3"/>Museykka Xoossaako pude zumaa bolla keziin GODAY zumaa bolla dishe iza xeygidi, «Neni Yaaqoobe keeththa as gidida Isra7eele naytas hizga yoota; <verse eid="EXO 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 19:4"/>‹Tani Gibxe asaa bolla ay ooththidaakko qasse golle kafoy ba naa ba qefen tookkiza mala tani inttena wostta tookkada taakko ehidaakko intte intte ayfera beyideta. <verse eid="EXO 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 19:5"/>Histtiin ha7i intte taas kumeth azazettiko, intte ta caaqo qaalaa naagikko, kumeththa deraa garsan intte taas buzo dere gidana. Biittay wuri taas gidikkoka,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:20">Zaare 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:18">26:18</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tito 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1Phex 2:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 19:6"/>intte ta kawoteththaas dumma shaakettida qeesetanne dumma dere gidana;› Neni Isra7eele naytas yootana qaalay hayssa» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:6">Ajju 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:10">5:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 19:7"/>Histtiin Musey zumaa bollafe duge asaakko wodhidi dere cimata xeygi shiishshidi GODAY yoota gida qaalata ubbaa isttas yootides. <verse eid="EXO 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 19:8"/>Asay wuri issi qaalan gididi, «GODAY gidayssa ubbaa nu ooththana» giin Musey istti gidayssa GODAAKKO ekki bides.<verse eid="EXO 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 19:9"/>GODAY Muse, «Tani nenara haasayshin asay siyana malanne istti nenan ubba wodekka ammanettana mala, tani neekko wolqqama shaarara yaana» gides. Hessafe guye Musey asay gidayssa GODAAS yootides.<verse eid="EXO 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 19:10"/>GODAY Muses, «Neni asaakko baada hachchinne wonto istta geeshsha. Istti ba may7o meeccidi, <verse eid="EXO 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 19:11"/>heedzdzanththo gallassas giigettetto. Gaasoykka heedzdzanththo gallassan asay wuri beyishin tani GODAY Siina zuma bolla wodhdhana. <verse eid="EXO 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 19:12"/>Neni asay dizaso yuushon asaas zawa woththada isttas, ‹Zuma bolla pude kezontta mala woykko zumaa xapho bochchontta mala inttena erite. Zuma bochchiday oonikka tumappe hayqqanaas bessees. <verse eid="EXO 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 19:13"/>As woykko mehe gidiin zawa pinni aadhdhiko oonikka ba kushen iza bochchontta shuchchan caddidi woykko wondafen dukkidi wodho› gees. Zaye goochchi punniko istti pude zumaa bolla kezana dandayeettes» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:18-20">Ib 12:18-20</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 19:14"/>Musey zumaappe asaakko duge wodhdhidaappe guye asaa geeshshiin asay ba may7o meeccides. <verse eid="EXO 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 19:15"/>Asaakka, «Heedzdzanththo gallassas giigettite; maccassara aqopite» gides.<verse eid="EXO 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 19:16"/>Heedzdzanththo gallas maalado dada giirissi siyettides. Wolqqanththa poo7oynne wolqqama shaaray zumaa bolla beettides; Zayey punettiza daro wolqqama giirissi siyettides. Hessa gishshas asay wuri ba dizason babbidi kokkorides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:5">Ajju 4:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 19:17"/>Museykka asaa Xoossara gaththanaas asay dizasoppe kessiin asay zumaa achchan eqqides. <verse eid="EXO 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 19:18"/>GODAY Siina zumaa bolla tamara wodhdhida gishshas gita cooceppe keziza mala cuway tullu gi kezidi zumaa kumeth kammides; zumazi kumeth keehi qaaxxides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:11-12">Zaare 4:11-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 19:19"/>Zayeza giirissayka keehi dari dari bida wode Musey haasayiin haasayiin Xoossi izas zaari zaaridi qaalan haasaydes. <verse eid="EXO 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 19:20"/>GODAY kase Siina zumaa bolla wodhdhida wode Muse pude zumaa hu7e xeygiin Musey pude kezides. <verse eid="EXO 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 19:21"/>GODAY iza, «Neni duge baada asay beyana giidi haa taakko zawa aadhdhontta malanne isttafe daroti hayqqontta mala asaa hanqa. <verse eid="EXO 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 19:22"/>Haray attoshin ta mata shiiqiza qeesetikka ubba wode bana geeshshanaas koshshees; histtontta ixxiko GODAY istta qaxxayana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 19:23"/>Musey GODAAS, «Asay zumaa bolla pude yaanaas dandayenna; ays giikko neni ne hu7en, ‹Ha sohoza geeshsha mala dummasada, ha zumaa achchan zawa woththite› gaada nuus yoota woththadasa» gides.<verse eid="EXO 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 19:24"/>Histtiin GODAY iza, «Neni duge ha7i elle wodhdhada pude keza. Aarooneykka nenara yo. Qeesetanne asaa ta qaxxayontta mala istti zawa pinnidi pude taakko yoopetto» gides. <verse eid="EXO 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 19:25"/>Hessa gishshas Musey duge asaakko wodhdhidi GODAY gidayssa isttas yootides.<verse eid="EXO 19:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EXO 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Tammu Azazota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 5:1-21">Zaare 5:1-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 20:1"/>GODAY haasayda qaalati ubbay hayssafe kaallizayta; <verse eid="EXO 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 20:2"/>«Nena Gibxeppe aylleteththa biittafe kessida GODAA ne Xoossay tana.<verse eid="EXO 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 20:3"/>«Taappe attiin hara eeqa xoossatas goynnofa.<verse eid="EXO 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 20:4"/>«Bolla salon diza miish gidiin, woykko garsa sa7an diza miish gidiin, woykko biittafe garsan haaththa giddon diza miish gidiin aykkoka misatissada nees misle histtada medhdhofa. <verse eid="EXO 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 20:5"/>Isttas hokkofanne isttas goynnofa. Ays giikko tani GODAA ne Xoossay qanaatiza Xoossako; tana ixxizayta aawata nagara gishshas nayta heedzdzanththo yeletanne oydanththo yeleta gakkanaas qaxxayays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:17">Kessa 34:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:4">Lewe 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:1">26:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:15-18">Zaare 4:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:15">27:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 20:6"/>Qasse tani tana siiqizaytassinne ta azazo naagizaytas daro shii yeleteth gakkanaas tani ta siiqo bessiza Xoossa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6-7">Kessa 34:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:18">Tay 14:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:9-10">Zaare 7:9-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 20:7"/>«GODAA ne Xoossaa sunth hadan denththofa; ays giikko GODAA ne Xoossay ba sunth hadan denththizayta qaxxayana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lewe 19:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 20:8"/>«Sambata gallassa hara gallassatappe dummasada naaga.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:23-30">Kessa 16:23-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 20:9"/>Ne ooththiza ooso ubbaa usuppun gallassatan ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 20:10"/>Gido attiin laappunththa gallassay GODAA ne Xoossaas Sambata. He gallas aykko oosokka ooththofa; neni woykko ne attuma nay, woykko ne macca nay, woykko ne attuma aylley, woykko ne macca aylley, woykko ne miizay, woykko ne deren diidi nees ooththiza hara dere as gidiin he gallassan ay oosokka ooththofte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:12">Kessa 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:15">31:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:21">34:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 35:2">35:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:3">Lewe 23:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 20:11"/>Ays giikko usuppun gallassan GODAY salo, sa7a, abbanne istta giddon diza ubbaa medhdhidi laappunththa gallas shempides. Hessa gishshas GODAY Sambata gallassaa anjjidessinne dummasides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:1-3">Medhe 2:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:17">Kessa 31:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 20:12"/>«GODAA ne Xoossay nees immiza biittan ne daro layth daana mala, ne aawaanne ne aayo bonchcha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:16">Zaare 27:16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:4">Mato 15:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:19">19:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:10">Mar 7:10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luqa 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:2-3">Efe 6:2-3</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 20:13"/>«As wodhoppa.<verse eid="EXO 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 20:14"/>«Laymatoppa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lewe 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:27">Mato 5:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luqa 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Oro 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:11">Yaaqo 2:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 20:15"/>«Kaysotoppa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:11">Lewe 19:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">Mato 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luqa 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Oro 13:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 20:16"/>«Oona bollaka wordo markkattofa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:1">Kessa 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">Mato 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luqa 18:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 20:17"/>«Asa keeth amottofa; asa machcho woykko iza aylle woykko iza aylleyo woykko iza boora woykko iza hare woykko izas diza ay miishshika amottofa» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:7">Oro 7:7</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">13:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 20:18"/>Asay wuri daday giirizayssanne zayey zayetizayssa siyidi qasse wolqqanththi wolqqamizayssanne zumay cuwattizayssa be7idi kokkorishe haahon eqqides. <verse eid="EXO 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 20:19"/>Asay Muses, «Nuni hayqqontta mala Xoossi nunara haasayoppo; neni nuus yoota; nuni siyana» gida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:18-19">Ib 12:18-19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 20:20"/>Musey asaas, «Xoossi inttena paaccanaas, iza yashshi intte wozinan kumiin intte nagara ooththontta mala yida gishshas babbofte» gides. <verse eid="EXO 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 20:21"/>Asay haahon eqqi dishin Musey Xoossi dizaso wolqqama shaara dhumaakko shiiqides.<verse eid="EXO 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yarsho Yarshiza Soho Gishshas Imettida Wogata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 20:22"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muse, «Isra7eele asaas, ‹Tani saloppe inttes haasayshin intte intte ayfera be7ideta. <verse eid="EXO 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 20:23"/>Taappe attiin hara xoossi inttes dooppo; birappe woykko worqqafe inttes eeqa xoossata medhdhidi goynnofte.<verse eid="EXO 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 20:24"/>« ‹Neni taas yarsho yarshizaso urqqafe medhdhada xuugettiza yarshota, issifeteththa yarshota, ne dorsatappe, ne deyshatappenne ne mehetappe iza bolla yarsha. Ta sunththi qofettana mala, intte ooththidaso ubbaa soho yaada ta inttena anjjana. <verse eid="EXO 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 20:25"/>Neni taas yarsho yarshizaso shuchchafe ooththizaa gidikko masettida shuchchafe ooththofa; ays giikko neni massiza biratan iza bochchiko ne iza tunisaasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:5-7">Zaare 27:5-7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 8:31">Iya 8:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 20:26"/>Taas yarsho yarshizaso pude kezanaas yangare medhdhada iza bolla kezoppa; gaasoykka neni keziza wode ne kalloteththi beettana› gaada yoota» gides.<verse eid="EXO 20:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EXO 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Aylleta Ayso Woga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 15:12-18">Zaare 15:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 21:1"/>«Neni Isra7eele naytas immana wogay hayssa. <verse eid="EXO 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 21:2"/>Neni Isra7eele nayta garsafe aylle shammiko izi nees usuppun layth ooththo; gido attiin laappunththa layththan izi aykkoka qanxxontta aylleteththafe coo mela yedetto. <verse eid="EXO 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 21:3"/>Izi barkka yidaa gidikko barkka bo; ba machcheyra yidaa gidikko iza machcheyakka izara bu. <verse eid="EXO 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 21:4"/>Iza goday izas machcho ekkidaa gidikko machcheya izas adde nayta woykko macca nayta yelidaa gidikko, he maccassayanne izi nayti iza godaas attiko izi barkka kezi bo. <verse eid="EXO 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 21:5"/>Gido attiin he aylley, ‹Tani ta godaa, ta machchiyonne ta nayta siiqays; tani aylleteththafe kezikke› giikko, <verse eid="EXO 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 21:6"/>iza goday iza pirdiza asa sinth aaththo; hessafe guye keeththa penge woykko penge qosilaththaako iza efidi iza hayth goonththan lukko. Histtiko izi ba de7o layth ubbaan izas aylle gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:39-46">Lewe 25:39-46</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 21:7"/>«Asi ba macca nayo aylleteththas bayzikko adde aylleti aylleteththafe keziza mala iza kezuppu. <verse eid="EXO 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 21:8"/>Iza bana dooridi efida godaa ufayssontta ixxiko izi goday izo wozzisanaas koshshees. Izi izis ammanettontta aggida gishshas izo allagas bayzana bessenna. <verse eid="EXO 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 21:9"/>Izi izo ba naas ekkanaas koykko ba macca naas ooththiza mala izis bessizayssa ooththo. <verse eid="EXO 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 21:10"/>Izi baas hara machcho ekkiko koyro machcheys quma woykko may7o pacisoppo; qasse izira aqo aggofo. <verse eid="EXO 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 21:11"/>Izi hayta heedzdzata izis immontta ixxiko aykko miishsheyka qanxxettontta aylleteththafe kezada bu.<verse eid="EXO 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iita Ooththida Asati Qaxxayettiza Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 21:12"/>«As wodhida asi hayqqanaas bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:17">Lewe 24:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 21:13"/>Xoossa shene gidi uttiin qoppontta dishe as wodhidaadey tani giigsidaso bete bo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:10-34">Tay 35:10-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">Zaare 19:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Iya 20:1-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 21:14"/>Gido attiin as wodhana qoppidi erishe hara as wodhikko hessaadey attanaas giidi he ta giigsida taas yarsho shiishshizaso yiikko yarshizasohozappe haraso efada wodha.<verse eid="EXO 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 21:15"/>«Ba aawa woykko ba aayo wadhdhiza asi oonikka hayqqo.<verse eid="EXO 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 21:16"/>«Asa wolqqan oykkidi bayzizaadey woykko wolqqan oykkiin asi iza kushen beettidaadey hayqqanaas bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:7">Zaare 24:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 21:17"/>«Ba aawa woykko ba aayo cayizaadey hayqqo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:9">Lewe 20:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:4">Mato 15:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:10">Mar 7:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 21:18"/>«Nam7u asati ba garsan ooyettiko, issoy issaa shuchchara caddiko woykko kushera icciko he qohettidaadezi hayqqontta hargidi hiixan ichchiko, <verse eid="EXO 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 21:19"/>hessafe dendidi guufera kare giddon hemettiko, he qohidayssi qaxxayettontta attees; gidikkoka izi iza ooso teqqida gishshas miishshe qanxxanaassinne izi paxana gakkanaas iza xeellanaas koshshees.<verse eid="EXO 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 21:20"/>«Asi ba attuma aylle woykko macca aylleyo guufen shocikko he shochchaa geedon heerakka iza kushen hayqqiko shocidayssi qaxxayettanaas bessees. <verse eid="EXO 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 21:21"/>Gido attiin he qohettidayssi issi gallas woykko nam7u gallas gakkanaas hayqqontta aggiko he ayllezi iza miish gidida gishshas izi qaxxayettenna.<verse eid="EXO 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 21:22"/>«Nam7u asati ba garsan issoy issaara ooyettishe qanththara diza maccassayo boshas gaththiko, hessafe hara iita miish izi bolla gaththontta aggiko, izi bolla qoho gaththidaadey he maccassay azinay oychchidayssa daannati pirdiko ay miishsheka qanxxo. <verse eid="EXO 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 21:23"/>Gido attiin izis boshay darikko shemppo gishshas shemppo, <verse eid="EXO 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 21:24"/>ayfe gishshas ayfe, achcha gishshas achcha, kushe gishshas kushe, toho gishshas toho,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:19-20">Lewe 24:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:21">Zaare 19:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:38">Mato 5:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 21:25"/>xuussa gishshas xuus, madunththa gishshas madunth, qoo7o gishshas qoo7o ekkanaas bessees.<verse eid="EXO 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 21:26"/>«Issi asi attuma woykko macca aylle ayfe shoci toyssiko he ayfeza gishshas aylleteththafe kessi yeddo. <verse eid="EXO 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 21:27"/>Hessaththoka ba aylley woykko ba aylleza ach menththiko he achchaa gishshas aylleteththafe kessi yeddo.<verse eid="EXO 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 21:28"/>«Booray maccas woykko attumas icci wodhikko, he booray shuchchan cadetti hayqqo; iza ashoy meetettofo. Gido attiin boora goday qaxxayettofo. <verse eid="EXO 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 21:29"/>Gido attiin booray kasekka icciza boora gidikko, asay booraza godaas yootidishin booraa goday booraa qachchontta aggiko, booray adde woykko macca as wodhikko he booray shuchchan cadetti hayqqo; qasse booraza godaykka hayqqo. <verse eid="EXO 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 21:30"/>Gido attiin izi cigo qanxxana mala oyshettiko istti oychchidayssa ay gidikkoka qanxxidi ba shemppo wozzo. <verse eid="EXO 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 21:31"/>Booray attuma naa woykko macca naa icci wodhikko pirday issi mala gido. <verse eid="EXO 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 21:32"/>Booray attuma aylle woykko macca aylleyo icci wodhikko booraa goday aylleza godaas heedzdzu tammu bira ciggo; booraykka shuchchan cadettidi hayqqo.<verse eid="EXO 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 21:33"/>«Issi asi olla kama qaarikko woykko olla bookkidi kammontta aggiko, booray woykko harey he ollaan wulliko, <verse eid="EXO 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 21:34"/>he ollaza goday meheza waaga qanxxo. Izi meheza godaas waaga qanxxidi hayqeththaa baas ekko.<verse eid="EXO 21:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 21:35"/>«Issi asa booray hara asa boora icci wodhikko, icci wodhida paxa booraa bayzidi iza miishshanne hayqqida booraza ashoza giddon gina shaakki ekketto. <verse eid="EXO 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 21:36"/>Gido attiin he booray icciza boora gididayssi kaseti erettishin, iza goday iza qachchontta aggiko, iza goday booraa gishshas boora qanxxidi he hayqqidayssa baas ekko.<verse eid="EXO 21:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EXO 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Asi Ba Haaro Naagiza Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 22:1"/>«Issi asi boora woykko dorsa kaysoti ekkidi shukkiko, woykko bayzi ekkiko, issi boora gishshas ichchashu boora, issi dorsa gishshas oyddu dors qanxxo.<verse eid="EXO 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 22:2"/>«Kaysoy keeth bookkishe oykettidi shocetti hayqqiko shocidayssi suuth gussida gishshas oychchettenna. <verse eid="EXO 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 22:3"/>Gido attiin hessi gadey wonti geyiin hanizaa gidikko izi he gukkida suuththaa acon oyshettees. Kaysozi kaysotidayssa qanxxo; gido attiin izas aykkoyka bayndaa gidikko kaysotidayssa qanxxanaas izi bayzetto. <verse eid="EXO 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 22:4"/>Izi kaysotida mehey paxa dishe iza kushen beettiko, boora woykko hare woykko dorsa gidikkoka izi ba kaysotidayssas nam7u kushe qanxxo.<verse eid="EXO 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 22:5"/>«Issi asi ba mehe demban woykko ayfey meetettiza miththa giddon heemmishe, meheta hara asa kaththan la7a yeddi heemmiko, izi ba kaththaafe woykko ayfey meetettiza ba miththa ubbaafe lo7izayssa afilaama qanxxo.<verse eid="EXO 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 22:6"/>«Issi asi buuraa xuuggiko tamay dendidi buuraza wursidi dooren diza kath woykko eqon diza kaththaa mulera mizaa gidikko koyro tama oyththida addezi afilaama qanxxo.<verse eid="EXO 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 22:7"/>«Issi asi bira woykko hara miish naagissanaas ba shooros hadara immiko, shoorozasoppe he miishshaa kaysotida kaysozi oykettiko, kaysozi he miishshas nam7u kushe qanxxo. <verse eid="EXO 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 22:8"/>Gido attiin kaysozi beettontta ixxiko, hadara ekkida addezi pirdizaytakko shiiqidi hadara miishsha izi miishshaa monttayssas caaqqo.<verse eid="EXO 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 22:9"/>«Asi ay mootonkka boora geedon, woykko hare geedon, woykko dorsa geedon, woykko may7o geedon, woykko hara dhayda miishsha geedon, ‹Hayssi tayssa› giidi mootettiko, nam7u baggayka ba yo7oza pirdizayta sinth aaththetto; pirdizayti wordosida asi hankkoyssas nam7u kushe qanxxo.<verse eid="EXO 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 22:10"/>«Asi ba shooros hare, woykko boora, woykko dorsa, woykko hara ay mehekka hadara immiin oonikka be7ontta hayqqiko, woykko qohettiko, woykko asi bonqqi efikko, <verse eid="EXO 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 22:11"/>hadaraaddey ba shooro meheza bochchonttayssas GODAA sinththan caaqqiko, istta giddon diza yo7ozi wurees. He meheza goday caaqoza ekko; qanxxisanaas bessenna. <verse eid="EXO 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 22:12"/>Gido attiin mehezi hadaraaddefe kaysotettidaa gidikko mehaaddes qanxxo. <verse eid="EXO 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 22:13"/>He meheza do7ay midaa gidikko, markka gidana mala do7ay mishin attidayssafe ekki ehi besso; histtidi meetettida meheza gishshas qanxxofo.<verse eid="EXO 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 22:14"/>«Asi ba shooroppe mehe garxxi ekkiko iza goday bayndason he mehey qohettiko woykko hayqqiko he meheza gishshas qanxxo. <verse eid="EXO 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 22:15"/>Gido attiin iza goday izara diikko, garxxidayssi qanxxofo; kiras ekkidaa gidikko kiras ciggiza miishshay acozas qanxxo gido.<verse eid="EXO 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Geeshsha De7onne Ammano Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 22:16"/>«Issi asi azinas giigontta geela7oyo baleththidi izira zin7izaa gidikko izo cilooshidi baas machcho ekko. <verse eid="EXO 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 22:17"/>Izi aaway izo izas immontta ixxiko, geela7oyo ekkiza asi cilooshas imettiza miishshaa keena bira izi aawaas immo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 22:28-29">Zaare 22:28-29</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 22:18"/>«Bita bitiza maccas paxa woththofa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:10-11">Zaare 18:10-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 22:19"/>«Mehera gaaggiza asi oonikka hayqqo.<verse eid="EXO 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 22:20"/>«GODAAS xalalappe attiin hara xoossas shukki yarshiza asi oonikka hayqqi dhayo.<verse eid="EXO 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 22:21"/>«Betidi yida as qohopite, woykko waayisopite; gaasoykka intteka Gibxe biittan bete gididi de7ideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:21-22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:9">Kessa 23:9</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:33-34">Lewe 19:33-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:17-18">Zaare 24:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:19">27:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 22:22"/>Azinay hayqqida am7eyonne aaway woykko aaya hayqqida naa waayisopite. <verse eid="EXO 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 22:23"/>Intte istta waayisiin istti taakko waassiko tani istta waaso tumappe siyana; <verse eid="EXO 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 22:24"/>he wode ta hanqoy intte bolla dendana; tani inttena mashshan wursana; intte machcheti am7eta intte naytikka aaway baynda yi7o nayta gidana.<verse eid="EXO 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 22:25"/>«Intte giddon diza ta asaas issi manqo asas miishshe tal7iko, ba miish dichchas immiza asa mala hanopite; neni yelo iza oychchofa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:35-38">Lewe 25:35-38</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:7-11">Zaare 15:7-11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:19-20">23:19-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 22:26"/>Neni issi miishsha gishshas ne lagge may7o oykkiko arshey wullontta dishin izas zaara. <verse eid="EXO 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 22:27"/>Aazas giikko izi ba kallo kammizay izin xalla; hara ay may7idi aqanaas dandayzee? Izi taas waassiko ta mishettiza gishshas izas siyananne iza maaddana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:10-13">Zaare 24:10-13</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 22:28"/>«Xoossa bolla cashsha qaala haasayoppa, woykko dere ayssizaade qanggofa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:5">Hawa 23:5</ref></char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xoossan gizayssa pirdizaytan gaana dandayettees.</char></note><verse eid="EXO 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 22:29"/>«Ne kaththa xeera, woyne miththa ayfe xeeranne wogara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:29 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wogara: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wogara gizayssa issi issi bagga Gamoththo qaalan woyra woykko shamaho woykko gultta geettes.</char></note> zayte taas yarsho shiishsha. Neni ne attuma nayta giddon bayratiza naa taas immanaas bessees. <verse eid="EXO 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 22:30"/>Boorappe, deyshafenne dorsafekka hessaththo ooththa. Istti laappun gallassay gakkanaas, ba aayira aayira gam7etto; osppunththa gallas istta taas imma.<verse eid="EXO 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 22:31"/>«Intte taas geeshsha as gidanaas koshshees; hessa gishshas do7ay demban wodhida woykko dafi daakkida mehe asho kanas yeggite attiin moopite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:15">Lewe 17:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 22:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EXO 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Tuma Pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 23:1"/>«Wordo yo7o laallofa; wordo markkattada iita as maaddofa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:16">Kessa 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:11-12">Lewe 19:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:20">Zaare 5:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 23:2"/>«Iita miish ooththanaas daro asa kaallofa; pirda mirqqanaas daro asaara gidada markkattofa. <verse eid="EXO 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 23:3"/>Manqo asi pirdaso shiiqikko iza manqoteth be7ada maadda pirdofa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:15">Lewe 19:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 23:4"/>«Ne morkke booray woykko harey dhaydayssa demmiko izaades zaara imma. <verse eid="EXO 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 23:5"/>Nena ixxiza asas harey caanara kundi dishin be7ikko izara maadettada denththa attiin heen agaagoppa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 22:1-4">Zaare 22:1-4</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 23:6"/>«Pirdas dubbushan shiiqada, manqo asa pirda wobbisoppa. <verse eid="EXO 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 23:7"/>Wordo mooto siyoppa; geesh woykko xillo as hayqos aaththa immofa; ays giikko mooro ooththidaade tani mela yeddike.<verse eid="EXO 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 23:8"/>«Matta7e ekkofa; aazas giikko matta7ey xeellizayta ayfe qooqiseessinne xillota qaala mirqqees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:15">Lewe 19:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:19">Zaare 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:9">23:9</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 22:21">Kessa 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:33-34">Lewe 19:33-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:17-18">Zaare 24:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:19">27:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 23:9"/>«Hara dereppe yida bete as qohoppite; bete as gideththi ay mala deexxizaakko intte ereeta; ays giikko intte intte hu7en bete gididi Gibxe biittan de7ideta.<verse eid="EXO 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laappunththa Layththinne Laappunththa Gallas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 23:10"/>«Usuppun layth gakkanaas ne goyada zerida kaththa maxa shiishsha. <verse eid="EXO 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 23:11"/>Laappunththa layththan gadeza goyontta shaachcha; histtiko ne dere garsan diza manqoti hessafe maana kath demmana; qasse isttafe attizayssa do7ati maana. Neni ne woyne tokkiza gade bollanne zayte immiza wogara miththa gade bollaka hessaththo ooththa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Lewe 25:1-7</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 23:12"/>«Usuppun gallas ne ooso ooththa; ne booraynne ne harey shempana malanne neson yelettida aylleynne bete asi, shempana mala, laappunththa gallas ooso ooththofa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:9-11">Kessa 20:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:15">31:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:21">34:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 35:2">35:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:3">Lewe 23:3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13-14">Zaare 5:13-14</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 23:13"/>«Tani inttena gidayssa ubbaa minththidi ooththite; hara xoossata sunth xeygopitenne istta woossofte.<verse eid="EXO 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gita Ba7aaleta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 23:14"/>«Layththan heedzdzuto intte taas ba7aale bonchchite. <verse eid="EXO 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 23:15"/>Abibe geetettiza aginan barettida gallassan ukeththa ba7aale bonchchite; ays giikko intte Gibxeppe keziday he aginanna. Tani inttena azazida mala laappun gallas irshoy gelontta uketh miite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:15">«Inttefe issaadeyka ta sinththan mela kushe beettofo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:14-20">Kessa 12:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:6-8">Lewe 23:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:17-25">Tay 28:17-25</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 23:16"/>«Qasse intte intte gaden zeriin, koyro gakkida kath maxiza wode, kaththa xeera shiishshiza ba7aale bonchchite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lewe 23:15-21</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 23:39-43">39-43</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:26-31">Tay 28:26-31</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:16">«Qasseka layththaa wurseththan, kath ubbaa shiishshi wursiza wode, kaththa shiisho ba7aale bonchchite. <verse eid="EXO 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 23:17"/>Addeti wuri ubbaa Haariza GODAA ta sinth layththan heedzdzuto yetto.<verse eid="EXO 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 23:18"/>«Neni yarsho suuth taas shiishshashe irshora uukettida ukeththara shiishshofa. He ba7aaleza bonchchiza gallas yarshettida moodheppe maalados aykkoyka attofo. <verse eid="EXO 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 23:19"/>Ne gaden bayra kaxxida kaththa ubbaafe lo7izayssa GODAA ne Xoossaa soo ekka ya. Deyshsha laaqqa iza aayey maaththan doyssofa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 14:21">Zaare 14:21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:2">26:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hidota Qaalatanne Kaalliza Wogata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 23:20"/>«Ne ogen nena naagana malanne tani nees giigsidaso nena efana mala, tani kiitanchcha ne sinththara yeddana. <verse eid="EXO 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 23:21"/>Izi yootizayssa ero gaada izas azazetta; iza bolla makkallofa; ta iza kiittida gishshas intte nagara ooththiko inttes izi atto geenna. <verse eid="EXO 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 23:22"/>Izi yootizayssa intte lo7eththi siyikko, tani yootizayssa ubbaa ooththiko intte morkketa ubbaa tani morkkana; inttenara eqettizaytara tanikka eqettana. <verse eid="EXO 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 23:23"/>Ta kiitanchchay inttefe sinththe biidi, inttena Amooreta biitta, Hiiteta biitta, Paarizeta biitta, Kanaaneta biitta, Hiiweta biittanne Yaabuseta biitta efana. Tani istta mulera dhayssana. <verse eid="EXO 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 23:24"/>Istta eeqata sinththan hokkofte, woykko goynnofte, woykko istta hano qullofte. Intte istta dhayssanaassinne tuussa mala eqqi diza istta shuchcha eeqata menththereththanaas bessees. <verse eid="EXO 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 23:25"/>GODAA intte Xoossaas goynnite; histtiko, izi inttena kaththaninne haaththan anjjana; ta intte giddofe harge diggana. <verse eid="EXO 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 23:26"/>Intte biittan ay maccasika boshettennanne maynenna. Tani intte daana layth adussana.<verse eid="EXO 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 23:27"/>«Inttenara gaaggiza dereta ubbaa daganththana mala tani ta yashshateth intte sinththara yeddana; intte morkketi wuri inttes zokko zaaridi, baqatana mala ta ooththana. <verse eid="EXO 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 23:28"/>Tani inttefe sinththara kazhe yeddada Hiiweta, Kanaanetanne Hiiteta goodda kessana. <verse eid="EXO 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 23:29"/>Gido attiin biittay kallo attontta malanne do7ay darontta mala, ta istta issi layththa garsan gooddike. <verse eid="EXO 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 23:30"/>Gido attiin intte qoodan daridi, he biittaa laattana gakkanaas, tani istta guuth guuth goodda kessana. <verse eid="EXO 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 23:31"/>Tani intte zawaa Zo7o abbaafe Mediteraane abbaa gakkanaas, bazzofe Efiraaxise shaafaa gaththana. He biittan dizaaz ubbaa tani intte kushen aaththa immana; intteka istta intte sinththafe gooddi kessana. <verse eid="EXO 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 23:32"/>Isttara woykko istta eeqa xoossatara caaqon gelopite. <verse eid="EXO 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 23:33"/>Istta intte biittan woththofte; intte histtontta aggiko istti inttena ta bolla nagara oosisana; ays giikko istta eeqatas goynnizayssi tumappe inttes narxa gidana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 23:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EXO 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossi Ba Asaas Gelida Caaqo Qaala Minththides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 24:1"/>GODAY Muse, «Neni, Aarooney, Nadaabey, Abihuynne Isra7eeleppe laappun tammu dere halaqati GODAAKKO zuma bolla pude kezidi haahon eqqidi taas goynnite. <verse eid="EXO 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 24:2"/>Gido attiin neni nerkka taakko shiiqa; harati ta mata shiiqopetto. Qasse asaykka nenara pude kezoppo» gides.<verse eid="EXO 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 24:3"/>Musey yiidi GODAA qaalanne iza woga ubbaa asaas yootiin asay wuri issi qaalan, «GODAY yootidayssa ubbaa nuni ooththana» gides. <verse eid="EXO 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 24:4"/>Musey GODAY yootidayssa ubbaa xaafides.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 24:4">Wonteththa gallas maalado wonttara dendidi zumaa garsan yarshizaso giigsidi Isra7eele asaa tammanne nam7u qommota sunththan tammanne nam7u shuch tuussa mala essides. <verse eid="EXO 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 24:5"/>Izi Isra7eele asaappe naateththa attuma nayta kiittiin, istti biidi GODAAS mirgota xuugettiza yarshonne issifeteththa yarsho histti yarshida. <verse eid="EXO 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 24:6"/>Musey suuththaafe baggaa ekkidi keretan qolides; attida suuththaa yarsho yarshiza sohozan cacafides. <verse eid="EXO 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 24:7"/>Hessafe guye Caaqo Qaala Maxaafaa ekkidi asaas dhoqqu histtidi nababiin asay, «GODAY yootidayssa ubbaa nuni ooththananne azazettana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 24:8"/>Museykka keretan attida suuththaa ekkidi asaa bolla wuxxidi asaa, «Be7ite, hayssi GODAY hayta qaalata inttes immishe inttenara woththida caaqo suuththa» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:28">Mato 26:28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:24">Mar 14:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:20">Luqa 22:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:25">1Qoro 11:25</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:19-20">Ib 9:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:29">10:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 24:9"/>Hessafe guye Musey, Aarooney, Nadaabey, Abihuynne Isra7eele halaqatappe laappun tammati pude kezidi, <verse eid="EXO 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 24:10"/>Isra7eele Xoossaa be7ida; istti be7oyssika iza tohoppe garsara salo mala geeyi uttida simpere geetettiza shuchchafe oosettida miish misatiza wuyge dizayssako. <verse eid="EXO 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 24:11"/>Gido attiin Xoossi Isra7eele asaa halaqata wodhibeenna; istti Xoossaa be7ida; iza sinththan midanne uyida.<verse eid="EXO 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Siina Zuma Bolla Muse Kes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 24:12"/>GODAY Muses, «Neni taakko zumaa bolla pude haa ya; haa taakko kezada haan gam7a; histtiko neni wogaa tamaarsana mala tani wogaanne azazo iza bolla xaafida lochcha shuchchata nees immana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 24:13"/>Hessafe guye Musey ba aylle Iyaasora baana keziin Musey pude Xoossa zumaa bolla kezides. <verse eid="EXO 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 24:14"/>Isra7eele asaa halaqata izi, «Nuni intteko simmanaashe gakkanaas hayssan diishshite; Aarooneynne Huurey haan inttenara deettes; yo7oy diza asi oonikka isttako bo» gides.<verse eid="EXO 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 24:15"/>Musey zumaa bolla pude keziin Xoossa shaaray zumaa kammides. <verse eid="EXO 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 24:16"/>GODAA bonchchoyka Siina zumaa bolla wodhdhi gam7ides; usuppun gallas gakkanaas shaarazi zumaa goozi oykkides; laappunththa gallassan shaaraa giddora GODAY Muse xeygides. <verse eid="EXO 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 24:17"/>Isra7eele naytas GODAA bonchchoy zumaa xeeran eexxiza tama misatidi beettides. <verse eid="EXO 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 24:18"/>Hessafe guye Musey he shaaraa giddo gelidi pude zumaa bolla kezidi heen oyddu tammu gallassinne oyddu tammu qamma gam7ides.<verse eid="EXO 24:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EXO 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Dunkaane Ooththanaas Imettida Imota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 25:1"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="EXO 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 25:2"/>«Taas imota ehana mala neni Isra7eele naytas yoota; taas immanaas iza wozinay iza imma imma giin immiza asa imota ubbaa ne taas ekka. <verse eid="EXO 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 25:3"/>Intte isttafe ekkana imotay haytantta; worqqa, bira, xarqimala, <verse eid="EXO 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 25:4"/>salo misatiza qacina, ochcha teera misatiza qacina, xeeqa zo7o qacinanne booththa liiqo layno, deysha iske, <verse eid="EXO 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 25:5"/>dharsho ite zo7o qalamen yeggi kessidayssa, abbaa giddon diza issi do7a galba, odoro mith, <verse eid="EXO 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 25:6"/>xomppes wogara zayte, tiyettiza zaytessinne exaanes sawissiza qimame, <verse eid="EXO 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 25:7"/>eefudeninne tira bollan diza kiiseta giddon woththiza margide geetettiza shuchchatanne hara al7o shuchchata.<verse eid="EXO 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 25:8"/>«Histtidi tani istta giddon aqana mala istti taas dumma goynniza soo giigsetto. <verse eid="EXO 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 25:9"/>Xoossa Dunkaanezanne iza giddon diza miishshata tani nena bessiza leemisoza mala ooththite.<verse eid="EXO 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Caaqo Qaala Taabota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 37:1-9">Kessa 37:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 25:10"/>«Istti odoro miththafe adussateththay nam7u wadhanne bagga, gomppay issi wadhanne bagga, dhoqqateththay qasse issi wadhanne bagga gidiza Taabota ooththetto. <verse eid="EXO 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 25:11"/>Soo baggaanne kare baggaa walakay baynda worqqan meesha; iza yuuyi aadhdhanaas bolla bagga xanxaa worqqara yuushsha aaththa ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 25:12"/>Taabotaas oyddu worqqa sagayota ooththada oyddu tohotan issi baggara nam7u sagayota, qasse hankko baggara nam7u sagayota aaththa. <verse eid="EXO 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 25:13"/>Hessafe guye odoro miththafe tooho miththata kessada worqqa tiya. <verse eid="EXO 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 25:14"/>Taabotaa tookkana mala Taabotaza millen diza sagayotan tooho miththata gelththa. <verse eid="EXO 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 25:15"/>Tooho miththati Taabotaa sagayota giddon detto; istti heeppe mulekka kezopetto. <verse eid="EXO 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 25:16"/>Tani nees immiza caaqo qaala markka taabotaa giddon woththa.<verse eid="EXO 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 25:17"/>«Harara walakettontta worqqafe xalala nam7u wadhanne bagga aduqqiza, issi wadhanne bagga aakkiza maaroteththa kama ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 25:18"/>Kamaza xeera nam7u baggara qoxxada nam7u kirubeta worqqafe ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 25:19"/>Issi kirubeza issi bagga gaxan, nam7anththo kirubeza hankko bagga gaxan nam7atakka maaroteththaa kamazara gaththa ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 25:20"/>Kirubeti ba qefe denththidi maaroteththa kamaa bollara kammetto; qasse issoy issaakko simmi uttidi kamazakko xeelletto. <verse eid="EXO 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 25:21"/>Tani nees immiza caaqo qaala markka Taabotaa giddon woththa; qasse kamaza Taabotaas bolla baggara woththa. <verse eid="EXO 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 25:22"/>Caaqo qaala markkay izan diza Taabotaa kamaa bolla diza nam7u kirubetappe giddon tani nenara gaaggada Isra7eele asaas immiza azazo ubbaa heen ta nees immana.<verse eid="EXO 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossas Shiiqiza Uketh Izan Woththiza Xaraphpheeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 37:10-16">Kessa 37:10-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 25:23"/>«Odoro miththafe adussateththay nam7u wadha, gomppay issi wadha, dhoqqateththay qasse issi wadhanne bagga gidiza issi xaraphpheeza ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 25:24"/>Histtada walakay baynda worqqan tiya; qasse iza yuushon worqqa xanxa yuushsha aaththa. <verse eid="EXO 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 25:25"/>Hessaththoka qasse aahoteththi tadhdhako gidiza xanxa iza bolla yuushsha aaththa. Histtada iza bolla worqqa balxxanth yuushsha aaththa. <verse eid="EXO 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 25:26"/>Xaraphpheezazas oyddu worqqa sagayota medhdhada, xaraphpheeza tohoti diza oyddu baggara oyththa. <verse eid="EXO 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 25:27"/>Xaraphpheeza tookkanaas tooho mith iza giddora aaththiza sagayoti xaraphpheezazas xanxa matan detto. <verse eid="EXO 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 25:28"/>He tookkiza miththata odoro miththafe kessada, worqqa tiyada isttara xaraphpheezaza tookka. <verse eid="EXO 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 25:29"/>Hessaththoka qasse saanetanne pil7ota, duuqqana xaarotanne kereta walakay baynda worqqafe ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 25:30"/>Ta sinth aadhdhiza geeshsha ukeththay ubba wodekka xaraphpheeza bollafe dhayoppo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:5-8">Lewe 24:5-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xomppe Istta Bolla Woththiza Ballata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 37:17-24">Kessa 37:17-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 25:31"/>«Worqqafe xalla qoxxada xomppe istta bolla woththiza ballata kessa; qasseka iza qoxxada xomppezi izan eqqiza toho, giddo toomanne toomaza kureta, dhemotanne ciishshata ubbaa ooththa.<figure style="fig" alt="Seven-branched candlestick or lampstand" file="HK00264B.TIF" size="span" ref="25:31">Xomppe istta bolla woththiza laappun ballata</figure> <verse eid="EXO 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 25:32"/>Issi millera heedzdzu ballati, issi millera qasseka heedzdzu ballati issi bolla usuppun haggati izas detto. <verse eid="EXO 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 25:33"/>Usuppun ballataska issaas issaas dhemoynne ciishshay izan diza ochcholoone geetettiza miththa ciish misatiza heedzdzu kureti detto. <verse eid="EXO 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 25:34"/>Xomppeza giddo toomay, dhemotinne ciishshati izan diza ochcholoone geetettiza miththa ciish misatiza oyddu kureti detto. <verse eid="EXO 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 25:35"/>Nam7ay nam7ay issife waaththan diza heedzdzu ballatappe garsara issi issi dhemoy de7o. <verse eid="EXO 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 25:36"/>Dhemotinne ballati wuri giddo toomazappe qoxettidi walakay baynda worqqafe oosettetto.<verse eid="EXO 25:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 25:37"/>«Hessafe guye Xomppe woththizasozas laappun eexxizaso giigsada xomppeti sinththa bagga poo7ana mala oyththa. <verse eid="EXO 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 25:38"/>Xomppeza bolla eexxishe qaammida shalota kessiza qaphetanne xiixa woththiza saaneta walakay baynda worqqafe ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 25:39"/>Xomppezinne iza miishshati wuri heedzdzu tammanne ichchashu kilo giraame gidiza walakay baynda worqqafe oosettetto. <verse eid="EXO 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 25:40"/>Tani nena zumaa bolla bessida leemisoza kaallada akeekan ooththa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:44">Hawa 7:44</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 8:5">Ib 8:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 25:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EXO 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Dunkaane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 36:8-38">Kessa 36:8-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 26:1"/>«Qasse lo7eththi suqettida booththa laynoppe dadettida tammu magalashata dunkaaneza giddon giigsa. Qasseka salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinara he magalashata bolla issi hiillan kirubeta misle oosisa.<figure style="fig" alt="Tabernacle or tent of meeting" file="LB00259B.TIF" size="span" ref="26:1">Gaytoteththa dunkaane</figure> <verse eid="EXO 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 26:2"/>Magalashati wuri issi gina gidetto; issaa issaa adussateththay nam7u tammanne osppun wadha; gomppay qasse oyddu wadha gido. <verse eid="EXO 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 26:3"/>Ichchashu magalashata issife gaththa sikka; hankko attida ichchashu magalashatakka isttaththoka ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 26:4"/>Issife gaaggi sikettida magalashatappe gaxan diza magalashaas balxxanththa bolla salo misatiza carqqafe siidhe ooththa; qasse issife gaaggidi sikettida hankko magalashaankka hessaththo ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 26:5"/>Issife gaaggida issi magalashaa bolla ichchashu tammu siidhe misatiza miish, qasse issife gaaggida hankko magalashaa bollaka ichchash tammu siidhe misatiza miish ooththa; he siidhe misatiza miishshati wurikka he baggaranne ha baggara issay issaara ginan detto. <verse eid="EXO 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 26:6"/>Hessafe guye worqqafe ichchash tammu qapheta medhdhada giddo dunkaanezi issino gidana mala, he magalashata manxakotan issaa issaara oyseththa.<verse eid="EXO 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 26:7"/>«Giddo Dunkaaneza bollara hara dunkaane ooththanaas tammanne issi magalashata deysha iskefe dadda. <verse eid="EXO 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 26:8"/>Tammanne issi magalashatikka issi gina gidetto; issi issi magalasha adussateththay heedzdzu tammu wadha, gomppay qasse oyddu wadha gido. <verse eid="EXO 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 26:9"/>Ichchashu magalashata issi baggara usuppun magalashata qasse hankko baggaara gaththa sikka. Usuppunththa magalashay sinththara soo bagga simmi qalam7etto. <verse eid="EXO 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 26:10"/>Gaththi sikkida magalashatappe issi magalashaa gaxan ichchash tammu siidhe misatiza miishshata ooththa; qasse gaththi sikkida hankko magalashatappe wurseththa magalashaa balxxanththa bolla ichchash tammu siidhe misatiza miishshata ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 26:11"/>Xarqimalappe ichchashu tammu qapheta ooththada, qanggo misatiza miishshata giddo gelththa; histtada bolla dunkaaneza issife gaththa oyththa. Histtiko ha nam7u oykettida kamati issino gidana. <verse eid="EXO 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 26:12"/>Bolla dunkaaneza magalashatappe palahida bagga magalashay giddo dunkaanezas guyera alaletto. <verse eid="EXO 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 26:13"/>Bolla Dunkaaneza magalashati nam7u baggarakka issi issi wadha mala palahidi heera haara alalettidi giddo dunkaaneza kammana mala nam7u bagga millera alaletto.<verse eid="EXO 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 26:14"/>«Bolla bagga dunkaaneza bollara kammanaas zo7o qalamen geli kezida dharsho ite giigsa; qasse iza bollara kammanaas haaththa giddo do7a galbafe hara kama giigsa.<verse eid="EXO 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 26:15"/>«Giddo Dunkaaneza tole miththata odoro miththafe ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 26:16"/>Issi issi tole miththas adussateththay tammu wadha, gomppay issi wadhanne bagga gido. <verse eid="EXO 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 26:17"/>Issi tole miththas issi bolla oyketti uttida nam7u tohota ooththa. Giddo Dunkaaneza tole miththata ubbaaka hessaththo ooththa; <verse eid="EXO 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 26:18"/>Giddo Dunkaanezas duge baggara nam7u tammu tole miththata kessada, <verse eid="EXO 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 26:19"/>issi issi tole miththas nam7u eqoso, mulera oyddu tammu eqoso birappe giigsa. <verse eid="EXO 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 26:20"/>Giddo Dunkaanezas pudeha baggara, nam7u tammu tole miththata kessada, <verse eid="EXO 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 26:21"/>issi issi tole miththas nam7u eqoso, mulera oyddu tammu eqoso birappe giigsa. <verse eid="EXO 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 26:22"/>Qasse giddo Dunkaanezas guyera arshey wulliza baggara usuppun tole miththata kessada, <verse eid="EXO 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 26:23"/>guye baggara diza zoozetas nam7u tole miththata giigsa. <verse eid="EXO 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 26:24"/>Guye baggara diza tole miththati wuri xaphoppe xeeraa gakkanaas issi bolla gaaggi oykettidi, xeeran issoy issaara sagayon oyketetto; hessaththoka nam7u zoozeta bolla diza nam7u tole miththatikka hara tole miththatara oyketetto. <verse eid="EXO 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 26:25"/>Issi issi tole miththas garsara nam7u nam7u tole eqosoy de7o; mulera osppun tole miththatinne birappe oosettida tammanne usuppun eqosoy deyo.<verse eid="EXO 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 26:26"/>«Qasse meega miththata odoro miththafe kessa. Giddo Dunkaanezas issi bagga millen diza tole miththatas ichchashu meega miththata, <verse eid="EXO 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 26:27"/>qasse hankko bagga millen diza tole miththatas ha7ikka ichchashu meega miththata giigsa. Hessaththoka giddo Dunkaanezas guyera arshey wulliza baggara diza tole miththatas ichchashu meega miththata giigsa. <verse eid="EXO 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 26:28"/>Giddo meega miththati tole miththatas giddora ha gaxappe he gaxa gakkanaas kanththi kezanaas bessees.<verse eid="EXO 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 26:29"/>«Tole miththata worqqan tiyada meega miththati istta giddora aadhdhiza sagayota worqqafe ooththa; qasse meega miththatakka worqqan tiya. <verse eid="EXO 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 26:30"/>Giddo dunkaaneza tani nena zumaa bollan bessida leemisoza mala tokka.<verse eid="EXO 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 26:31"/>«Salo misatizappe, ochcha teera misatiza qacinappenne xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne lo7i suqettida liiqo laynoppe issi magalasha ooththa; he magalashaza bolla kirubeta misle sikki medhdhiza hiillan oosisa. <verse eid="EXO 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 26:32"/>Histtada odoro miththafe oosettidi worqqan tiyettida oyddu eqo miththata bolla diza worqqafe oosettida kaqotan kaqqa. He oyddu eqo miththati birappe oosettida eqosotan geletto. <verse eid="EXO 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 26:33"/>He magalashaza giddo dunkaaneza kaaran diza qaphetappe garsara kaqqada, Caaqo qaalaas markka gidida taabotaa magalashazappe gaaththa baggara woththa; histtiko he magalashazi geesh geetettiza sohoza ubbaafe dummatiza qol7aafe giddon shaakkana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:19">Ib 6:19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:3-5">9:3-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 26:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 26:34"/>Maaroteththa kama ubbaafe dummatida qol7an diza caaqo qaalaas markka gidida taabotaa bolla woththa. <verse eid="EXO 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 26:35"/>Xaraphpheezaza magalashaappe karera pude baggara woththa; xomppe woththiza ballaa qasse iza ginan duge baggara woththa.<verse eid="EXO 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 26:36"/>«Dunkaanezan geliza pengezas salo misatiza qacinappe, ochcha teera misatiza qacinappe, xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne lo7i suqettida liiqo laynoppe xilpen alleqissi oosettida magalasha giigsa. <verse eid="EXO 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 26:37"/>Magalashazas ichchashu eqo miththata odoro miththafe kessada, worqqan tiya; istta kaqotikka worqqafe oosettidaa gidetto; eqo miththatas xarqimalappe oosettida ichchashu eqoso giigsa.<verse eid="EXO 26:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EXO 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Xarqimalappe Oosettida Yarshosoho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 38:1-7">Kessa 38:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 27:1"/>«Odoro miththafe yarshizaso ooththa. He yarshizasoza dhoqqateththay heedzdzu wadha; gomppaynne adussateththay issi mala, ichchashu ichchashu wadha gididi oyddu zoozera deyo. <verse eid="EXO 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 27:2"/>Oyddu zoozeta wurseththa gaxan gaxan issi issi kace medhdha; kaceti yarshosozappe oosettetto. Histtada yarshizasoza xarqimala tiya. <verse eid="EXO 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 27:3"/>Izan go7ettiza miishshata, Bidinth kaashiza miishshata, kaashettida bidinththaa kessiza miishshata, kereta, asho xiixiza konccetanne tama kaachizanne kessiza miishshata ubbaa xarqimalappe ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 27:4"/>Histtada izas xarqimalappe zayzare mala miishshinne oyddu gulata bollan oyddu sagayota ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 27:5"/>Histtada yarshizasozas dabba bolla woththa. <verse eid="EXO 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 27:6"/>Odoro miththafe yarshizasozas tooho miththata kessada xarqimala tiya. <verse eid="EXO 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 27:7"/>Yarshizasoza tookkiza wode maaddana mala he tooho miththatas nam7u millera diza sagayotan aaththa. <verse eid="EXO 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 27:8"/>Tani nena zumaa bollan bessida mala yarshizasoza sanqqafe ooththada giddoza doya agga.<verse eid="EXO 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Dunkaaneza Gibbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 38:9-20">Kessa 38:9-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 27:9"/>«Xoossa Dunkaaneza gibbe lo7i dadettida liiqo laynoppe magalashata giigsa. Duge baggara diza magalashata adussateththay xeetu wadha gido. <verse eid="EXO 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 27:10"/>Izas nam7u tammu eqo miththatinne eqo miththati isttan eqqiza nam7u tammu eqosota xarqimalappe ooththa; istta hu7en qasse kaqotanne tore miththata hu7e bolla gita sagayota birappe ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 27:11"/>Hessaththoka pude bagga adussateththay xeetu wadha; qasse nam7u tammu tore miththatinne eqo miththatas nam7u tammu xarqimalappe oosettida eqosoti detto. Histtada birappe oosettida kaqotanne eqo miththatas hu7e bolla gita sagayota woththa. <verse eid="EXO 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 27:12"/>Arshey wulliza baggara aakoteththay ichchashu tammu wadha gido; tammu tore miththatinne tore miththatas tammu eqosoti diza magalashati izas detto. <verse eid="EXO 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 27:13"/>Qasse arshey mokkiza baggara aakoteththay ichchashu tammu wadha gididi, <verse eid="EXO 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 27:14"/>pengezappe issi baggara tammanne ichchashu wadha aduqqiza magalashati detto; isttas heedzdzu eqo miththatinne isttan eqqiza heedzdzu eqosoti detto. <verse eid="EXO 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 27:15"/>Hessaththoka hankko baggara tammanne ichchashu wadha aduqqiza magalashati detto; isttas heedzdzu eqo miththatinne isttan eqqiza heedzdzu eqosoti detto.<verse eid="EXO 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 27:16"/>«Pengezas nam7u tammu wadha aduqqiza magalasha salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne lo7i suqettida laynoppe dadettida, xilpen lo7ida magalasha giigsa. Iza tuuqi oykkanaas oyddu eqo miththatinne tore miththati isttan eqqiza oyddu eqosota giigsa.<verse eid="EXO 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 27:17"/>«Gibbeza yuuyi aadhdhanaas diza eqo miththata ubbaas birappe oosettida gita sagayoti, kaqotinne, xarqimalappe oosettida eqosoti detto. <verse eid="EXO 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 27:18"/>Gibbeza adussateththay xeetu wadha, aakoteththay ichchash tammu wadha gido; dhoqqateththay ichchashu wadha gidida lo7i suqetti dadettida laynoppe oosettida magalashati detto; qasseka xarqimalappe oosettida eqosoti detto.<verse eid="EXO 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 27:19"/>«Xoossa Dunkaaneza oosos go7ettiza miishshati, Dunkaanezanne gibbeza tole dhishketi wurikka xarqimalappe oosettetto.<verse eid="EXO 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xomppe Zayte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 24:1-4">Lewe 24:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 27:20"/>«Xomppey to7ontta eexxishe daana mala izas koshshiza zayte wogara miththa ayfe caddi gum7idi xillo zayte nees ehana mala Isra7eele nayta azaza. <verse eid="EXO 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 27:21"/>Aarooneynne iza attuma nayti xomppey GODAA sinththan qammida gadey wonttana gakkanaas poo7ana mala, Xoossa Dunkaaneza giddon, caaqo qaalaas markkay iza giddon diza taabotaa sinththan diza magalashaappe karera eeththetto. Hayssi Isra7eele asaas mernaas woga gidi de7o.<verse eid="EXO 27:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EXO 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Qeeseta May7o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 39:1-7">Kessa 39:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 28:1"/>«Ne isha Aaroonenne iza attuma nayta Nadaabe, Abihu, El7ezeerenne Itamaare neekko ekka ya; istti qeese gididi taas ooththana mala Isra7eele asaa giddofe istta dummasa. <verse eid="EXO 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 28:2"/>Izas bonchchonne lo7oteth immana mala ne isha Aaroones dumma may7o giigsa. <verse eid="EXO 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 28:3"/>Tani dumma dumma erateth immida kushe hiilla eriza as ubbaa xeygada Aaroones may7o giigsana mala yoota; izikka qeese gididi taas ooththanaas dummato. <verse eid="EXO 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 28:4"/>Istti giigsana may7otikka haytanttako; tira kiise, eefude, eefudeppe garsara may7iza hara may7o, qasseka ubbaafe garsara may7iza adussa may7o, goossenne dancco. Ne ishay Aarooneynne iza attuma nayti qeese gididi taas ooththishe dumma may7ota may7ana mala, may7o giigsetto.<figure style="fig" alt="Turban and breastpiece" file="HK00261B.TIF" size="span" ref="28:4">Qeesey woththiza qoobenne tira kiise</figure> <verse eid="EXO 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 28:5"/>Kushe hiillateth erizaytikka he may7ota giigsanaas, worqqa, salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinanne liiqo layno ekki ooththetto.<verse eid="EXO 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eefude</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 28:6"/>«Eefude geetettiza may7o worqqafe, salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizaa, xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne lo7i suqettida liiqo laynoppe kushe hiillati alleqissi giigsetto. <verse eid="EXO 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 28:7"/>Izas hashera duge wodhdhiza nam7u kaqoti detto; isttika biidi eefude may7ozara issife hara oyththiza miishshara dabba bolla oykettidi issino gidetto. <verse eid="EXO 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 28:8"/>Hiillay lo7eththidi daddida danccoyka eefudeza mala worqqafe, salo misatiza ochcha teera misatizaa, xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne lo7i baqettida laynoppe eefudezara issife oyketti dadetto.<verse eid="EXO 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 28:9"/>«Margide geetettiza nam7u shuchchata ekkada Isra7eele nayta sunth istta bolla wooca xaafa. <verse eid="EXO 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 28:10"/>Istta yeleta maaraa mala issi shuchchaa bolla usuppun sunth, hankko shuchchaa bolla qasse attida usuppunata sunth wooca xaafa. <verse eid="EXO 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 28:11"/>Hiillanchchay maatame bolla sunth wooci xaafiza mala, he nam7u shuchchata bolla Isra7eele nayta sunththu wooca xaafada yuuyi aadhdhanaas worqqafe giigettida miishsha giddon woththa. <verse eid="EXO 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 28:12"/>Histtada tammanne nam7u Isra7eele zereththata qofsizaaz gidana mala ha nam7u shuchchata eefudezara oyththada hashe bolla woththa; histtiko GODAA sinththan ubba wode qofettana mala ha sunththata Aarooney ba hashe bolla tookko. <verse eid="EXO 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 28:13"/>Shuchchata woththanaas worqqafe dooqetti giigida macarata ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 28:14"/>Qasse walakay baynda worqqafe wodoro mala dooqettida nam7u orde sansalatata giigsada, shuchchata woththanaas worqqafe dooqetti giigettida macaratara gaththa oyeseththa.<verse eid="EXO 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tira Kiise</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 39:8-21">Kessa 39:8-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 28:15"/>«GODAA sheney aazakkonne iza oychchidi eriza tira kiise kushe hiillanchchan oosisa. He tira kiise eefude daddida mala, worqqafe, salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne lo7i suqettida laynoppe dadda. <verse eid="EXO 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 28:16"/>Izas adussateththaynne aahoteththay dakkoti qalam7ettidi issi tadhdhako gido. <verse eid="EXO 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 28:17"/>Hessafe guye iza bolla oyddu maaran al7o shuchchata woththa; koyro maaran sardiyoone, tophaaziyoonenne phoolliza inqqu. <verse eid="EXO 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 28:18"/>Nam7anththo maaran baluure, simperenne almaaze geetettiza al7o shuchchata; <verse eid="EXO 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 28:19"/>heedzdzanththo maaran yaakintte, kelqedoonenne ametesxinoose; <verse eid="EXO 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 28:20"/>oydanththo maaran birille, margide, yasphiide. Haytanti wuri shuchchata woththanaas worqqafe dooqetti giigida macarata bolla uttetto. <verse eid="EXO 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 28:21"/>Isra7eele qommota sunththaa qooda mala, shuchchata qoodaykka tammanne nam7u gido; issaa issaa bolla maatame mala woocettidi tammanne nam7u zereththata sunththi he shuchchatan xaafetto.<verse eid="EXO 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 28:22"/>«Tira kiises walakay baynda worqqafe wodoro mala dooqettida orde sansalatata ooththa. <verse eid="EXO 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 28:23"/>Nam7u yiich worqqafe giigsada tira kiises qommo gaxa xeerara gaththada oyththa woththa. <verse eid="EXO 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 28:24"/>He nam7u worqqa sansalatata tira kiisetas xeeratan diza sagayotara gaththa oyththa. <verse eid="EXO 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 28:25"/>He sansalatatas hankko bagga xeeraa qasse eefudezas sinththa baggara, hashe bolla diza shuchchata woththanaas worqqafe dooqetti giigida macaratara gaththa oyseththa. <verse eid="EXO 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 28:26"/>Qasseka nam7u worqqa yiichchata giigsada, eefudeppe kaalli diza tira kiisetas gaaththa baggara diza nam7u xeeratan aaththa. <verse eid="EXO 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 28:27"/>Hessaththoka worqqafe hara nam7u yiichchata giigsada eefudezas sinththa baggara, hashe bolla diza kaqozappe garsa baggara, eefude danccizasoppe qommora sikoy gaaggizaso achchan istta oyththa. <verse eid="EXO 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 28:28"/>Tira kiisen diza sagayota eefudezan diza sagayotara gaththidi salo misatiza suqeththan danccozara gaththa qachcha; histtiko tira kiisezi xeessafe bollara diza gishshas qashoy leppenna.<verse eid="EXO 28:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 28:29"/>«Aarooney ubbaafe dumma qol7aa geliza wode he tira kiisen diza Isra7eele qommota sunththata tookko. Histtiko hayssi GODAA sinththan ubba wode hassa7ettana. <verse eid="EXO 28:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 28:30"/>Qasse Urimenne Tumime geetettizayta tira kiisetan yegga. Aarooney GODAA sinth aadhdhishe ba tiran woththi ekki gelo. GODAA sheney aazakkonne Isra7eele asaa erisana mala, izi GODAA sinththan ooththanaas geliza ubba wode tira kiiseppe dhayssofo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Urimeynne Tumimey Ayhuda qeeseti may7iza eefude geetettiza may7os tira kiisen woththiza Xoossa shene oychchanaas go7ettiza nam7u miishshata; gido attiin istti waanidi woykko aazappe oosettidaakko erettenna.</char></note><verse eid="EXO 28:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeeseti May7iza Hara May7ota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 39:22-31">Kessa 39:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 28:31"/>«Eefudezappe bollara may7ettiza adussa may7o salo misatiza carqqafe xalla giigsa. <verse eid="EXO 28:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 28:32"/>He adussa may7ozas hu7ey gelizaso giigsa. Hu7ey kezizasozi daakettontta mala soo bagga qalam7ada yuushsha aaththa sikka. <verse eid="EXO 28:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 28:33"/>Adussa may7ozas garsa bagga maccaraa yuushon salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinappe, oroomaane geetettiza miththa ayfe misleta medhdha. Histtada istta giddon worqqafe oosettida daalata walakan woththa. <verse eid="EXO 28:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 28:34"/>Worqqa daalatinne oroomaane miththa ayfe misleti he adussa may7o garsa bagga xeeran yuuyi aadhdhanaas walakan detto. <verse eid="EXO 28:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 28:35"/>Aarooney qeeseteththan ooththiza wode ha adussa may7oza may7o; GODAA sinth ubbaafe dumma qol7a geliza wodenne keziza wode daalay giirana. Izi he may7oza may7iko hayqqenna. <verse eid="EXO 28:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 28:36"/>Walakay baynda worqqafe issi alleqo giigsada maatame wooci kessiza mala iza bolla woocada, ‹GODAAS geesh gidi dummatides› gaada xaafa. <verse eid="EXO 28:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 28:37"/>Histtada hu7en goossa bolla salo misatiza qacinan goossazas sinththa baggara oyththa kaqqa. <verse eid="EXO 28:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 28:38"/>Histtidi Aarooney iza ba liiphen woththo; heen Isra7eele asay GODAAS imota immishe moorida miishshi diikkoka he mooroza Aarooney tookko. Asay ehizayssa GODAY ekkana mala izi he xaafettidayssa ubba wodekka ba liiphen woththanaas koshshees.<verse eid="EXO 28:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 28:39"/>«Aaroone shamize lee7e laynoppe dadda; hu7en xaaxiza goossaka laynoppe giigsa. Qasse danccozakka xilpen alleqissada sikissa. <verse eid="EXO 28:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 28:40"/>Aaroone naytas bonchchonne alleqo gidana mala, shamizeta, danccotanne hu7en xaaxiza goossata giigsa. <verse eid="EXO 28:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 28:41"/>Neni ha may7ota ne isha Aaroonenne iza nayta mayzidaappe guye, istti qeeseteththan taas ooththana mala istta wogara zayte tiya; tiyada istti qeese gididi taas ooththana mala istta dummasa. <verse eid="EXO 28:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 28:42"/>Istta kalloy kamettana mala garsara gixxiza gith, xeessaafe biidi wodira gakkanaas kammizaaz, liiqo layno qacinappe giigsa. <verse eid="EXO 28:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 28:43"/>Aarooneynne iza nayti Xoossa Dunkaane giddo geliza wode woykko gibbe giddon qeeseteththan ooththanaas yarsho yarshizaso shiiqiza wode hayta may7ota may7etto. Hessaththo hankko istti bantta bolla qohonne hayqo ehettenna. Hayssi Aaroonessinne iza zereththatas mernaas woga gido.<verse eid="EXO 28:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EXO 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Qeeseteththa Ooso Gishshas Aaroonessinne Iza Naytas Imettida Wogata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 29:1"/>«Aarooneynne iza nayti qeese gididi taas ooththana mala neni istta dummasanaas ooththa; wosoy baynda issi mirgonne nam7u dharshota ekka. <verse eid="EXO 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 29:2"/>Lo7o gistte dhiille ekkada irsho yeggontta uketh uukka; qasseka irsho yeggontta zayten guuththa uketh uukka; hessaththoka irsho yeggontta qeeri uketh uukkada zayte tiya. <verse eid="EXO 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 29:3"/>Neni heyta leematen woththada, mirgoza nam7u dharshotara issife taas shiishsha.<verse eid="EXO 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 29:4"/>«Histtada Aaroonenne iza nayta Xoossa Dunkaaneza penge ehada haaththan meecca. <verse eid="EXO 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 29:5"/>Hessafe guye may7ota ekkada, shamize, eefudeppe bollara may7iza adussa may7o, eefudenne tira kiise Aaroone mayzada eefudeza hiillan dadettida danccon danccisa. <verse eid="EXO 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 29:6"/>Goossaza iza hu7en goozisada, ‹GODAAS geesh gidi dummatides› geetetti xaafettida alleqoza goossa bolla woththa. <verse eid="EXO 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 29:7"/>Tiyiza zaytekka ekkada iza hu7en tigada tiya. <verse eid="EXO 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 29:8"/>Iza naytakka ehada shamizeta mayza. <verse eid="EXO 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 29:9"/>Goossaka istta hu7en goozisa. Hessafe guye Aaroonenne iza nayta dancco danccisa. Qeeseteththay isttas mernaa ooso woga gido; hessaththo histtada Aaroonenne iza nayta qeese histta.<verse eid="EXO 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 29:10"/>«Ne taas mirgo Xoossa Dunkaane sinth ehikko Aarooneynne iza nayti iza hu7e bolla ba kushe woththiko, <verse eid="EXO 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 29:11"/>wofanoza heen GODAA sinththan shukka. <verse eid="EXO 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 29:12"/>Wofanoza suuththan ne biradhdhe gelththa kessada, yarshizasoza bollan diza kaceta tiya; tiyishin attida suuththaa yarshizasozappe garsa baggara gussa. <verse eid="EXO 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 29:13"/>Hessafe guye marace kammida moodhe, tirezara oyketti diza asho, nam7u kilahotanne istta kammida handaa ekkada, yarshizasohoza bolla woththada xuugga. <verse eid="EXO 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 29:14"/>Gido attiin mirgoza asho, galbaanne maraceza, meetettontta ashota asi dizasohoppe haraso efada nagara yarsho gidana mala xuugga;<verse eid="EXO 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 29:15"/>«Nam7u dharshotappe issaa ne ekkiko Aarooneynne iza nayti ba kushe iza hu7e bolla woththetto. <verse eid="EXO 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 29:16"/>Shukkada suuththaa yarshizasoza mille bolla ubba baggara wuxxa. <verse eid="EXO 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 29:17"/>Dharshoza asho qanxxereththada, qanththa ashonne tohota meeccada hu7ezaranne hankko attida ashaara issi bolla woththa. <verse eid="EXO 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 29:18"/>Hessafe guye dharshoza mulera yarshizasohoza bolla xuugga; hessi GODAAS taman xuugettiza sawo tunnu giza yarshoko.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:2">Efe 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:18">Pili 4:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 29:19"/>«Qasse hankko dharshoza ne ekkiko Aarooneynne iza nayti ba kushe iza hu7e bolla woththetto. <verse eid="EXO 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 29:20"/>He dharshoza shukkada iza suuththaafe guuththara ekkada, Aaroonessinne iza naytas ushachcha hayththata xeera, ushachcha kushe manththa biradhdhetanne ushachcha toho manththa biradhdheta tiya; hessafe guye attida suuththaa yarshizaso mille bolla Ubbasora wuxxa. <verse eid="EXO 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 29:21"/>Yarshizason diza suuththaafenne tiyettiza zaytezappe ginara ekkada, Aaroone bollanne iza may7o bolla, iza nayta bollanne istta may7o bolla wuxxa; histtiko izi iza naytinne, istta may7oy GODAA oosos dummatana.<verse eid="EXO 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 29:22"/>«Ha dharshozappe goynazanne izan diza tolthoza, marace bollan diza moodhe, tirezara oyketti diza asho, nam7u kilahota, istta kammi oykkida handaaranne ushachcha gedaara neni ekka; hayssi qeeseteththa sunth immiza wode shukettiza dorsa. <verse eid="EXO 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 29:23"/>GODAA sinththan woththida irshoy gelontta ukeththaafe issino, zaytey walakettontta ukeththaafe issino, zaytera uukkida issi komponne issi qeeri kompa ekka. <verse eid="EXO 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 29:24"/>Neni ha kaththaa ubbaa Aaroone kusheninne iza nayta kushen woththiko istti yaanne haa qaaseththiza yarsho histtidi GODAA sinththan shiishshetto. <verse eid="EXO 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 29:25"/>Hessafe guye neni istta kusheppe heyta ekkada, yarshizasoza bolla woththada, xuugettiza yarshora issife gaththada, GODAAS sawo tunnu gaana mala, yarshizasoza bolla taman xuugga. <verse eid="EXO 29:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 29:26"/>Aarooney qeese gididi summiza wode shukkida dharshoza angaso ekkada GODAA sinththan yaanne haa qaaseththiza yarsho histta qaaseththa; hayssi inttena gakkiza gisha gidana.<verse eid="EXO 29:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 29:27"/>«He shukettida dharshoza ashoppe yarsho ooththidi yaanne haa qaaseththida angasozanne GODAA sinth shiiqida gedaa dummasa. Hessika Aaroone gishanne iza nayta gisha gidana. <verse eid="EXO 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 29:28"/>Isra7eele asay GODAAS shiishshiza issifeteththa yarshozappe angasozanne gedaza ubba wodekka Aaroonessinne iza attuma nayta gakkiza gisha gido. Ays giikko hayssi Isra7eele asay GODAAS shiishshiza imota.<verse eid="EXO 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 29:29"/>«Aaroone qeeseteththaa dumma may7oy izappe guye iza zereththaas gido; istti tiyettidi qeese gidiza wode he may7oza may7etto. <verse eid="EXO 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 29:30"/>Iza naytappe izasohon qeese gididi dummatida sohozan ooththanaas Xoossa dunkaane yida attuma nay he may7oza laappun gallas gakkanaas may7o.<verse eid="EXO 29:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 29:31"/>«Aarooneynne iza nayti qeeseteththan sunththanaas shukettida dharshaa asho ekkada dumma sohozan doyssa. <verse eid="EXO 29:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 29:32"/>Aarooneynne iza nayti dharshoza ashaa leematen diza ukeththara Xoossa Dunkaane pengen metto. <verse eid="EXO 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 29:33"/>Istti qeese gididi summiza wodenne dummatiza wode istta nagaray atto geetettana mala yarshettida he yarshota metto. Gido attiin he yarshoti geesh gidida gishshas hara asi oonikka mooppo. <verse eid="EXO 29:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 29:34"/>Qeeseteththan sunththanaas shukkida dharshoza ashoppe woykko ukeththaafe maalado gakkanaas palahidi aqikko dumma gidida gishshas taman xuugetto attiin meetettofo.<verse eid="EXO 29:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 29:35"/>«Hessaththo histtada Laappun gallas gakkanaas tani nena azazida mala Aaroonenne iza nayta qeese histtada sunththa.<verse eid="EXO 29:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 29:36"/>«Nagaray atto geetettana mala hach hach nagara gishshas issi mirgo yarsha. Hessankka yarshizasoza geeshsha; histtada yarshizasoza dummaththanaas zayte tiya. <verse eid="EXO 29:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 29:37"/>Yarshizasoza nagara geesho wogaa laappun gallas gakkanaas wursada iza dummaththa. Histtiko yarshizasozi dumma geeshshasoho gidana. Iza bochchizaadey ubbay geesh gidana bessees.<verse eid="EXO 29:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 29:38"/>«Yarshizason neni hach hach shiishshana yarshoy hayssa; Yelettiin issi layth kumontta nam7u adde laaqqa yarsha. <verse eid="EXO 29:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 29:39"/>Adde laaqqatappe issaa maalado, qasse nam7anththoza omarsa wode yarsha. <verse eid="EXO 29:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 29:40"/>Koyro dharsho laaqqa issi kilonne bagga lo7o gistte dhiille issi litiro gum7ettida zayten munuqada yarsha; issi litiro woyne ushshu ushsha yarsho histtada yarsha. <verse eid="EXO 29:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 29:41"/>Nam7anththo dharsho laaqqaza omarsa wode yarsha. Maaladoyssa gina dhiille, zaytenne woyne ushshu shiishsha. Hessika GODAAS taman xuugettidi sawo tunnu giza yarsho gidana.<verse eid="EXO 29:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 29:42"/>«Ha xuugettiza yarshoy yiza yeleta ubbaan Xoossa Dunkaaneza pengen GODAA sinththan pacey baynda yarshettanaas koshshees. Tani inttenara gaagganaynne nees haasayanay heenkko. <verse eid="EXO 29:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 29:43"/>Qasse heen tani Isra7eele naytara gaaggananne ta bonchchoyka he sohoza dumma soho histtana.<verse eid="EXO 29:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 29:44"/>«Hessa gishshas tani Xoossa Dunkaanezanne yarshizasoza dummasana; Aarooneynne iza nayti taas qeese gididi ooththana mala tani istta dummasana. <verse eid="EXO 29:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 29:45"/>Histtada tani Isra7eele nayta giddon de7ana; qasse tani istta Xoossaa gidana. <verse eid="EXO 29:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 29:46"/>Tani istta giddon de7ana mala Gibxeppe istta kessida GODAA istta Xoossaa gididayssa istti erana. Ee, tani GODAA istta Xoossaa.<verse eid="EXO 29:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EXO 30"/>
  <para style="s1">Exaane Cuwasi Yarshizaso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 37:25-28">Kessa 37:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 30:1"/>«Exaane cuwasi yarshizaso odoro miththafe giigsa; <verse eid="EXO 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 30:2"/>izas oyddu zoozey deyo; adussateththay issi wadha, aahoteththay issi wadha, dhoqqateththay qasse nam7u wadha gido; kacetikka izara issi bolla oyketti oosettetto. <verse eid="EXO 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 30:3"/>Izas bolla baggaa, oyddu milletanne kaceta ubbaa walakay baynda worqqan tiya; iza yuushonkka worqqa balxxanth yuushsha aaththa. <verse eid="EXO 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 30:4"/>He balxxanththafe garsara exaane cuwasi yarshizasozas worqqafe nam7u qanggota ooththada he baggaranne ha baggara oyseththa. Heyti tookkiza wode tooho miththata gelththanaassa. <verse eid="EXO 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 30:5"/>Tooho miththata odoro miththafe kessada worqqan tiya. <verse eid="EXO 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 30:6"/>Ha yarshizasoza Caaqo qaalaa markkay izan diza Taabotaa sinththan kaqettida magalashaappe kare baggara, Caaqo qaala markka bollan diza atto geetettiza sohoza kama ginara woththa. Hessika tani nenara gaaggizaso.<verse eid="EXO 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 30:7"/>«Aarooney maalado maalado xomppeta giigsanaas yiza wode sawiza exaane yarshizasozan cuwaso. <verse eid="EXO 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 30:8"/>Aarooney omarsa wode xomppeta poo7isiza wode, zaareththidikka exaane cuwaso; histtiko exaaney GODAA sinththan yiza yeletaas ubba wode cuwattana. <verse eid="EXO 30:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 30:9"/>Ha yarshizasozan hara digettida exaanekka, woykko xuugettiza yarsho, woykko kaththa yarsho yarshofa; ushsha yarshoka iza bolla tigoppa.<figure style="fig" alt="Incense altar and high priest in Tabernacle" file="HK00260B.TIF" size="span" ref="30:8-9">Qeeseta halaqay exaane cu7asizaso bolla exaane cu7asishin</figure> <verse eid="EXO 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 30:10"/>Aarooney layththan issito nagarappe maarettanaas shukkiza mehe suuth ekkidi he yarshizasoza bolla diza kaceta bolla tiyo. Histtidi geesho wogaa polo. Ha wogay sinththara yaana wodeta ubbaan layththan layththan ooththetto. Hessaththo ha yarshizasozi GODAAS dumma geeyidaso gido» gides.<verse eid="EXO 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shemppo Ashshanaas Qanxxiza Miishshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 30:11"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muse hizgides, <verse eid="EXO 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 30:12"/>«Neni Isra7eele attuma asaa taybiza wode, issi issi asi taybettidi ba shemppo ashshanaas GODAAS miishshe immo; histtiko neni istta taybiza wode asa bolla boshay yeenna. <verse eid="EXO 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 30:13"/>Taybettida attuma asay hu7en hu7en Xoossa Dunkaanen erettida maka miishsha mala koshshiza miish qanxxo. Issi issi asi baas diza mala immo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 38:25-26">Kessa 38:25-26</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:24">Mato 17:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 30:14"/>Qoodan geliza attuma asaa layththay nam7u tammu kumidaynne hessafe bollay wuri GODAAS imota eho. <verse eid="EXO 30:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 30:15"/>Intte intte shemppo ashshanaas GODAAS imota immishin, dureykka manqoyka issi mala immanaappe attiin, durey darssidi woykko manqoy guuththidi immofo. <verse eid="EXO 30:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 30:16"/>Ba shemppo ashshanaas immiza miishshe Isra7eele asaappe ekkada Xoossa Dunkaaneza oosos peyshsha. Ha miishshay intte shemppo wozzanaas, GODAA sinththan Isra7eele asaa gishshas hassa7issizaaz gidana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Meechcha Kere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 30:17"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="EXO 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 30:18"/>«Meechcha kerezanne kereza iza bolla woththiza miish xarqimalappe medhdha. Xoossa Dunkaanezappenne yarshizasozappe giddon woththada izan haath tiga.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 38:8">Kessa 38:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 30:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 30:19"/>He haaththaan Aarooneynne iza nayti ba kushenne ba toho meecettetto. <verse eid="EXO 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 30:20"/>Istti hayqqontta mala Xoossa Dunkaanezan gelshe aydekka he haaththan meecettetto. Qasse GODAAS taman yarsho yarshanaas yarshizaso mata shiiqiza wode, <verse eid="EXO 30:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 30:21"/>istti hayqqontta mala ba kushenne ba toho meecettetto. Hayssi Aaroonessinne iza zereththatas, yiza yeleta ubbaas mernaa woga gido» gides.<verse eid="EXO 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiyettiza Zayte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 30:22"/>GODAY Muse hizgides, <verse eid="EXO 30:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 30:23"/>«Lo7o qimameta, heytikka usuppun kilo goggiza karbbe, heedzdzu kilo sawiza qarafa, heedzdzu kilo sawiza gucachcha maatanne <verse eid="EXO 30:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 30:24"/>usuppun kilo burgude ekka. Hayssi wurikka Xoossa Dunkaanen erettida meezaanen meezaanettidaa gido. Hessa bollaka oyddu litiro wogara zayte gujja ekka. <verse eid="EXO 30:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 30:25"/>Heytantta shitto ooththiza mala walakkada sawiza geeshshateththas tiyettiza dumma zayte giigsa. <verse eid="EXO 30:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 30:26"/>Histtada Xoossa Dunkaaneza, Caaqo qaalaa markkay izan diza Taabotaa, <verse eid="EXO 30:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 30:27"/>xaraphpheezanne izan go7ettiza miishshata ubbaa, xomppe woththiza ballaanne iza miishshata, exaane cuwasi yarshizasoza, <verse eid="EXO 30:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 30:28"/>xuugettiza yarsho yarshizasozanne izan go7ettiza miishshata ubbaa, meechcha kerenne iza woththizasoza ubbaa tiya. <verse eid="EXO 30:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 30:29"/>Istti keehi geesh gidana mala neni istta dummasa; istta bochchizay wurikka geesh gidanaas bessees.<verse eid="EXO 30:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 30:30"/>«Qasseka Aarooneynne iza nayti qeese gididi taas ooththana mala istta tiyada dummasa; <verse eid="EXO 30:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 30:31"/>Isra7eele asaas, ‹Hayssi buro yaana yeletaska tiyettiza geeshsha zayte gido. <verse eid="EXO 30:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 30:32"/>Ha zayteza hara as tiyoppa; qasse hara zayte hessaththo giigsofa. Izi dumma gidida gishshas intteka iza dummateth erite. <verse eid="EXO 30:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 30:33"/>Hayssa mala shitto giigsiza asinne tiyettanaas bessontta hara as tiyiza asi oonikka ba asaa garsafe dhayo› ga» gides.<verse eid="EXO 30:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Exaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 30:34"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muses, «Sawiza qimameta, miththa uzas, helelon diza shitto, sawiza shidanne harara walakettontta exaane ekka; istta ubbaa meezaaneykka issi gina gido. <verse eid="EXO 30:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 30:35"/>Shitto mala walakettida exaane ooththada isttan go7etta; walakay baynda geeshshinne dumma gidana mala izan maxine yegga. <verse eid="EXO 30:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 30:36"/>Izappe ekkada liiqisa cadda; histtada tani nenara gaaggiza Xoossa Dunkaaneza giddon Caaqo qaala markkay izan diza Taabotaa sinththan exaane cuwasi yarshizasoza bolla woththa. Izi nees ubbaafe aadhdhida geesh gidana. <verse eid="EXO 30:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 30:37"/>Hayssa giigsidayssaththo hara exaane giigsofte. Hessi taas dumma geesh gididayssa ne era. <verse eid="EXO 30:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 30:38"/>Hessa misatizaaz giigsidi iza sawo singidi ufayettanaas koyza asi diikko izi ba asaa garsafe dhayo» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:22-38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 37:29">Kessa 37:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 30:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EXO 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Basli7eelenne Elyaabe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 35:30-36:1">Kessa 35:30—36:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 31:1"/>Qasseka GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="EXO 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 31:2"/>«Beya; tani Yuhuda zereth gidida Uures naaza naa, Huurey naa, Basli7eele dooradis. <verse eid="EXO 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 31:3"/>Iza tani ta Ayanan; hiillateththan, akeekaninne ooso ubbaa ooththiza erateththan kunththadis. <verse eid="EXO 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 31:4"/>Hessika izi qoppi qoppidi hiillateththan, worqqafe, birappenne xarqimalappe dumma dumma miish ooththanaassa. <verse eid="EXO 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 31:5"/>Hessaththoka al7o shuch massi massidi giigsanaas, mith massanaassinne heytantta ubbaa ooththanaassa.<verse eid="EXO 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 31:6"/>«Hessa bollaka qasse iza maaddana mala, Daane zereth gidida Ahisaameke naa Eelaabe dooradis. Tani nena azazidayssa ubbaa istti ooththana mala, kushe hiillateth erizayta ubbaas erateth immadis. <verse eid="EXO 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 31:7"/>Istti ooththanayssi Xoossa Dunkaane, Caaqo qaalay izan diza Taabotaanne Taabotaza bolla woththiza atoteththa kama, Xoossa Dunkaaneza ooththanaas go7ettiza miishshata ubbaa, <verse eid="EXO 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 31:8"/>xaraphpheezanne iza miishshata, walakay baynda worqqafe oosettida xomppe iza bolla woththiza miish ubbaara, exaane cuwasi yarshizasoza, <verse eid="EXO 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 31:9"/>xuugettiza yarsho yarshizasozanne iza miishshata ubbaara, meecettiza kerenne keraa iza bolla woththiza miishshara, <verse eid="EXO 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 31:10"/>dadetti oosettida carqqata, qeese Aarooney may7iza dumma may7o, iza attuma nayti qeeseteththa ooso ooththishe may7ana may7o, <verse eid="EXO 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 31:11"/>qasse tiyettiza zaytenne geeshsha sozas sawo tunnu giza exaane. Istti hayssa ubbaa tani nena azazida mala ooththana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sambata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 31:12"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muse, <verse eid="EXO 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 31:13"/>«Neni Isra7eele asaas, ‹Ta Sambataa lo7eththi naagite. Hessi tani GODAY inttena taas dumma histtada dooridayssa bessizaaz gididi yaana yeleta ubbaas taappenne inttefe giddon malata gidana. <verse eid="EXO 31:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 31:14"/>Inttes he gallassay dumma gidida gishshas Sambata naagite. Iza tunisiza asi mule hayqqanaas bessees; he gallassan ooso ooththizay oonikka ba asaa garsafe dhayo. <verse eid="EXO 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 31:15"/>Usuppun gallassatan intte ooso ooththite; gido attiin laappunththa gallassay taas GODAAS dummatida shempo Sambata; he gallassaan ooththizaadey oonikka mulera hayqqanaas bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8-11">Kessa 20:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:12">23:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:21">34:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 35:2">35:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:3">Lewe 23:3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:12-14">Zaare 5:12-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 31:16"/>Isra7eele asay he Sambata gallassaa naa naas mernaas malata histtidi naago. <verse eid="EXO 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 31:17"/>Tani usuppun gallassatan salonne sa7a medhdhada laappunththa gallassan ooso aggada shempida gishshas, taassinne Isra7eele naytas giddon hayssi mernaas caaqo gidana› ga» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Kessa 20:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 31:18"/>GODAY Musera Siina zumaa bolla haasayzayssa wursida mala izi ba biradhdhen xaafida tammu azazota oykkida nam7u masettida shuchchata Muses immides.<verse eid="EXO 31:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EXO 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Worqqafe Oosettida Mara Misle</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 9:6-29">Zaare 9:6-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 32:1"/>Musey zumaappe wodhdhontta keehi gam7idayssa be7idi asay Aaroone yuushon shiiqidi, «Ane Haa ya; neni nuna kaaleththiza eeqa xoossata nuus medhdha. Gibxe biittaafe nuna kessida Musey gidikko izi waanidaakko nu erokko!» gida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:40">Hawa 7:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 32:2"/>Histtiin Aarooney isttas, «Intte machcheta hayththan, intte attuma nayta hayththaninne macca nayta hayththan diza worqqaa kessidi taas ha ekki yiite» gides. <verse eid="EXO 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 32:3"/>Hessafe guye asay wuri ba hayththa worqqaa kessidi Aaroones ehides. <verse eid="EXO 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 32:4"/>Izi hessa istta kusheppe ekkidi taman seerisidaappe guye qoxxiza miishshan qoxxidi mara misle medhdhides.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 32:4">Hessafe guye asaykka, «Isra7eele asawu! Nuna Gibxe biittafe kessida nu xoossati haytantta» gides<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28">1Kawo 12:28</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:41">Hawa 7:41</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 32:5"/>Aarooney hessa be7idi mara misleza sinththan yarshizaso giigsidi, «Wonto GODAAS ba7aale gallas gidana» gi awajjides. <verse eid="EXO 32:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 32:6"/>Hessa gishshas wonteththa gallas asay wonttara dendidi xuugettiza yarshotanne issifeteththa yarshota yarshides. Histtidi asay maanaassinne uyanaas uttides. Mi uyi simmidi qasse duranaassinne guppanaas dendides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:7">1Qoro 10:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 32:7"/>Histtiin GODAY Muses, «Ne Gibxeppe kessa ehida ne asay nagara ooththidi banateththaa tunisida gishshas eeson duge wodhdha. <verse eid="EXO 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 32:8"/>Tani istta azazida ogeppe istti eeson sher7i giichchida. Worqqa seerisidayssa mara misatissidi, baas eeqa xoossata medhdhidi izas goynnidanne yarshida. Qasseka, ‹Isra7eele asawu! Nuna Gibxe biittafe kessida nu xoossati haytantta› gida.<verse eid="EXO 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 32:9"/>«Tani ha asaa beyadis; istti bantta wozina muumida asa. <verse eid="EXO 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 32:10"/>Ha7i ta hanqoy istta bolla eexxi keziin tani istta dhayssanayssa neni tana diggofa. Hessafe qasse ta nena gita kawoteth histtana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 32:11"/>Gido attiin Musey GODAA ba Xoossaa, «Abeet Godoo! Neni ne gita wolqqaninne ne mino qesen Gibxeppe kessada ehida ne asaa bolla hessaththo aazas hanqettay?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:11-14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:13-19">Tay 14:13-19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 32:12"/>Gibxe asay, ‹Izi istta zumata bollan wodhanaassinne biittafe pitti dhayssanaas iita qofan kessides› ays geetettay? Neni ne wolqqama hanqofe simma; asaa dhayssanaas qoppidayssa agga. <verse eid="EXO 32:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 32:13"/>Ne aylleta Abrahaame, Yisaaqanne Yaaqoobe qoppa; neni isttas, ‹Tani intte zereth salo xoolintte mala darsana; tani inttes immana gida biittaa ubbaaka intte zereththatas immana; istti he biittaa mernaas laattana› gaada neni ne sunththan caaqqida qaalaa yuushsha qoppa» giidi gaannatides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-17">Medhe 22:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:18">17:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 32:14"/>Hessa gishshas GODAY ba asaa bolla iita miish ehanaas qoppidayssa aggides.<verse eid="EXO 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 32:15"/>Hessafe guye Musey zumaa bollafe duge wodhdhishe tammu azazoti istta bolla nam7u baggara xaafetti uttida nam7u maseththa shuchchata ba kushen oykki ekki yides. <verse eid="EXO 32:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 32:16"/>He masettida shuchchata giigsiday Xoossa; shuchchata bolla woocidi xaafidaykka Xoossa.<verse eid="EXO 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 32:17"/>Iyaasoy asay wocamizayssa siyidi Muses, «Asay dizason ola waasoy siyettees» gides. <verse eid="EXO 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 32:18"/>Museykka zaaridi, «Tani siyizayssi hayssi yeththafe attiin, olan xoonidayta qaala woykko xoonettidayta qaala deenna» gides.<verse eid="EXO 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 32:19"/>Musey derezi dizaso matishe mara misleza sinththan asay durishininne guppishin be7idi keehi hanqettidi masettida shuchchata zuma garsan bollafe yeggidi menththereththides. <verse eid="EXO 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 32:20"/>Asay medhdhida maraakka ekkidi taman xuuggides; hessafe guye liiqisi gaacci haaththan maadhidi Isra7eele asay uyana mala ooththides.<verse eid="EXO 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 32:21"/>Hessafe guye, Musey Aaroone, «Ha asay nena wosttiin neni istta hayssa mala gita nagara ooththana mala kaaleththadii?» gides. <verse eid="EXO 32:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 32:22"/>Aarooneykka zaaridi, «Ta godoo, hanqettofa! Hayssi asay iita ooththanaas ay mala koyzaakko ne eraasa. <verse eid="EXO 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 32:23"/>Istti tana, ‹Nuna kaaleththiza eeqa xoossata nuus medhdha. Ays giikko nuna Gibxeppe kessi ehida Musey izi waanidaakko nu erokko!› gida. <verse eid="EXO 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 32:24"/>Histtiin tani isttas, ‹Intte bolla diza worqqaa kessidi hammite› gadis; hessafe guye istti taas immida worqqaa tani taman yeggiin hayssi maray kezides» gides.<verse eid="EXO 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 32:25"/>Aarooney asaa la7a yeddi aggiin asay ba morkketa sinththan kawuyidi kadhettanayssa Musey be7ides. <verse eid="EXO 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 32:26"/>Hessa gishshas Musey asay dunkaanidi dizaso geliza pengen eqqidi, «GODAA bagga gidida asi oonikka taakko ha yo!» giin Lewe qommoti wuri izakko shiiqida.<verse eid="EXO 32:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 32:27"/>Hessafe guye izi isttas, «GODAA Isra7eele Xoossay, ‹Asay wuri ba giththa mashsha ba xeessan xeessan gixxidi asay dunkaanidason gaxappe gaxa gakkanaas, asaa giddon yaanne haa simerettidi ba isha, ba laggenne ba shooro wodho› » gides. <verse eid="EXO 32:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 32:28"/>Lewe qommoti Musey azazida mala ooththida; he gallas asaappe heedzdzu shii gidiza asi hayqqides. <verse eid="EXO 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 32:29"/>Hessafe guye Musey Lewe qommota, «Hach intte GODAAS dummatideta; ays giikko intte intte naytanne intte ishata wodhanaas azazettidi wodhdhideta; hach GODAY inttena anjjides» gides.<verse eid="EXO 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Asaa Gishshas Muse Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 32:30"/>Wonteththa gallas Musey asaa, «Intte gita nagara ooththideta shin ha7i tani GODAAKKO pude zumaa bolla kezana; ta intte nagara atto giissanaakko oonee erizay» gides. <verse eid="EXO 32:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 32:31"/>Histtiin Musey GODAAKKO simmi biidi, «Hayssi asay gita nagara ooththides; istti baas worqqafe eeqa xoos medhdhida. <verse eid="EXO 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 32:32"/>Gido attiin Abeet Godoo! Ha7i istta nagara atto ga; akkay giikko neni xaafida mazgabaappe ta sunththaa qucca digga» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:28">Maza 69:28</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:5">Ajju 3:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 32:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 32:33"/>Histtiin GODAY zaaridi Muses, «Tani ta mazgabaappe ta bolla nagara ooththida asata sunththaa quccana. <verse eid="EXO 32:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 32:34"/>Ha7i baada ha asaa tani nees yootida soo kaaleththa; ta kiitanchchayka nena kaaleththana; gido attiin qaxxayana wodey gakkishin istta nagaraa gishshas ta istta qaxxayana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 32:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 32:35"/>Aarooney worqqafe mara misle medhdhana mala asay iza waayisida gishshassinne izi medhdhida gishshas GODAY istta bolla bosha yeddides.<verse eid="EXO 32:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EXO 33"/>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Asay Siina Zumaa Achchafe Dendi Baana Mala Muses Godaa Azazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 33:1"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muses, «Neninne ne Gibxeppe kessida asay hayssafe dendidi, ‹Tani intte zereththatas immana› ga woththida biittaa biite. He biittay tani Abrahaames, Yisaaqassinne Yaaqoobes immana gaada kase caaqqa woththidayssa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Medhe 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:13">28:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 33:2"/>Tani inttefe sinththara kiitanchcha kiittada, Kanaaneta, Amooreta, Hiiteta, Paarizeta, Hiiwetanne Yaabuseta gooddana. <verse eid="EXO 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 33:3"/>Maaththinne eessi goggiza he biittaa biite. Gido attiin intte wozina muume as gidida gishshas tani inttena ogen dhayssontta mala ta inttenara biikke» gides.<verse eid="EXO 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 33:4"/>Asay hessa iita yo7oza siyidi keehi yeekkides. He wodeppe doommidi asay wurikka alleqos aaththizayssa aggides. <verse eid="EXO 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 33:5"/>Gaasoykka GODAY Muses, «Isra7eele asaas, ‹Intte wozina muumida asa. Haray attoshin guuththa wode ta inttenara issife bizaakko tani inttena dhayssana. Ha7i intte alleqo kessichite; histtiko tani intte bolla ay ooththanaakko intte beyana› ga» gi yooti woththides. <verse eid="EXO 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 33:6"/>Isra7eele asay Siina zumaappe doommidi ba alleqo miishshaa kessi woththides.<verse eid="EXO 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gaytoteththa Dunkaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 33:7"/>Musey Dunkaaneza ekki efidi asay dunkaanidasoppe haassi tolides. Dunkaanezi, «Gaytoteththa Dunkaane» geetetti summides. GODAA oychchanaas koyzay wuri he gayteththa dunkaaney dizaso bees. <verse eid="EXO 33:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 33:8"/>Musey he dunkaanezakko bida wode aydekka asay wuri ba dunkaaneza pengen pengen eqqidi Musey dunkaanezan gelana gakkanaas iza xeellees. <verse eid="EXO 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 33:9"/>Musey gayteththa dunkaaneza giddo gelida wode tuussa mala shaaray duge wodhdhiin GODAY Musera haasayshe dunkaaneza pengen gam7ees. <verse eid="EXO 33:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 33:10"/>Tuussa mala shaaraza dunkaaneza pengen be7ida ubba wode, asay wuri ba pengen pengen eqqidi dizasohon dishe GODAAS goynnees. <verse eid="EXO 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 33:11"/>Asi ba laggera haasayza mala GODAY Musera sinththan eqqidi haasayees. Hessafe guye Musey dunkaaney dizaso guye simmees shin iza maaddiza naateththa naa, Nawe naa Iyaasoy gaytoteththa Dunkaanezappe shaakettenna.<verse eid="EXO 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musey Godaara Haasaydes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 33:12"/>Musey GODAAS, «Neni tana, ‹Hayssa asaa kaaleththa› gadasashin tanara neni oona kiittizaakko tana erisabeekka. Neni, ‹Tani nena ne sunththan erays; neni ta sinththan sabettida asa› gadasa. <verse eid="EXO 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 33:13"/>Ne sinththan ta sabettidaa gidikko tani nena erana malanne sinththafekka ne sinththan sabettashe daana mala, ne oge tana tamaarsa. Ha asay ne asa gididayssa qoppa» gides.<verse eid="EXO 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 33:14"/>Histtiin GODAY zaaridi, «Tani nenara baana; tani nena shempisana» gides. <verse eid="EXO 33:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 33:15"/>Histtiin Musey iza, «Neni nunara bonttaa gidikko hayssafe nuna kessofa. <verse eid="EXO 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 33:16"/>Neni nunara bontta ixxiko tananinne ne asaan neni sabettidayssa asay wuri wostti eranee? Biitta bolla diza hara asa ubbaafe tananne ne asaa dummasizay hara miishshi aazee?» gides.<verse eid="EXO 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 33:17"/>Histtiin GODAY Muse, «Ta nenan sabettida gishshassinne nena ne sunththan eriza gishshas neni tana oychchidayssa qasseka tani ooththana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 33:18"/>Histtiin Musey, «Histtiko ne gita bonchchoza tana bessarkkii?» gides. <verse eid="EXO 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 33:19"/>GODAY, «Tani ta lo7eteththaa ubbaa ne sinththara aaththana; ta geeshsha sunththaaka ne achchan awajjana. Tani GODAA; tani maaranaas koyzayta maarana; qasse mishettanaas koyzaytaska mishettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:15">Oro 9:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 33:20"/>Gido attiin neni ta ayfeso beyakka; ays giikko oonikka tana be7idi paxa attenna» gides.<verse eid="EXO 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 33:21"/>Hessafe guye GODAY, «Neni ta achchan eqqanaas zaalla bolla eqqanasoy hayssan dees. <verse eid="EXO 33:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 33:22"/>Ta bonchchoy aadhdhi biza wode tani nena zaalla za7a giddon woththana. Aadhdhana gakkanaas ta kushen nena kammana. <verse eid="EXO 33:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 33:23"/>Hessafe guye tani ta kushe diggiko neni ta zokko beyanashin ta ayfesoy beettanaas bessenna» gides.<verse eid="EXO 33:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EXO 34"/>
  <para style="s1">Nam7anththo Masettida Shuchchata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 10:1-5">Zaare 10:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 34:1"/>GODAY Muses, «Koyroyta misatiza nam7u shuchchata massa giigsa; histtiko tani he masettida shuchchata bolla kase neni menththida shuchchata bollan diza qaalata xaafana. <verse eid="EXO 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 34:2"/>Wonto maalado pude Siina zumaa bolla kezanaas giigetta; histtada tanara heen zumaa bollan gaagga. <verse eid="EXO 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 34:3"/>Nenara oonikka kezoppo; woykko zumaa bolla awanka beettofo; haray attoshin dorsi woykko mehe wudeykka zumaa sinththan heemettofo» gides.<verse eid="EXO 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 34:4"/>Hessa gishshas Musey koyro shuchchata misatiza nam7u shuchchata massidi GODAY azazida mala, shuchchata ba kushen oykki ekkidi, maalado wonttara pude Siina zumaa bolla kezides. <verse eid="EXO 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 34:5"/>Keziin GODAY shaarara duge wodhdhi izara heen eqqidi ba sunththaa, «GODAA» gi erisides. <verse eid="EXO 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 34:6"/>GODAY Muse sinththara, «Tani GODAY qadhetaynne maarotay kumida Xoossa, hanqettanaas gam7iza, mernaas siiqizanne ammaneteththay darida Xoossa. <verse eid="EXO 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 34:7"/>Tani ta mernaa siiqoza shii yelet gakkanaas naagays; iitateth, makkallanne nagara atto gays. Gidikkoka moorizaade qaxxayontta aggike; aawata nagara gishshas naytanne nayta nayta, heedzdzanththo yeletanne oydanththo yeleta gakkanaas qaxxayays» gi awajjishe aadhdhides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:6-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5-6">Kessa 20:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:18">Tay 14:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:9-10">Zaare 5:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:9-10">7:9-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 34:8"/>Histtiin Musey heerakka biitta bolla gufanni goynnidi, <verse eid="EXO 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 34:9"/>«Abeet Godoo! Neni tanan ufayettidaa gidikko ne nunara issife baana mala ta nena woossays. Hayssi asay wozina muume gidikkoka nu iitateththaanne nu nagaraa atto gaada nuna ne as histta» gides.<verse eid="EXO 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Caaqo Qaala Ooraththateth</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 23:14-19">Kessa 23:14-19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:1-5">Zaare 7:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-17">16:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 34:10"/>Histtiin GODAY, «Tani inttenara caaqo geladis; hayssafe kase biitta bolla diza kawoteth ubbaan hani erontta malalisiza miish ne asa ubbaa sinththan ooththana; tani GODAY inttes ooththiza oosoy ay mala malalisizaazakko neni istta giddon diza asay beyana. <verse eid="EXO 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 34:11"/>Hach tani inttena azaziza azazo naagite; intte sinththafe Amooreta, Kanaaneta, Hiiteta, Paarizeta, Hiiwetanne Yaabuseta tani gooddana. <verse eid="EXO 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 34:12"/>Istti inttes narxa gidontta mala intte biza biittan diza asaara caaqo caaqettofte. <verse eid="EXO 34:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 34:13"/>Istti yarshizasohota laallite; istti goynniza shuchchatakka menththereththite; qasse Asheero geetettiza istta macca eeqa xoossay misletakka menththereththi yeggite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 16:21">Zaare 16:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 34:14"/>Tani GODAY qanaatiza Xoossa gidiza gishshas taappe attiin hara eeqa xoossatas goynnofte.<verse eid="EXO 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 34:15"/>«He biittan diza asatara ay caaqokka caaqettofte; ays giikko istti tanan ammanettontta ixxidi ba eeqata kaalliza wodenne isttas yarshiza wode istti inttena xeygikko intte istta yarsho maana. <verse eid="EXO 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 34:16"/>Qasse intte istta macca naytappe dooridi intte attuma naytas ekkana; he wode he macca nayti tanan ammanettontta ixxidi ba eeqa xoossaa kaallidi intte attuma nayti istta kallana mala ooththana.<verse eid="EXO 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 34:17"/>«Inttes goynnana eeqa xoossata aazappeka seerisidi medhdhofte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:4">Kessa 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:4">Lewe 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:8">Zaare 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:15">27:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 34:18"/>«Ukeththa Ba7aale bonchchite; tani inttena azazida mala laappun gallassas irshoy gelontta uukettida uketh miite; hessaka intte Gibxeppe kezida Abibe aginan ooththite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:14-20">Kessa 12:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:6-8">Lewe 23:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:16-25">Tay 28:16-25</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 34:19"/>«Uloppe bayra yelettiza attuma nay wuri taassa; intte mehe ubbaafekka boora gidiin, woykko dorsa gidiin bayray taassa;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Kessa 13:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 34:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 34:20"/>koyro yelettida hare mar, dorsa laaqqara laammada wozza; wozzontta ixxiko iza qoodhe mirqqa wodha. Ne naytappe bayra yelettida attuma naa ubbaa wozza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:13">Kessa 13:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:20">«Oonikka immiza miish oykkontta mela kushe ta sinththan beettofo.<verse eid="EXO 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 34:21"/>«Usuppun gallas ooththite shin laappunththa gallas shempite; goshsha wode gidiin woykko maxa wodenkka laappunththa gallassan shempite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:9-10">Kessa 20:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:12">23:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:15">31:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 35:2">35:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:3">Lewe 23:3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13-14">Zaare 5:13-14</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 34:22"/>«Gistte xeera intte maxiza wode kaththa shiisho Ba7aale bonchchite; he layththa wurseththa kath shiishshiza wodekka daase Ba7aale bonchchite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lewe 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:26-31">Tay 28:26-31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 34:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 34:23"/>Isra7eele attuma asay wuri GODAA Ubbaa Haariza Isra7eele Xoossaa sinththan layththan heedzdzuto beettetto. <verse eid="EXO 34:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 34:24"/>Dumma dumma dereta tani intte sinththafe yedeththa kessana; histtada intte zawaa tani aassana. GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan intte layththan heedzdzaa beettanaas pude keziza wode oonikka intte biitta amottenna.<verse eid="EXO 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 34:25"/>«Intte taas suuththa yarsho yarshiza wode irsho yeggidi uukkida ukeththara yarshofte. Paaziga bonchchiza gallassas yarshida yarshofe maalados aykkoyka attofo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:10">Kessa 12:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 34:26"/>«Intte gaden bayra kaxxida kaththaafe koyro xeeraa GODAA intte Xoossaa keeth ehite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:21">Zaare 24:21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:2">26:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:26">«Deyshsha laaqqa iza aayey maaththan doyssofte» gides.<verse eid="EXO 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 34:27"/>GODAY Muses, «Tani nenaranne Isra7eele asaara caaqo caaqettizay ha qaalati giza mala gidida gishshas ha qaalata xaafa» gides. <verse eid="EXO 34:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 34:28"/>Musey kath monttanne haaththe uyontta oyddu tammu gallassinne oyddu tammu qamma GODAARA heen gam7idi caaqo qaala gidida tammu azazota masettida shuchcha bolla xaafides.<verse eid="EXO 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muse Ayfeso Xolqeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 34:29"/>Musey nam7u masettida shuchchata ba kushen oykkidi Siina zumaappe duge wodhdhida wode, izi GODAARA haasayshe gam7ida gishshas iza ayfesoy xolqides; gido attiin izi hessa eribeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:29-35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 3:7-16">2Qoro 3:7-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 34:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 34:30"/>Aarooneynne Isra7eele asay wuri Muse xeellidi iza ayfesoy xolqizayssa be7idi izakko shiiqanaas babbida. <verse eid="EXO 34:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 34:31"/>Gido attiin Musey istta xeygiin Aarooneynne dereza kaaleththiza halaqati wuri izakko yiin izi istta haasayssides. <verse eid="EXO 34:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 34:32"/>Hessafe guye Isra7eele asay wuri izakko shiiqiin GODAY izas Siina zumaa bolla immida azazota ubbaa izi isttas immides.<verse eid="EXO 34:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 34:33"/>Musey isttas yooti wursidi ba ayfeso naxalan kammides. <verse eid="EXO 34:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 34:34"/>Gido attiin Musey GODAA sinth izara haasayanaas gaytoteththa dunkaane giddo geliza wode naxalaa ba ayfesoppe qaarees. Heeppe kezidi GODAY azazidayssa Isra7eele asaas yootees. <verse eid="EXO 34:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 34:35"/>Musey yootiza wode Isra7eele asay iza ayfesoy xolqizayssa be7ides. Hessa gishshas Musey GODAARA haasayana baana gakkanaas ba ayfeso zaareththidikka naxalan kammees.<verse eid="EXO 34:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EXO 35"/>
  <para style="s1">Sambata Bonchchiza Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 35:1"/>Musey Isra7eele asaa ubbaa shiishshidi, «Intte ooththana mala GODAY azazidayssi hayssafe kaalli dizayssa. <verse eid="EXO 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 35:2"/>Saamintta giddon usuppun gallas xalala ooso ooththite; gido attiin laappunththa gallassay inttes dumma gallassa; GODAASKA shempo Sambata. He gallas ay oosokka ooththiza asi oonikka hayqqanaas bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8-11">Kessa 20:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:12">23:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:15">31:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:21">34:21</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:3">Lewe 23:3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:12-14">Zaare 5:12-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 35:3"/>Sambata gallassan intte soon soon tama eeththofte» gides.<verse eid="EXO 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Dunkaane Oosos Koshshiza Miishshata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:1-9">Kessa 25:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 35:4"/>Musey Isra7eele maabaraas kumeththaas, «GODAY inttena hizgi azazides. <verse eid="EXO 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 35:5"/>Inttes dizayssafe GODAAS imota ehite; GODAAS imota ehanaas koyzay oonikka worqqa, biraa, xarqimala, <verse eid="EXO 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 35:6"/>salo misatiza qacina, ochcha teera misatiza qacina, xeeqa zo7o qacinanne liiqo layno, deysha anttasha, <verse eid="EXO 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 35:7"/>zo7o qalamen geli kezida dharsho ite, qaacettida galba, odoro mith, <verse eid="EXO 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 35:8"/>xomppes wogara zayte, tiyettiza zaytenne exaane sawiza qimame, <verse eid="EXO 35:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 35:9"/>eefudenne tira kiisen woththiza margide geetettiza shuchchatanne hara xolqiza al7o shuchchata eho.<verse eid="EXO 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 35:10"/>«Intte giddon diza kushe hiillanchchay ubbay yiidi GODAY azazidayssa ubbaa ooththo. <verse eid="EXO 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 35:11"/>Xoossa Dunkaaneza, Dunkaanezas soo baggaranne kare baggara kammiza dunkaane, qapheta, tole miththata, gorde miththata, tuussatanne isttan eqqiza tohota, <verse eid="EXO 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 35:12"/>Taabotaanne iza tookkiza toho miththata, atto geetettiza kamanne Taabotaa kammiza magalasha, <verse eid="EXO 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 35:13"/>xaraphpheezaza, iza tookkiza tooho miththataranne izas koshshiza miishshata ubbaa, GODAA sinththan woththiza dumma ukeththa; <verse eid="EXO 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 35:14"/>xomppe iza bolla woththiza miishshaa izas koshshiza miishshatara, xomppeta, xomppe zayte, <verse eid="EXO 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 35:15"/>exaane cuwasizasozanne iza tookkiza tooho miththata, tiyettiza zaytenne sawiza exaane, Xoossa Dunkaaneza penge magalasha, <verse eid="EXO 35:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 35:16"/>xuugettiza yarsho yarshizasonne xarqimalappe oosettida zayzareza, iza tookkiza tooho miththatanne izas koshshiza miishshata ubbaa, xarqimalappe oosettida meechcha kerenne iza woththizaso, <verse eid="EXO 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 35:17"/>dunkaanaas kare bagga wuyge magalashata, tuussatanne istta tohota, dunkaanaas kare bagga wuyge geliza pengeza magalasha, <verse eid="EXO 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 35:18"/>Xoossa dunkaaneza toliza dhishketa, dunkaanaas kare bagga wuyge dhishketanne istta wodorota, <verse eid="EXO 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 35:19"/>qeeseti dummasozan ooththishe may7anaas dadettida may7ota, qeese Aarooneynne iza nayti qeeseteththa ooso ooththishe may7iza may7ota ooththana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 35:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asay Ehida Imota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 35:20"/>Hessafe guye Isra7eele asay wuri Muse sinththafe kezi bides. <verse eid="EXO 35:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 35:21"/>Immanaas koyidaytinne istta wozinay istta imma imma gidayti wuri yiidi Xoossa dunkaanezas, iza giddon oosettiza oosossinne geeshsha may7o ubbaas koshshiza miish ubbaa ehida. <verse eid="EXO 35:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 35:22"/>Immana koyza attumaynne maccay wuri yiidi worqqafe oosettida alleqota, hayththa worqqa, sagayo, qoodhen aaththiza xangalatanne worqqa alleqota ehidi GODAAS yaanne haa qaaseththiza yarsho histti shiishshida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xangalata gizayssi maccassas qoodhen aaththiza birappe oosettida alleqo.</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 35:23"/>Salo misatiza qacinay, ochcha teera misatiza qacinay, xeeqa zo7o qacinay, woykko layno geetettiza liiqo qacinay, woykko deysha anttashayay, zo7o qalamen geli kezida dharsho itey, woykko qaacettida galbay diza asi wuri ehides. <verse eid="EXO 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 35:24"/>Bira woykko xarqimala immanaas dandayzay wuri ba imota GODAAS immides; qasse odoro miththi diza asay wuri dumma dumma oosos odoro mith ehides.<verse eid="EXO 35:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 35:25"/>Kushe hiilla eriza maccassay wuri ba kushen suqida salo misatiza qacina, ochcha teera misatiza qacina, xeeqa zo7o qacinanne liiqo layno ehides. <verse eid="EXO 35:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 35:26"/>Qasseka imota immanaas koyida maccassay wuri deysha anttasha daddi ehida. <verse eid="EXO 35:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 35:27"/>Halaqati eefudenne tira kiisen woththiza margidenne hara bonchchettida shuchchata ehida. <verse eid="EXO 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 35:28"/>Qasseka xomppes, sawiza exaanessinne tiyettanaas wogara zaytenne qimame ehida. <verse eid="EXO 35:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 35:29"/>Isra7eele asay wuri attumaynne maccay, istti ooththana mala GODAY Muse baggara azazida oosos gidiza imota ubbaa ba dosan GODAAS ehides.<verse eid="EXO 35:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Dunkaane Ooththiza Kushe Hiillanchchata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 31:1-11">Kessa 31:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 35:30"/>Musey Isra7eele asaas, «Be7ite; GODAY Yuhuda qommofe Uures naaza naa, Huurey naa Basli7eele doorides. <verse eid="EXO 35:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 35:31"/>GODAY iza Xoossa Ayanan, aadho eran, akeekaninne ooso ubbaa ooththiza erateththan kunththides. <verse eid="EXO 35:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 35:32"/>Hessika hiillan ooso qoppi kessidi worqqafe, birappenne xarqimalappe dumma dumma miish ooththanaassa. <verse eid="EXO 35:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 35:33"/>Hessaththoka al7o shuch massi giigsanaassa; qasseka mith massanaassinne dumma dumma ooso hiillan ooththanaassa. <verse eid="EXO 35:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 35:34"/>Hessa bollaka qasse izassinne Daane qommofe Ahisaameke naa Eelaabes, hara as tamaarssiza erateth immides. <verse eid="EXO 35:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 35:35"/>Istti ubba qommo ooso ooththana mala, hiillan ooththizayta, ooso qofa kessizayta, salo misatiza qacinan, ochcha teera misatiza qacinan, xeeqa zo7o qacinaninne layno qacinan alleqissi daddizayta gidana mala, GODAY istta erateththan kunththides. Istti wurikka ubba qommo ooso eriza eranchcha gidida.<verse eid="EXO 35:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EXO 36"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 36:1"/>«Hessa gishshas Basli7eeley, Eelaabeynne Xoossa Dunkaane ooththana mala GODAY erateth immida asay wuri GODAY azazida mala istti ooththana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asay Daro Imota Immides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 36:2"/>Hessafe guye Musey Basli7eele, Eelaabenne GODAY dumma erateth immidayta ooso ooththanaas yaana koyzayta ubbaa xeygidi shiishshides. <verse eid="EXO 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 36:3"/>Shiiqidayti Isra7eele asay Xoossa Dunkaane ooththanaas ehida imota ubbaa Museppe ekkida. Qasse asay ba dosan coo immiza imota maalado maalado gujji gujjidi eho aggibeenna. <verse eid="EXO 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 36:4"/>Histtiin Xoossa Dunkaaneza ooththiza erateththi kumida asay wuri ba ooththizayssa aggi Musekko biidi, <verse eid="EXO 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 36:5"/>«Asay GODAY azazida oosos koshshizayssafe bollara daro ehon dees» gida.<verse eid="EXO 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 36:6"/>Histtiin Musey ba dunkaanen dunkaanen diza asaas, «Nam7anththo oonakka gidiin Xoossa Dunkaane oosos immiza imota ehoppo» gi yootiin asay ehizayssa aggaagides. <verse eid="EXO 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 36:7"/>Gaasoykka istti ehida imotay ooso ubbaa ooththanaas gidi palahana.<verse eid="EXO 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Dunkaane Ooso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 26:1-37">Kessa 26:1-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 36:8"/>Oosoza ooththizayta giddofe hiillaa darzayti wuri liiqo laynoppenne salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinappe dadettida tammu magalashatappe Xoossa Dunkaaneza giigsida. He magalashata bolla bollara issi hiillanchchay kirubeta misle sikkides. <verse eid="EXO 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 36:9"/>Magalashati wuri issi gina gididi adussateththay nam7u tammanne osppun wadha; aahoteththay oyddu wadha. <verse eid="EXO 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 36:10"/>Ichchashu magalashata issife gaththi sikkida; qasse hankko attida ichchashu magalashatakka izaththoka ooththida. <verse eid="EXO 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 36:11"/>Issife gaththi sikkida magalashatappe issi magalashaas wurseththa gaxan salo misatiza carqqafe siidhe medhdhida. Qasse issife gaaggi sikettida hankko magalashatankka hessaththoka ooththida. <verse eid="EXO 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 36:12"/>Istti issife gaaggida issi magalasha bolla ichchashu tammu siidheta, qasse issife gaaggida hankko magalashata bollaka ichchashu tammu siidheta medhdhida. He siidheti wurikka issoy issaara ginan deettes. <verse eid="EXO 36:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 36:13"/>Hessafe guye worqqafe ichchashu tammu qapheta medhdhidi Dunkaanezi issino gidana mala, he magalashata gaxaa gaxaa he qaphetan gaththi oyseththida.<verse eid="EXO 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 36:14"/>Xoossa Dunkaaneza bollara kammiza dunkaanezas tammanne issi magalashata deysha anttashappe daddida. <verse eid="EXO 36:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 36:15"/>Tammanne issi magalashatikka issi gina; issi issi magalashaas adussateththi heedzdzu tammu wadha, aahoteththi oyddu wadha. <verse eid="EXO 36:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 36:16"/>Ichchashu magalashata issi baggara, usuppun magalashata qasse hankko baggara gaththidi sikkida. <verse eid="EXO 36:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 36:17"/>Hessafe guye gaththi sikkida magalashatappe issi magalasha gaxan ichchashu tammu siidheta medhdhida. Qasseka gaththi sikkida hankko magalashatappe wurseththa magalashaza gaxan ichchashu tammu siidheta medhdhida. <verse eid="EXO 36:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 36:18"/>Nam7u baggara diza magalashata gaththi issi kama ooththanaas xarqimalappe ichchashu tammu qapheta medhdhida. <verse eid="EXO 36:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 36:19"/>Hessafe guye Dunkaaneza kammanaas zo7o qalamen yeggi kessida dharsho ite giigsida; qasse iza bollara kammanaas qaacettida galba giigsida.<verse eid="EXO 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 36:20"/>Xoossa Dunkaane tole miththata luule gidida odoro miththafe kessida. <verse eid="EXO 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 36:21"/>Issi issi tole miththaas adussateththay tammu wadha; aahoteththay issi wadhanne bagga. <verse eid="EXO 36:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 36:22"/>Issi issi tole issaa issaara gaththi oyseththiza nam7u tole medhdhida. Xoossa Dunkaaneza tole miththata wursika hessaththo ooththida. <verse eid="EXO 36:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 36:23"/>Xoossa Dunkaanezas tohoso baggara nam7u tammu tole miththata medhdhidi, <verse eid="EXO 36:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 36:24"/>Issi issi tole miththas nam7u toho, mulera oyddu tammu toho birappe giigsida. <verse eid="EXO 36:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 36:25"/>Xoossa Dunkaanezas hu7eso baggara nam7u tammu tole miththata medhdhidi, <verse eid="EXO 36:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 36:26"/>Issi issi tole miththas nam7u toho, mulera oyddu tammu toho birappe giigsida. <verse eid="EXO 36:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 36:27"/>Xoossa Dunkaanezas guye gaxan duge baggara usuppun tole miththata medhdhida. <verse eid="EXO 36:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 36:28"/>Xoossa Dunkaaneza guye gaxan diza zoozetas nam7u tole miththata giigsida. <verse eid="EXO 36:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 36:29"/>Ha nam7u zoozetan diza toleti xaphoppe xeera gakkanaashe nam7u gidi biidi xeeran issi sagayon geli oykettida. Istti nam7ayka hessaththo oosettida. <verse eid="EXO 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 36:30"/>Hessa gishshas issi issi tole miththas garsara nam7u nam7u tohoti deettes; mulera osppun xagagatinne birappe oosettida tammanne usuppun tohoti deettes.<verse eid="EXO 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 36:31"/>Qasse istti odoro miththafe tammanne ichchashu kare gordiza mith kessida; isttafe Xoossa Dunkaanezas issi bagga millen diza tole miththatas ichchashu gordiza miththata, <verse eid="EXO 36:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 36:32"/>qasse hankko bagga millen diza tole miththatas ichchashu gordiza miththata giigsida. Hessaththoka Xoossa Dunkaanezas guye baggara arshey wulliza baggara wurseththa gaxan diza tole miththatas ichchashu gordiza miththata medhdhida. <verse eid="EXO 36:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 36:33"/>Giddora gordiza miththati xagagatas giddo ginara, ha gaxappe he gaxa gakkanaas kanththi kezana mala ooththida. <verse eid="EXO 36:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 36:34"/>Tole miththaa worqqan tiydi gordiza miththati aadhdhiza sagayota worqqafe medhdhida; qasse gordiza miththata worqqan tiyda.<verse eid="EXO 36:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 36:35"/>Salo misatiza qacinappe, ochcha teera misatiza qacinappe, xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne liiqo laynoppe issi magalasha ooththida. He magalashaza bolla issi hiillay kirubeta misle sikkides. <verse eid="EXO 36:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 36:36"/>Magalashaas oyddu tuussata odoro miththafe giigsidi worqqan tiyda. Histtidi worqqafe kaqota isttas giigsida. Qasse tuussata essiza oyddu tohota birappe medhdhida. <verse eid="EXO 36:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 36:37"/>Xoossa Dunkaane geliza pengezas salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne liiqo laynoppe dadettida, xilpen aleqettida magalasha giigsida. <verse eid="EXO 36:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 36:38"/>Qasse isttas ichchashu kaqotara diza ichchashu tuussata ooththida. Tuussata xeeraanne ciro qachchizayta worqqan tiyda. Qasse tuussati eqqana mala ichchashu toho xarqimalappe medhdhida.<verse eid="EXO 36:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EXO 37"/>
  <para style="s1">Taabota Ooso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:10-22">Kessa 25:10-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 37:1"/>Basli7eeley odoro miththaafe Taabota giigsides. Taabotaas adussateththay nam7u wadhanne bagga; aahoteththay issi wadhanne baggaa; dhoqqateththay issi wadhanne baggaa. <verse eid="EXO 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 37:2"/>Taabotaa giigsidi soo bagganne kare baggaa walakay baynda worqqan meeshides; iza yuuyi aadhdhanaas dancco worqqara yuushshi aaththides. <verse eid="EXO 37:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 37:3"/>Qasse oyddu worqqa sagayota seerisidi Taabotaas oyddu tohotan, issi baggara nam7u sagayota, qasse hankko baggara nam7u sagayota aaththides. <verse eid="EXO 37:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 37:4"/>Histtidi odoro miththafe tooho miththata kessidi isttaka worqqan meeshides. <verse eid="EXO 37:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 37:5"/>Taabotaa tookkanaas Taabotaa millen diza sagayotan tooho miththata aaththides.<verse eid="EXO 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 37:6"/>Walakay baynda worqqafe nam7u wadhanne baggaa aduqqiza, issi wadhanne baggaa aakkiza atto geetettiza sohoza kama medhdhides. <verse eid="EXO 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 37:7"/>Kamatas wurseththa nam7u bagga gaxan nam7u kirubeta qoxettida worqqafe medhdhides. <verse eid="EXO 37:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 37:8"/>Issi kirubeza issi bagga gaxan, nam7anththo kirubeza hankko bagga gaxan, nam7atakka kamazara gaththi oyseththi medhdhides. <verse eid="EXO 37:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 37:9"/>Kirubeti ba qefe denththidi atto geetettiza sohoza kammiza kama ba qefen kammi woththida; qasse issoy issaara xeelettana mala ooththides.<verse eid="EXO 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xaraphpheeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Kessa 25:23-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 37:10"/>Qasse adussateththay nam7u wadha, aahoteththay issi wadha, dhoqqateththay issi wadhanne bagga gidida xaraphpheeza odoro miththafe medhdhidi, <verse eid="EXO 37:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 37:11"/>walakay baynda worqqan meeshides. Iza yuuyi aadhdhanaas worqqa kifafe yuushshi aaththides. <verse eid="EXO 37:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 37:12"/>Hessaththoka aahoteththay tadhdhako gidiza kifafe iza bolla yuushshi aaththides. Histtidi iza yuuyi aadhdhanaas worqqa dancco yuushshi aaththides. <verse eid="EXO 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 37:13"/>Histtidi Taabotaa tookkanaas giigiza oyddu worqqa sagayota medhdhidi oyddu tohoti tokettida oyddu zoozetara oyseththides. <verse eid="EXO 37:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 37:14"/>Xaraphpheezaza tookkanaas tooho miththata istta giddora aaththiza sagayoti xaraphpheezaza xanxa bolla medhettida. <verse eid="EXO 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 37:15"/>Xaraphpheezaza tookkiza tooho miththaa odoro miththafe kessidi worqqan meeshides. <verse eid="EXO 37:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 37:16"/>Hessaththoka xaraphpheeza bolla woththiza dumma dumma miishshata walakay baynda worqqafe medhdhides; heytikka saanetanne cilfata, qasse ushsha yarsho isttan seerisiza keretanne xuu7ata.<verse eid="EXO 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xomppe Wososo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Kessa 25:31-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 37:17"/>Hessafe guye Basli7eeley xomppe woththizasoza qoxettida walakay baynda worqqafe medhdhides; xomppezi izan eqqiza toho, qasse giddo toomaakka ubbaa qoxettida worqqafe medhdhides. Iza kureta, iza dhemotanne iza ciishshata ubbaa izara issife oyseththi medhdhides. <verse eid="EXO 37:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 37:18"/>Millera usuppun ballata medhdhides; heedzdzu haggata issi baggara, qasse heedzdzu haggata hankko baggara kessides. <verse eid="EXO 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 37:19"/>Usuppun haggataska hu7en hu7en issi issi dhemotinne ciishshati diza, ochcholoone ciish misatiza wanca medhdhides; <verse eid="EXO 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 37:20"/>xomppe woththizasozas giddo toomay, dhemotinne ciishshati diza ochcholoone ciishshe misatiza oyddu wancan alleqetti uttides. <verse eid="EXO 37:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 37:21"/>Nam7ay nam7ay issife waaththan diza heedzdzu ballatanne garsara issi issi dhemoy dees. <verse eid="EXO 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 37:22"/>Dhemotinne haggati wuri xomppe woththizasozara issife oyketti issino gididi walakay baynda worqqafe qoxetti medhettida.<verse eid="EXO 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 37:23"/>Izi qasse xomppe woththizasozas laappun xomppeta, xomppe toyssiza qaphetanne qapheta woththizaso walakay baynda worqqafe medhdhides. <verse eid="EXO 37:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 37:24"/>Xomppeza woththizasozanne izan go7ettiza miish ubbaa medhdhanaas heedzdzu tammanne ichchash kilo gidiza walakay baynda worqqa wursides.<verse eid="EXO 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Exaane Cuwasizaso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 30:1-5">Kessa 30:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 37:25"/>Hessaththoka qasse exaane cuwasizasoza odoro miththafe medhdhides. Izas oyddu gulay dees; adussateththay issi wadha; aahoteththay issi wadha, dhoqqateththay nam7u wadha. Iza kacetikka izara issino gididi oyketti medhettidayta.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gula gizayssa issi issi bagga Gamoththo qaalan zooze woykko denqeshe geettes.</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 37:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 37:26"/>Izas bolla baggaza, oyddu milletanne iza kaceta walakay baynda worqqan meeshidi iza yuushshi aaththanaas xanxaza worqqafe ooththides. <verse eid="EXO 37:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 37:27"/>He worqqa xanxaafe garsara exaane cuwasizasozas worqqafe nam7u sagayota medhdhides; histtidi he baggaranne ha baggara nam7u nam7u oyththides. Heyti tookkiza wode tooho miththata aaththanaas maaddanaassa. <verse eid="EXO 37:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 37:28"/>Tooho miththata odoro miththafe kessidi istta worqqan meeshides.<verse eid="EXO 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 37:29"/>Qasse dummatida tiyettiza zaytenne sawo tunnu giza lo7o exaane, shitto mala giigsides.<verse eid="EXO 37:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EXO 38"/>
  <para style="s1">Xuugettiza Yarsho Yarshizasoza Ooso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 27:1-8">Kessa 27:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 38:1"/>Odoro miththafe xuugettiza yarsho yarshizaso ooththides. He yarshizasoza dhoqqateththay heedzdzu wadha, aahoteththaynne adussateththay issi gina, ichchashu ichchashu wadha gididi oyddu gulay dizayssa ooththides. <verse eid="EXO 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 38:2"/>Oyddu gulata wurseththa xeeran xeeran issi issi kace medhdhides. He kaceti yarshizasozara issife oykettidi oosettida. Histtidi yarshizasoza xarqimalara meeshides. <verse eid="EXO 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 38:3"/>Izan go7ettiza miishshata, bidinth kessiza saaneta, akaafata, kereta, asho konccetanne bonqo tama oykkiza kon7a ubbaa xarqimalappe medhdhides. <verse eid="EXO 38:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 38:4"/>Histtidi xarqimalappe zayzare yarshizasozas giigsidi yarshizasozas duge giddo ginan diza xanxazas garsa baggara woththides. <verse eid="EXO 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 38:5"/>Xarqimalappe medhdhida zayzarezas oyddu gulan tooho miththata aaththanaas oyddu qanggota medhdhides. <verse eid="EXO 38:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 38:6"/>Odoro miththafe yarshizasoza tooho miththata kessidi xarqimalan meeshides. <verse eid="EXO 38:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 38:7"/>Yarshizasoza tookkiza wode maaddana mala tooho miththata nam7u millera diza qanggotan aaththides. Yarshizasoza giddo doy7a aggidi sanqqafe medhdhides.<verse eid="EXO 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Meechcha Kere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 30:18">Kessa 30:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 38:8"/>Xarqimalappe meechcha kerenne kereza woththizaso medhdhides; he xarqimalazikka Xoossa Dunkaaneza pengen ooththiza maccassati ehida xarqimala mastooteppe ekettides.<verse eid="EXO 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Dunkaanezas Kare Bagga Wuyge Ooso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 27:9-19">Kessa 27:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 38:9"/>Hessafe guye dubbushasoza giigsides. Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuyges tohoso bagga adussateththaa xeetu wadha ooththidi, liiqo laynoppe dadettida magalasha giigsides. <verse eid="EXO 38:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 38:10"/>Izas xarqimalappe nam7u tammu tuussatanne tuussati izan eqqiza xarqimala toho ooththides; istta hu7en qasse birappe medhettida istta bolla kaqqizaytanne tuussata hu7en qachchizayta ooththides. <verse eid="EXO 38:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 38:11"/>Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuygezas hu7eso baggaa adussateththay xeetu wadha; qasse nam7u tammu tuussatinne he tuussatas nam7u tammu xarqimala tohoti deettes. Qasseka birappe oosettida istta bolla kaqqizaytinne tuussata hu7en qachchizayti deettes. <verse eid="EXO 38:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 38:12"/>Arshey wullizaso baggara diza dubbushaa aahoteththi ichchashu tammu wadha gididi tammu tuussatinne tuussatas tammu tohoti diza magalashata giigsides; he tuussata hu7en birappe medhettida istta bolla kaqotanne tuussatas hu7en qachchizayta ooththides. <verse eid="EXO 38:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 38:13"/>Qasse arshey mokkiza baggara diza dubbushaso aahoteththi ichchash tammu wadha. <verse eid="EXO 38:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 38:14"/>Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuygeza gelizasoppe issi baggara tammanne ichchash wadha aduqqiza magalashati, isttas heedzdzu tuussatinne tuussatas heedzdzu tohoti deettes. <verse eid="EXO 38:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 38:15"/>Hessaththoka Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuygeza gelizasoppe hankko baggara tammanne ichchashu wadha aduqqiza magalashati, isttas heedzdzu tuussatinne tuussatas heedzdzu tohoti deettes. <verse eid="EXO 38:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 38:16"/>Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuygeza yuushon diza magalashati wuri liiqo laynoppe dadettida. <verse eid="EXO 38:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 38:17"/>He tuussatas tohoy xarqimalappe, kaqotinne tuussatas hu7en qachchizayti birappe oosettida; istta hu7ey biran meeshettides. Hessa gishshas dubbushasoza yuushon diza tuussata ubbaa hu7en birappe oosettida qachchiza miishshati deettes. <verse eid="EXO 38:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 38:18"/>Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuygeza gelizason kaqqiza magalashay salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne liiqo laynoppe dadettidi xilpen alleqissi giigsidaaza. Izas adussateththay nam7u tammu wadha; dhoqqateththay Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuygeza magalashata mala ichchashu wadha. <verse eid="EXO 38:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 38:19"/>Izaskka xarqimalappe oosettida oyddu tuussatinne tuussatas oyddu tohoti deettes. Istta kaqotinne tuussatas hu7en qachchiza miishshati birappe oosettida; istta xeeratikka biran meeshettida. <verse eid="EXO 38:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 38:20"/>Xoossa Dunkaaneza dhishketinne iza yuushon diza Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuygeza dhishketi wuri xarqimalappe oosettidayta.<verse eid="EXO 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Dunkaanen Go7ettiza Miishshata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 38:21"/>Xoossa Dunkaanezas go7ettida miishshata Lewe qommoti mazgaban xaafida. He miishshata qeese Aaroone naa Itamaare daannateththa garsan diza Leweti mazgaban xaafana mala Musey azazides.<verse eid="EXO 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 38:22"/>Biniyaame zereth gidida Uures naaza naa, Uure naa, Basli7eeley GODAY Muse azazidayssa ubbaa ooththides. <verse eid="EXO 38:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 38:23"/>Daane zereth gidida Ahisaameke naa Eelaabey izara dees; izi kushe hiillanchchanne oosos koyro qofa kessizaadeko; qasse salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinaninne liiqo laynon dadidi xilpen alleqissiza asa.<verse eid="EXO 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 38:24"/>Xoossa Dunkaaneza oosos GODAAS yaanne haa qaaseththi shiishshiza yarshos imettida worqqay Xoossa Dunkaanen erettida meezaanen woththiin 1,000 kilo gidides. <verse eid="EXO 38:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 38:25"/>Taybon diza maabara asaappe beettida biray Xoossa Dunkaanen erettida meezaanen woththiin 3,430 kilo gidides. <verse eid="EXO 38:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 38:26"/>Asaa taybiza wode taybettida attumasay wuri issaadey hu7en hu7en immidayssi Xoossa Dunkaanen erettida meezaanen woththiin usuppun giraame mala gidides. Taybettida asay nam7u tammu layth kumidaynne nam7u tammaafe bollara dizay mulera 603,550. <verse eid="EXO 38:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 38:27"/>Xoossa Dunkaaneza magalashata essida xeetu tohoti 3,400 kilo gidiza biran oosettida. Hessika issi issi tohos 34 kilo tigettiza bira. <verse eid="EXO 38:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 38:28"/>Attida heedzdzu tammu kilo biraa tuussata bolla kaqoso medhdhanaas, tuussatas hu7e bolla meeshanaassinne istta hu7en qachchiza miishshata medhdhanaas go7ettida. <verse eid="EXO 38:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 38:29"/>Hessaththoka asay GODAAS yaanne haa qaaseththi shiishshanaas ehida xarqimala yarshoy 2,425 kilo gidides. <verse eid="EXO 38:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 38:30"/>He xarqimalappe Xoossa Dunkaaneza gelizason eqqiza tuussatas tohoy, xarqimalappe oosettida yarshizaso geetettiza yarshizasozi, iza giddon woththida xarqimala zayzareynne iza giddon go7ettiza dumma dumma miishshay wuri medhettides. <verse eid="EXO 38:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 38:31"/>Hessaththoka qasse Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuyge yuushon diza dirsa giddo gelizaso pengen eqqida tohoy, qasse Xoossa Dunkaanezanne iza yuushon diza Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuyge dirsay tolettida dhishketi wuri he xarqimalaappe medhettida.<verse eid="EXO 38:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EXO 39"/>
  <para style="s1">Qeeseta May7o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 28:1-14">Kessa 28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 39:1"/>Qeeseti Xoossa Dunkaanen ooththiza wode may7ana may7o, salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinappe daddida. Aaroone qeeseteththaa may7oka GODAY Muse azazida mala ooththida.<verse eid="EXO 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 39:2"/>Qasse istti eefude worqqafe, salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne liiqo laynoppe daddida. <verse eid="EXO 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 39:3"/>Istti worqqa qoxxi lee7isidi, izappe qarari qararidi qacina kessida. Histtidi salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinanne liiqo layno gaththidi kushe hiillanchchati daddida. <verse eid="EXO 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 39:4"/>Nam7u baggay gaaggidi issino gidana mala nam7u hashe bolla gaththidi oyththiza carqqa giigsida. <verse eid="EXO 39:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 39:5"/>GODAY Muse azazida mala hiillay alleqissidi daddida danccoyka eefudera issife gididi, worqqafe salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne liiqo laynoppe dadettides. <verse eid="EXO 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 39:6"/>Istti margide geetettiza nam7u shuchchata giigsidi worqqafe medhdhida shuchchu oykkizayssa bolla maarara woththida. Maatafa bolla sunth wooci xaafiza mala he shuchchata bolla Isra7eele nayta sunth woocidi xaafida. <verse eid="EXO 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 39:7"/>GODAY Muse azazida mala tammanne nam7u Isra7eele qommota hassa7issizaaz gidana mala, ha tammanne nam7u shuchchata eefudezara oyththidi hashe kaqoza bolla woththida.<verse eid="EXO 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tira Bolla Diza Kiise</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 28:15-30">Kessa 28:15-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 39:8"/>Istti tiran woththiza kiise kushe hiillan ooththida. He tiran woththiza kiiseza eefude worqqafe daddida mala, salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne liiqo laynoppe daddida. <verse eid="EXO 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 39:9"/>Izas oyddu xeeray dees; dhoqqateththaynne aahoteththay issi issi tadhdhako. <verse eid="EXO 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 39:10"/>Hessafe guye iza bolla oyddu maaran al7o shuchchata woththida; koyro maaraan woththida shuchchay sardiyoone, tophaaziyoonenne xolqiza inqqu; <verse eid="EXO 39:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 39:11"/>nam7anththo maaran baluure, simpere almaaze geetettiza al7o shuchchata; <verse eid="EXO 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 39:12"/>heedzdzanththo maaran yaakintte, kelqedoonenne ametesxinoose; <verse eid="EXO 39:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 39:13"/>oydanththo maaran birille, margidenne yasphiide. Heyta ubbaa worqqafe oosettida shuchchu oykkizayssa bolla woththida. <verse eid="EXO 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 39:14"/>Isra7eele nayta sunththaa qooda mala, shuchchata qoodaykka tammanne nam7a; issay issay maatame mala woocettidi tammanne nam7u qommota sunththi he shuchchata bolla xaafettides.<verse eid="EXO 39:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 39:15"/>Tiran diza kiisezas wodoro mala dooqettida sansalataa walakay baynda worqqafe medhdhida. <verse eid="EXO 39:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 39:16"/>Nam7u worqqafe medhdhida shuchchu oykkizaytanne nam7u worqqa migidota medhdhidi tiran woththiza kiisezas qommo gaxa xeerata gaththi oyththida. <verse eid="EXO 39:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 39:17"/>He nam7u worqqa sansalatata tiran woththiza kiisezas xeeran diza migidotara gaththi oyseththida. <verse eid="EXO 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 39:18"/>He sansalatatas hankko bagga xeeraa qasse eefudezas sinththa baggara, hashe kaqo bolla diza shuch oykkizaytara gaththi qachchida. <verse eid="EXO 39:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 39:19"/>Qasseka nam7u worqqa midigata medhdhidi eefudeppe kaalli diza tira kiisezas soo baggara diza nam7u xeeratan aaththida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">39:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Midiga gizayssa issi issi bagga Gamoththo qaalan migido woykko cuuphe geetettees.</char></note> <verse eid="EXO 39:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 39:20"/>Hessaththoka worqqafe hara nam7u migidota medhdhidi, eefudezas sinththa baggara, hashe kaqozappe garsa baggara eefude xeessan qachchizayssafe qommora, sikoy gaaggizaso achchan istta oyththida. <verse eid="EXO 39:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 39:21"/>GODAY Muse azazida mala tira kiisen diza migidota eefudezan diza migidotara gaththidi, salo misatiza suqeththan qachchida gishshas tira kiisezi xeessafe bollara diza gishshas, qashoy dol7enna.<verse eid="EXO 39:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeeseti Mayza Hara May7ota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 28:31-43">Kessa 28:31-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 39:22"/>Eefudezappe bollara may7iza qamisa istti mulera salo misatiza carqqafe giigsida; hessika shemmaane oosokko. <verse eid="EXO 39:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 39:23"/>He qamisazas qoodhe aaththizaso medhdhida; qoodhesoy daakettontta mala, soo bagga qalam7idi yuushshi aaththi sikkida. <verse eid="EXO 39:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 39:24"/>Istta qamisazas duge bagga maccara yuushon salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne liiqo laynoppe oroomaane geetettiza miththa ayfe teera misleta medhdhida. <verse eid="EXO 39:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 39:25"/>Qasseka worqqafe daalata medhdhidi qamisatas duge bagga xeera yuushshi aaththidi oroomaane misleta giddon aaththi aaththi walakkida. <verse eid="EXO 39:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 39:26"/>GODAY Muses azazida mala istti Xoossa Dunkaane ooso ooththishe may7ana mala qamisazas duge bagga maccara yuushshi aaththidi daalanne oroomaane teera misle walakki aaththida.<verse eid="EXO 39:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 39:27"/>GODAY Muse azazida mala istti Aaroonessinne iza naytas shemmaaney daddida liiqo laynoppe qolleta giigsida. <verse eid="EXO 39:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 39:28"/>Qasse hu7en xaaxiza shaasheta, qoobetanne garsara may7iza may7ota liiqo laynoppe daddidi giigsida. <verse eid="EXO 39:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 39:29"/>Hessaththoka qasse istti salo misatiza, ochcha teera misatizanne xeeqa zo7o qacinappenne liiqo laynoppe daddidi kushe hiillan alleqissidi dancco giigsida.<verse eid="EXO 39:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 39:30"/>Istti akilile misle walakay baynda worqqafe medhdhidi maatame bolla woociza mala iza bolla, «GODAAS geesh gididi dummatides» gizayssa wooci xaafida. <verse eid="EXO 39:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 39:31"/>Hessafe guye hu7e goossa bolla kaqqana mala, GODAY Muse azazida mala salo misatiza baqeth izan aaththidi qachchida.<verse eid="EXO 39:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musey Oosoza Ubbaa Xomosides</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 35:10-19">Kessa 35:10-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 39:32"/>Xoossa Dunkaaneza oosoy wuri mulera polettides. Isra7eele asay ubbaa GODAY Muse azazida mala ooththides. <verse eid="EXO 39:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 39:33"/>Hessafe guye istti Xoossa Dunkaaneza mulera ekkidi Musekko ehida; hessika dunkaanezanne iza miishshaza ubbaa, qapheta, tole miththata, penge gordiza miththata, tuussatanne istti eqqiza tohota, <verse eid="EXO 39:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 39:34"/>bollara kammanaas dharshoza ite zo7o qalamen yeggi kessidayssa, qaacettida galba, genththiza magalasha, <verse eid="EXO 39:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 39:35"/>Caaqo Qaala Taabotaa, iza tookkiza tooho miththata, atto geetettiza kamaa, <verse eid="EXO 39:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 39:36"/>xaraphpheezanne iza miishshe ubbaa GODAA sinththan woththiza geeshsha ukeththaa, <verse eid="EXO 39:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 39:37"/>walakay baynda worqqafe oosettida xomppe woththizasozanne izan maaran diza xomppeta, istta miishshata ubbaanne xomppe zayte, <verse eid="EXO 39:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 39:38"/>worqqafe oosettida exaane cuwasizasoza, tiyettiza zayte, sawiza exaane, Xoossa Dunkaane penge magalasha, <verse eid="EXO 39:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 39:39"/>xarqimalappe ooththida yarshizasoza, xarqimala zayzareza, iza tookkiza tooho mith, iza miishshata ubbaa, meechcha kerenne kereza iza bolla woththiza miishshata, <verse eid="EXO 39:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 39:40"/>Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuyge godaa genththiza magalashata, iza tuussata, istti eqqiza tohota, Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuyge geliza pengeta magalashata, Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuyge wodorotanne dhishketa, Xoossa Dunkaanezas koshshiza miishshata ubba; <verse eid="EXO 39:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 39:41"/>Qeeseti Geeshsha soon ooththidi may7anaas dadettida may7ota, Aarooneynne iza nayti qeeseteththan ooththishe may7iza may7ota.<verse eid="EXO 39:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 39:42"/>Isra7eele asay oosoza ubbaa GODAY Muse azazida mala ooththides. <verse eid="EXO 39:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 39:43"/>Musey oosoza xomosi xeellidi istta GODAY azazida mala ooththidayssa be7ides. Hessa gishshas Musey istta anjjides.<verse eid="EXO 39:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EXO 40"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Dunkaane Tolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 40:1"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muse, <verse eid="EXO 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 40:2"/>«Koyro aginan koyro gallas, neni Xoossa Dunkaane tola. <verse eid="EXO 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 40:3"/>Caaqo Qaala Taabotaa iza giddon woththada Taabotaza magalashan genththa. <verse eid="EXO 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 40:4"/>Xaraphpheezaa gelththada iza bolla wodhdhanaas koshshiza miishshata ubbaa iza bolla woththa. Histtada xomppeta iza bolla woththiza miishshaza soo gelththada iza bolla xomppeta woththa. <verse eid="EXO 40:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 40:5"/>Worqqafe oosettida exaane cuwasizasoza Caaqo Qaala Taabotaa sinththan woththada, Xoossa Dunkaaneza giddo geliza penge magalashaza kaqqa.<verse eid="EXO 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 40:6"/>«Xuugettiza yarsho yarshizasoza Xoossa Dunkaanezi geliza penge sinththan woththa. <verse eid="EXO 40:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 40:7"/>Izan meecettiza kereza Xoossa Dunkaanezappenne yarshizasozappe giddon woththada haaththe izan tiga. <verse eid="EXO 40:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 40:8"/>Xoossa Dunkaanezappe karera yuushsha aaththada Dunkaanezas kare bagga wuyge giigsada dubbushaa gelizason magalasha kaqqa.<verse eid="EXO 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 40:9"/>«Tiyettiza zayteza ekkada Xoossa Dunkaanezanne iza giddon dizayssa ubbaa tiya; izanne iza giddon go7ettiza miishshata ubbaa dummasa; histtiko izi geesh gidana. <verse eid="EXO 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 40:10"/>Hessafe guye xuugettiza yarsho yarshizasonne izas go7ettiza miishshaa ubbaa tiya; yarshizasoza dummasa; histtiko izi ubbaafe aadhdhida geesh gidana. <verse eid="EXO 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 40:11"/>Meechcha kerezanne kereza iza bolla woththiza miishshata tiyada istta dummasa.<verse eid="EXO 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 40:12"/>«Neni Aaroonenne iza nayta Xoossa Dunkaanezi geliza penge ehada haaththan meecca. <verse eid="EXO 40:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 40:13"/>Hessafe guye qeeseteththa may7oza Aaroone mayzada izi taas qeeseteththan ooththana mala iza tiyada dummasa. <verse eid="EXO 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 40:14"/>Iza attuma naytakka ehada qolle mayza. <verse eid="EXO 40:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 40:15"/>Istti taas qeeseteththan ooththana mala, istta aawaa tiyda mala, isttaka tiya. Istta tiyeteththankka isttanne istta yeletay wuri qeese gididi ooththana mala ta ooththana» gides.<verse eid="EXO 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 40:16"/>Musey ubbaaka GODAY bana azazida mala ooththides.<verse eid="EXO 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 40:17"/>Hessa gishshas Gibxeppe istti kezida nam7anththo layththan, koyro aginan koyro gallassan Xoossa Dunkaaney tolettides. <verse eid="EXO 40:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 40:18"/>Musey Xoossa Dunkaaneza essiza wode Dunkaaneza toho istta sohon sohon woththides; tole miththatanne tuussaa aaththides; gordiza miththatakka gelththides. <verse eid="EXO 40:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 40:19"/>Hessafe guye Musey GODAY azazida mala dunkaaneza tolidi iza bollara kama kammides.<verse eid="EXO 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 40:20"/>Histtidi tammu azazoti xaafettida masettida shuchchata efidi Taabotaza giddon woththides; tookkiza tooho miththata Taabotaan aaththides; maaroteththa kamaakka Taabotaa bolla woththides. <verse eid="EXO 40:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 40:21"/>Hessafe guye Taabotaza Xoossa Dunkaaneza giddo gelththides; genththiza magalashaa kaqqidi, GODAY azazida mala Caaqo Qaala Taabotaza kammides.<verse eid="EXO 40:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 40:22"/>GODAY Muse azazida mala, Musey xaraphpheezaza Xoossa Dunkaanezan gelththidi, magalashaappe karera hu7esora woththidi, <verse eid="EXO 40:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 40:23"/>iza bolla GODAA sinththan woththiza geeshsha uketh giigsides.<verse eid="EXO 40:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 40:24"/>GODAY Muse azazida mala, xomppe woththizasoza Xoossa Dunkaane giddo gelththidi, xaraphpheezas sinththa baggara, Xoossa Dunkaanezas tohosora woththides; <verse eid="EXO 40:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 40:25"/>qasse xomppeta GODAA sinththan oyththides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:11-16">Kessa 30:11-16</ref></char></note><verse eid="EXO 40:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 40:26"/>GODAY azazida mala, worqqafe oosettida exaane cuwasizasoza Xoossa Dunkaaneza giddo gelththidi magalashazas sinththa baggara woththidi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:24">Mato 17:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 40:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 40:27"/>iza bolla sawiza exaane cuwasides. <verse eid="EXO 40:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 40:28"/>Hessafe guye Xoossa Dunkaaneza pengen magalashaa kaqqides.<verse eid="EXO 40:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 40:29"/>Xuugettiza yarsho yarshizasoza Xoossa Dunkaane gelizaso penge achchan woththides; iza bolla xuugettiza yarshonne kaththa yarsho GODAY azazida mala yarshides.<verse eid="EXO 40:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 40:30"/>Meechcha kereza Xoossa Dunkaanezappenne yarshizasozappe giddon woththides. Histtidi meecettanaas haaththe izan tigides. <verse eid="EXO 40:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 40:31"/>Musey, Aarooneynne iza nayti ba kushenne ba toho izan meecettida. <verse eid="EXO 40:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 40:32"/>GODAY Muse azazida mala, istti Xoossa Dunkaanen geliza wode woykko yarshizaso shiiqiza wode aydekka meecetteettes.<verse eid="EXO 40:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 40:33"/>Xoossa Dunkaanen yarshizaso yuushshi aaththidi dubbusha giigsides; he dubbushaa pengen magalasha kaqqides. Hessaththo histtidi Musey oosoza polides.<verse eid="EXO 40:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Dunkaanezan Godaa Bonchcho Kumo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 9:15-23">Tay 9:15-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 40:34"/>Hessafe guye shaaray Xoossa Dunkaaneza kammides; GODAA bonchchoyka iza kumides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:10-11">1Kawo 8:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:4">Isa 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 43:4-5">Hizi 43:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 15:8">Ajju 15:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EXO 40:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 40:35"/>Shaaray Xoossa Dunkaaneza bolla uttida gishshassinne GODAA bonchchoy iza giddon kumida gishshas Musey iza giddo gelanaas dandaybeenna.<verse eid="EXO 40:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 40:36"/>Isra7eele asay ba oge ubbaan, he shaaray Xoossa Dunkaanezappe dendiza wode aydekka iza kaallidi beettes. <verse eid="EXO 40:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 40:37"/>Gido attiin he shaaray dendontta ixxiko izi dendana gallassay gakkanaas isttika qaaxxettenna. <verse eid="EXO 40:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 40:38"/>Istta oge ubbaan GODAA shaaray Isra7eele asay wuri be7ishin, gallas gallas Xoossa Dunkaane kammeessinne qamma qamma qasse tamay he shaaraa giddon eexxees.<verse eid="EXO 40:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 40"/>
</usx>
